\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit exposicio oracionis dominice collecta per venerabilem virum magistrum Nicolaum Tunckelsp\u252 \'fcel sacre theologie professorem< Si quid pecieritis patrem in nomine meo etc., Ioh.16 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (23)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sanctus Chrysostomus super illud Math. 7\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (7)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Petite et dabitur vobis dicit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tandem mereamur videre deum deorum in Syon in celesti patria. Quo nos perducat qui sine fine vivit et regnat. Amen. Et sic est finis huius oracionis dominice deo gracias etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 175\endash 179, diese Hs. 178.}

