\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Oben \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de decem preceptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  < Si quis desiderat expediri, utrum sit melius sepius an rarius corporis Christi suscipere sacramentum, videtur michi, quod ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vel pro gloria dei vel da (!) beatissima virgine Maria et ceteris. Ffinis huius tractatus et laus deo. 
