\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rubrica ista de iudiciis continuatur ad precedentibus (!) tribus modis primo secundum Goff(redum)}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et communiter alios summistas. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expeditis preparatoriis iudiciorum videndum est de iudiciis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Que quidem continuacio licet in prima conclusione domini concurrentis mei sit reprobata, tamen eam conclusionem non sequendo sic defendo continuacionem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  2v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De quo wlt deo. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dividitur hoc capitulum duobus modis secundum aliquos in duas partes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  391v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia ipso iure tunc in actu execucionis posset et ante actum revocari ut dicitur. cum fideicommissum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur Rubrica de probacionibus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic finitur prima pars lecture super secundo libro decretalium per dominum Antonium de Butrio. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , II 292\endash 293 mit Anm. 22 (diese Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt). Ausgaben: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   4174\endash 4176 u.a.}

