\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 384vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Imola}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentaria sive Lectura super Clementinis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abbates. Glosa. Summat et dividit, Clementina dividitur in duas, quia primo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  384vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... illud tollere sine causa esset contra naturalem equitatem. casus est ff. depositi l. bona fides \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Digesten 16.3.31). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis huius clementine et per consequens tocius libri Clementinarum finiti et completi. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rubrum:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini MCCCC.XXIIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   illuminata est hec lectura clementinarum per Iohannem Lodic. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (also \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lodicensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , edita a famosissimo utriusque iuris doctore domino Iohanne de Ymola, deo gracias. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Drucke: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   9142\endash 9146. BSB-Ink I-452 bis 455. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , II 298. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 241. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 N\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.381 (mit Literaturhinweisen)}

