\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 70vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Haly filius Abbas}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Theorica Pantegni Constantino Africano interpr.}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Oben \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit theorica Pantegni< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Widmung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Domino suo montis Cassinensis abbati Desiderio reverentissimo patrum patri uno tocius ordinis ecclesiastici gemme priuicenti (?) Constantinus Affricanus licet indignus, suus tamen monachus ... Cum tocius pater sciencie generalitas tres partes principales habeat, omnes enim seculares ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Hec sunt capitula primi libri< De eis que conveniunt sciri ab introducendis ... >Auctoritas Ypocratis qualis debeat esse discipulus< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorwort \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oportet eum qui medicine vult habitum optinere ut magister ab eo honoretur ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De hiis que convenit scire introducendis< Hec sunt que conveniunt sciri ab introducendis: libri intencionem, eius utilitatem, titulum, ad quem partem doctrine tendat, nomen auctoris, divisionem libri. Intencio enim nostra hic est ut ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5vb Buch II, 11ra III, 17va IV, 22ra V, 31vb VI, 37vb VII, 44vb VIII, 50rb IX, 63rb\endash va X \emdash  Endet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... secundum morbi diuturnitatem, unde acui oportet semsum (!) ad intelligendum. Explicit theorica Pantegni a Constantino edita. Deo gracias. \emdash  Laus tibi sit Christe, quoniam liber explicit iste Et qui scripseris eum gaudeat ante deum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Vers 1 auch in Paris, Arsenal, 730, f.65v). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Burnett\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ch. / D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Jacquart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Constantine the African ... The 'Pantegni' and related texts, Leiden 1994 (Studies in Ancient Medicine, 10), S.316\endash 351, diese Hs. S.325. Das Vorwort gedruckt in PL 150, 1563B\endash 1564B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   348,10f.; 1011.5}

