\pard\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 84ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes filius Serapionis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Breviarium Gerardo Cremonensi interpr. }}
\par \pard\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Tractatus primus breviarii Iohannis filii Serapionis medici. Inquid Iohannes.< Incipimus cum auxilio dei et bonitate inspirationis eius liber abreviatum in causis egritudinum et significationibus earum et ipsarum curationibus. Huius autem tractatus capitula sunt XXX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   II\u176 \'b0. Primum est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Tricesimum secundum de saltu. >Capitulum primum de calvicio et allopycia et thyria< Egritudines iste a duabus eveniunt causis, sicut optimus nos docuit Galienus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Completum est postremum aggregati ex libro medicine edictione Iohannis filii Serapionis< >Et hunc librum transtulit magister Gerardus Cremonensis in Toleto de arabico in latinum< 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Descriptio Mugith experti. Recipe euforbium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ciminata Alexandrina: Recipe curana ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pillule regis Sicilie ad visum et auditum clarificandum ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. zu W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M. p. med. f. 1 (s.XIII), f.1\endash 199v. Ed. Lyon 1525}

