\line \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Comodum gemach. Tam as (?) gar fast. Parsimonia quasi parcens monio idest cibo karckait mit der speis. Victum vel questum speis oder narung. Exedent nagent vel devorabunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Furcifero rabies wiltikait. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  13a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abstinere ad cibum pertinet, continere ad mentem. Dieta apud medicos tantum valet quantum infirmus commedere potest. Funale ain toden kercz ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Neutiquam idest nullomodo kein weg}

