\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 90va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antonius de Butrio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super quarto libro Decretalium}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Oben \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De sponsalibus et matrimoniis Rubrica< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X.4.1). \emdash  Rubrum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Materiarum libri et tituli prosequuntur. Gratianus a XXVII causa usque ad finem causarum interposito tractatu de penitenciis. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text (1ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini Amen. Postquam de rebus nunc usque spectantibus ad clericos actum est, nunc agamus de spectantibus ad laycos. Rubrica habet duas partes, in prima dicitur de sponsalibus, in secunda de matrimoniis. Circa primam partem primo videndum quid sint sponsalia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in hiis omnibus leges recipiunt correctiones per canones. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic sit finis laus et gloria sit Christo In vigilia beate virginis de Augusto (!) in Florencia M\u176 \'b0 CCC\u176 \'b0 LXXXXVII in studio Florentino, quo anno legi secundum quartum et quintum exceptis tribus ultimis titulis. Deo gracias. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit lectura quarti libri decretalium venerabilissimi necnon solempnissimi utriusque iuris doctoris Antonii de Butrio. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , II 292 mit Anm.22 (auch Clm 5582, 7582). Ausgaben: Hain 4174\endash 4176 u.a.}

