\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  370ra\endash 379va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Heimburg}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Invectiva contra Nicolaum Cusanum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur quedam solempnis concertatio eximii doctoris magistri Gregorii Heymburck contra reverendissimum in Christo patrem et dominum Nicolaum de Cusa super altricacionem (!) contra dominum generosissimum dominum ducem Sigismundum Austrie Tyrolisque hereditarium possessorem pro tempore, quo liga excommunicacionis confligebatur tota Athesis citra Alpes.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cancer Cusa Nicolae qui te cardinalem Brixinensem vocas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ad cor redi memor condicionis tue, sic prosperaberis domino propitiante etc. Datum in felicibus castris militaribus obsidien. (!) Wienne Austrie aput sanctum Marcum Idibus Augusti anno 61\u176 \'b0. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Freher/Struve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rerum germanicarum scriptores II (Stra\u223 \'dfburg 1717), 255\endash 265. Vgl. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Johanek\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , VL\u178 \'b2 III 629\endash 642, hier 638 (unter 6 Zeugen diese Hs. genannt)}

