\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  379vb\endash 380rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rudolfus de R\u252 \'fcdesheim}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Heinricum episcopum Ratisbonensem}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reverendo in Christo patri et domino domino Hainrico episcopo Ratisponensi domino et amico karissimo. Reverende pater. Post commendacionem delati sunt nobis duo fratres de Wiczsperg (!) unus Iohannes alius Lewuinus appellati moram trahentes zuo dem h\u246 \'f6fflein prope Egram in dyocesi paternitatis vestre ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et conservet altissimus. Datum Bratislavie XIa Iunii anno 1466 ad vota paternitatis vestre Rudolfus episcopus Laventinus appostolicus nuntius. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zum Verfasser vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repert. bibl. 7521\endash 7528; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repert. sent. 760. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Chevalier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repert., II 4036}

