\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 119rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus de Ancharano}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super Clementinis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rubrikentext \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De rescriptis rubrica< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  am Rand. Beginnt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abbates. Dividitur in duas partes. In prima ponitur duplex dictum, in secunda pena contrarium facientis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... capitulo ex parte in Christo. Cui decus laus honor et gloria ac potestas et imperium in secula seculorum Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cuius gracia suffragante et virginis gloriose Marie matris eius et beati Antonii scripta illa super cle(mentinis) complevi XXVIII\u176 \'b0 Marcii 1397 Bononie Ego Petrus de Ancarano utriusque iuris doctor etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit lectura domini Petri de Ancarano utriusque iuris doctoris super clementinis scripta per me Georium de Austria minimum etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   956\endash 957. Auch in Wien, Schottenstift, 5 (5) (50.a.5), f. 65\endash 160; Escorial, Bibl. del real mon. de S. Lorenzo, lat. d. I. 11}

