\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  121ra\endash 161rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antonius de Butrio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Consilia data a.1401}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ista sunt consilia d. (!) nobilis domini Anthonii de Butrio utriusque iuris doctoris in orbe famosissimi, data anno domini M\u176 \'b0CCCCI die XXVI mensis Augusti< In nomine domini Ihesu Christi ac matris eius gloriosissime virginis Marie nominibus invocatis. Visis statutis predecedentibus relegacionibus et revocacione relegacionum, et circa eas quesitis (!) iure communi actento videtur ancianos non habuisse potestatem relegaciones mutandi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  An Anciani qui relegarunt vel bannierunt seu capitaneus qui executus est possint tollere bannum vel relegacionem etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  
\line Endet 161ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ihesu Christi et matris eius gloriosissime virginis Marie invocato nomine. Prima facie videri potest revocata fore prima statuta ex vi ultimarum reformacionum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  An per novam disposicionem tollatur ius quesitum per antiquam. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  161rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et statutorum antiquorum ad obiecta - exdare (?) patet responsum. Ita dico et consulo Ego Anthonius de Butrio ... ideo scripsi et sigillavi mandavi consueto sigillo etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Drucke: Venedig 1493: HR 4179; BSB-Ink A-629; GW 5817. Rom 1472: HCR 4178; BSB-Ink A-628; GW 5816. Pavia 1494: HC 4180; GW 5818. Ferner Consilia, 1508}

