\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  161va\endash 162ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ardezinus de Novariis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Consilia duo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   
\line (1) 161va\endash vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In Christi nomine Amen. In causa Aug(usti) in Diling(is) factum sic se habet: Adversarius agit possessorio dicens se spoliatum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  An agenti possessorio obstet excepcio ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quid eciam esset fiendum ubi premissa non sufficerent. Ita videtur michi Ardezino advocato consistoriali. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) 161vb\endash 162ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Casus: quodam (?) ecclesiasticam pro ... in simul ultra mensem obtinente ... In ista materia est primo presupponendum quod si habuerunt preben(dam) ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia illi tamquam inhabili numquam fuisset ius quesitum. Ita videtur michi Ardezino de Novaris (!) advocato consistoriali}

