\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Soluto matrimonio quemadmodum dos petatur. Rubrica< Pomponius: Dotis causa semper et ubique precipua est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  90rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic finitur prima pars infortiati. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  90v (au\u223 \'dfer Notiz) leer. 91ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit liber XXIX. Incipit XXX. de legatis et fideicommissum primo< Per omnia exequata sunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  185vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in quartuor (!) partes dividantur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D 35,2,85). Bl. \emdash  185a leer. 
\line 186ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipiunt tres partes. Rubrica< Tres partes ferant legatarii ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 253vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... postliminio non sit reversus}

