\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rubrica: soluto matrimonio quemadmodum dos petatur dixit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dixit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   am Rande zugef\u252 \'fcgt)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   supra de iure do. per quos constituitur dos, nunc econtra per quos repetatur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  186ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tres patres: nec caput libri nec lex nec est \u167 \'a7 hic, sed est pars legis superioris ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 253vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... si pars her. pe. l. illud in principio. Accursius. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Siglen von Glossatoren: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  al.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (11vb), Dinus (dy. 2rb, 5va, 11vb, 176v, 118v u.\u246 \'f6.), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  f.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   123va. 
