\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  sp\u228 \'e4terer Eintrag mittig \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  PIUS II. PONT. MAX. natione Tuscus, patria Senensi, gente Piccolhominea sedit annos sex, brevis pontificatus, ingens fuit glor\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 ia, conventum Christianorum Mantu\u281 \'ea pro fide habuit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Vixit annos LVIII Menses VIIII Dies XXVII. Franciscus cardinalis Senensis avunculo sanctissimo fecit M. CCCC. LXIIII. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  15 Zeilen in humanistischer Minuskel. 
