\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 286vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iustinianus imperator}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Digestum novum (D. 39\endash 50)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Domini Iustiniani sacratissimi principis et perpetui augusti iuris enucleati ex omni veteri iure collecti Dig. seu Pandec. Explicit XXXVIII. Incipit XXXVIIII. de operis novi nunpt(iati)one (!)< Hoc edicto p(er)mittitur ut sive iure sive iniuria ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  133vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... an actio danda sit. / Explicit prima pars disgesti (!) novi. deo gratias amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  133v\endash 134v leer. 
\line 135ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit liber XLIIII. Incipit XLV. de verborum obligationibus. Rubrica< Ulpianus. Stipulatio non potest confici nisi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  286vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Servus rei publice causa abesse non potest. >Explicit secunda pars digesti novum (!) deo gratias amen< 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Textverlust zwischen 100vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  possessore posside (!) || \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Reklamant: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  possideres \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und 101ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  || deat quia alteruter se magis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  D 43,8,1\endash 43,17,3, zwischen 174vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  esse non potest sine || \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Reklamant \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und 175ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tenentur. Ulpianus. Cum querebatur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  D 46,3,77\endash 46,7,12 sowie zwischen 194vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hospitio receptus || \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Reklamant \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hec \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und 195ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  accusare quam fuerit excusatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  D 47,10,5,2\endash 48,1,5,1.}

