\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Hinterdeckel: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gratianus: Decretum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (excerptum, VII c.16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus et habetur 26 quest.7: Nota .... ...bitis ubi multis enumeratis supersticionibus sic concludit: Qui has aut quascumque divinationes aut fata aut auguria observat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Iram dei graviter in eternum incurretur, nisi ecclesiastica penitencia emendatus deo reconcilietur. Hec ex Graciano}

