\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  55v\endash 65v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Tinctoris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Copulata super Aristotelis librum de sensu et sensato}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt copulata de sensu et sensato \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  angef\u252 \'fcgt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prenominati magistri. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Marginal: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota subiectum libri de sensu et sensato est corpus sensitivum. Necessaria est consideracio eorum que in hoc libro tractantur. Probat philosophus quia in hoc libro determinatur de hiis que pertinent ad animalia et plantas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nichil ergo est sensibile et indivisibile. Est epylogus dictorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber de sensu et sensato. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grabmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.415\endash 416 (diese Handschrift)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  65v\endash 68v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Tinctoris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Copulata super Aristotelis librum de memoria et reminiscentia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit de memoria et reminiscencia. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  66r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Post librum de sensu et sensato ordinandus est liber de memoria et reminiscencia. Patet quia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  67r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et sic est finis de memoria. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De reminiscencia. Reminiscencia nichil aliud est quam resumpcio alicuius sensati quod exit a memoria ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... propter multum motum augmenti. Et sic est finis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grabmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.416 (diese Handschrift). \emdash  In W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f. 118, f.173r zweiter Teil des Initium abweichend (Lesefehler?)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  68v\endash 75r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Tinctoris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Copulata super Aristotelis librum de somno et vigilia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt copulata super librum de sompno et vigilia. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sic (!) determinandum est de duobus principaliter, scilicet de sompno et vigilia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Circa sompnum quinque sunt consideranda ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (statt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   besser mit Grabmann: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  71v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... non sanabitur homo quousque dormierit. 
\line Sequitur de sompnio. Sompnium autem non est passio sensus aut opinionis, sed est passio primi sensitivi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... illud apparicionibus fantasticis, et hoc de illo. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grabmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.416. Initium (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Sic ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) auch in W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f. 118, f.174r.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  75r\endash 77r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Tinctoris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Copulata super Aristotelis librum de longaevitate et brevitate vitae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt copulata super librum de longevitate et brevitate vite. Post librum de sompno et vigilia sequitur liber de longevitate et brevitate vite, in quo inquiruntur cause longitudinis et brevitatis vite ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Econtraria autem disposite sunt brevis vite. Et sic est finis libri de longitudine et brevitate vite. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Zwei Zeilen leer.) 
\line \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expliciunt copulata cuiusdam venerabilis magistri, magistri Iohannis Tinctoris in theologia professoris eximii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korrigiert) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super quosdam libros Aristotelis parvorum naturalium extracta ex commento venerabilis sancti Thome quondam fratris ordinis predicatorum scripta per manus Theod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [o]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rici de Alemannia cuiusdam studentis in Colonia. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 77v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grabmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.416 (diese Handschrift). In W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f. 118, f.177v}

