\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  78r\endash 124v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Tinctoris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Copulata super Aristotelis Metaphysica}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam prolixitas mater fastidii plurimumque (!) animos a fructu (!) studii avertit brevitasque eloquii modernis sit amica ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... prout unicuique convenit convenienter providens. Et sic est finis libri metaphysice Aristotelis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  In W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f. 118, f.144r\endash 167r. Wien, Dominikanerkonvent, 21/21, f.139\endash 185. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grabmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.416f. (gibt die Einleitung nach dieser Hs.)}

