\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  124v\endash 137v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Tinctoris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Copulata super Aristotelis librum de generatione et corruptione}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber Aristotelis cum quibusdam dictis super librum de generacione et corrupcione. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [V]arie fuerunt opiniones antiquorum circa genus generacionis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quia quidam ponunt differenciam generacionis et alteracionis, quidam non. Nam hii ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quare non contingit esse in eodem generato ex quo generatur. Et sic est finis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expliciunt copulata super librum de generacione et corrupcione naturalis (!) philosophi scripta per manus Theod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [o]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rici de Alema(nn)ia. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grabmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.417. In W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f.118, f.179sqq}

