\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  297rb\endash 298vb{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Gregorius Flogel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancta Anna}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de sancta Anna. Non est talis mulier super terra in aspectu, in pulchritudine et in sensu verborum, Iudith XI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (19)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Karissimi, philosophus IIII\u176 \'b0 Ethicorum dicit, quod ad magnificum virum pertinet expensas facere secundum quod res valet; unde si res est preciosa et magna, quod tunc faciat expensas magnas et si parva parvas. Unum est, ut dicit philosophus ibidem, quod ista sunt magna et preciosa que deos tangunt; unde probat ibi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... propter has virtutes merito est honoranda et veneranda, ymmo et invocanda, ut eius meritis et precibus vitam eternam consequamur, quam nobis concedat pater et filius et spiritus sanctus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de sancta Anna collectus per fratrem Gregorium Flogel lectorem et predicatus per eundem in die sancti Iacobi in conventu Augustensi anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 LVto. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite und f.299\endash 300 leer. \emdash  25. Juli 1455. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Text erw\u228 \'e4hnt von H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rosenfeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Das Oberaltaicher Vadomori-Gedicht von 1446 und Peter von Rosenheim, in: Mittellateinisches Jahrbuch 2, 1965, 190\endash 204, hier 190}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  301ra\endash 350vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus super Faciamus hominem }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Faciamus hominem ad ymaginem et similitudinem nostram, Genesis secundo capitulo, qui presit piscibus maris et volatilibus celi, Gen. 2\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1, 26)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Verbum istud fuit dei patris ad filium et spiritum sanctum secundum magistrum 3\u176 \'b0 Sentenciarum, cum hominem facere voluit prelatum omnium creaturarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed si sunt non prelati, sed monstra merito debent appellari etc. Finitus est iste liber quinto die Idus Maii anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 XI\u176 \'b0 etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Datierung aus Vorlage \u252 \'fcbernommen; vermutlich Abfassungszeit des Predigtbuchs. In Predigtform. \u214 \'d6fter mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Audivistis heri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eingeleitet. Von Gregorius Flogel geschrieben. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  351ra\endash 355va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus de Ilperinis Romanus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De praedestinatione divina (tractatus brevior) }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Libellus de predestinacione sanctorum. \emdash  In nomine domini nostri Ihesu Christi amen. Libellus de predestinacione sanctorum editus a fratre Feliciano ordinis predicatorum incipit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Adresse \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Venerabili in Christo patri domino Iacobo eterni regis gracia episcopo Reatino Ffelicianus de ordine predicatorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorrede \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iuxta vestre paternitatis mandata de predestinacione divina opusculum de libris utriusque testamenti, de libris doctorum et sanctorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  351rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quia omnis predestinacio et determinacio incipi debet a nomine ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut in presenti simus in numero electorum et in futuro in numero beatorum; quod nobis prestare dignetur dei filius Ihesus Christus qui est in secula seculorum benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Geschrieben von Gregorius Flogel. \emdash  355vb und 356\endash 357 leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr. 3252 Fassung b (mit dieser Hs., auch in Clm 3556). Gedruckt in Augsburg nicht nach 1476 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   6950). }

