\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  214r\endash 245r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus de Ancona}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus super Missus est}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Assit ad inceptum beata virgo Maria mecum. Sequitur tractatus super Missus est egregii doctoris Augustini de Ankona de ordine heremitarum sancti Augustini, qui quidem questionaliter in predicto negocio procedit. Circa angelicam salutacionem: Quatuor michi timorem ac tremorem faciunt loqui de virgine gloriosa, scilicet proprie nature infirmitas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ita suis piis ac devotis precibus in hora mortis nostre acquirat salvatorem. Amen. Explicit lectura fratris Augustini de Ankona eximii doctoris sacre theologie super missus est scripte (!) per fratrem Gregorium Flogel Babenberge anno domini 1449, finite (!) feria IIa Reminiscere. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite leer. \emdash  Mit gliedernden Marginalia einer Hand des 15.Jh.s. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  GW 3049. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9p., 409i. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, 1547. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.136. Siehe zu Berlin, Theol. lat. qu. 315, f.173r\endash 238v; Frankfurt, Ms. Praed. 126, f.181r\endash 267v}

