\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  245v\endash 247v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones duo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  a) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Descendi in ortum meum ut viderem poma, Canticorum VI\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (10)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Volens rem perditam invenire, debet eam querere ubi perdita est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  246v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Quarto per incarnacionem facit nos fructificare poma ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  b) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Venit Ihesus et stetit, Ioh. XX et Luce ultimo. Non agnoscitur in bonis amicus, unde tempore prosperitatis quandoque se offert falsus et fictus amicus sicut verus et certus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... usque ad mortem certa pro iusticia.etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  a) Iacobus de Lausanna: Avignon, Bibl. du Mus. Calvet, 304, f.150, und 608, f.175. \emdash  b) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Non agnoscitur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Vigilius Tapsensis (?): Paris, BN, lat. 2034, f.157v (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lauer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   II 288); mehrfach als Proverbium seit Gregor d.Gr. (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Unde bene quidam sapiens dicit: non agnoscitur in bonis amicus et non absconditur in malis inimicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )}

