\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  79ra\endash 148rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iustinianus imperator}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tres libri (Codicis lib. X\endash XII)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Domini Iustiniani sacratissimi principis Explicit liber VIIII. incipit X. de iure fisci. R+< Si prius quam fisci rationibus pater vester obligaretur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Glosse \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  R+. De iure fisci. Occasione criminum de quibus libro superiori dixit augetur fiscus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Buch XI beginnt f.103ra, XII 123vb. \emdash  Endet 148rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... vexatione quatietur (!). deo gratias. / Explicit testus (!) trium librorum codicis. Deo gratias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Glosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Offitium idest dicti iudices cum suis officialibus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Glossen, z.T. mit Sigle (f.79r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  z\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \emdash  f.148v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zu Accursius: Ed. Corpus iuris civilis glos. 5 pars 2b (vgl. Vat. lat. 1433, f.71ra\endash 129vb)}

