\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  149ra\endash 276vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iustinianus imperator}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Authenticum (Collationes I\endash IX)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In nomine domini Ihesu Christi de heredibus et falcidia. Constitutio prima: Si heres legata solvere noluerit. Incipit constitutio prima (?) imperatoris Iustiniani a. Iohanni pape secundo. Rubrica< Occupatis nobis cura (!) totius rei publice curas et parum (!) nichil eligentibus cogitare ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Novellen 1\endash 23. 105. 33\endash 34. 39. 44. 46. 48. 47. 51\endash 56. 49. 58. 60\endash 61. 63. 67. 71. 70. 69. \emdash  f.215vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit prima pars testus autentici. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Novellen 74. 72. 73. 76\endash 85. 88\endash 90. 92. 94. 91. 95\endash 100. 98. 93. 107\endash 112. 116. 114\endash 115. 117\endash 120. 125. 124. 131. 127. 159. 134. 86. 106. 132. 150. 128. 123. \emdash  f.276vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... omnia custodiri provideat. / Explicit liber auctenticorum}

