\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Rubrica< Incipiunt: quidam habent aliter rubricam, scilicet ita: quibus modis feudum acquiratur et retineatur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  279rb am Spaltenende: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominus Accursius doctor doctorum legis legum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet f.305rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... per leges Romanas et Longobardas unde quasi glosulas reputo usque in finem. Iacobus Columbi(ni). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Am Rande: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fi. VIII. pe. de usibus feu. - cor. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. Vat. lat. 1432, f.234ra-254rb. K. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lehmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Lehnrecht, S.12 ("mit Glosse des Jac. Columbi [II/58 nicht glossiert]"). U. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gualazzini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , I \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Libri feudorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   e il contributo di Accursio alla loro sistemazione e alla loro \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Glossa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Atti Accursiani II 577-596}

