\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 90vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iustinianus imperator}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Institutiones}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Auf oberem Rand nachgetragen die Rubrik \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Imperator Cesar Flavius ... cupide legum iuve(ntuti). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit liber institutionum domini Iustiniani sacratissimi principis iuris enucleati perpetui augusti< Imperatoriam maiestatem non solum armis decoratam sed etiam legibus oportet esse armatam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... gubernare. De iustitia et iure. Iustitia est constans et perpetua voluntas ius suum cuique tribuens. Iuris prudentia est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Buch II beginnt f.13va, III 40r, IV 63v. \emdash  Endet 90vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... eorum scientia vobis ex latioribus digestorum sive pandectarum libris deo propitio adventura est; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  daneben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber institutionum deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Folgt in 4 Spalten ein Rubrikenverzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De iustitia et iure ... De publicis iudicibus (!).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

