\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1ra\endash 90rb){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Accursius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Glossa ordinaria in Institutiones Iustiniani }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini nostri Ihesu Christi. Ex hoc nota quod Christianus fuit, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u252 \'fcber der Zeile)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   non posset imperare idest impii iuris dictionem exercere ... Iusticia est constans etc. secundum hoc omnia verba in ea \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ea \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  corr.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   posita sunt plana ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Einschub nach \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iusticia:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hec iusticia diffinitio potest intelligi de divisa iusticia. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 90vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Adventura: ut ff. de publicis iudicibus (!) usque ad titulum de appellationibus. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2. Rezension der Glosse (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Weigand\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Naturrechtslehre 70 Anm.22, 89 Anm.16, 113 Anm.18) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Drucke der Glosse: GW 7581 u.\u246 \'f6. Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dydynski, Weigand, Dolezalek}

