\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 157va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Trevet}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expositio in Boethium de consolatione philosophiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit prohemium super librum consolacionis Boecii< Explanacionem librorum de consolacione philosophica aggressurus votis quorundam fratrum satisfaciens ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Prologus sive introduccio applicandi decenter intencionem ad propositum< Consolaciones tue letificaverunt animam meam, Psalmo 93\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (19)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Inter letitari (!) et letificari hic (!) interesse videtur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3va Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Carmina: volens igitur Boecius agere de consolacione philosophica primo inducit personam tam consolacione indigentem quam consolacionem affectantem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Buch II 34rb, III 58vb, IV 101ra, V 135ra. \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... iudicis cernentis cuncta qui est deus noster; cui sit gloria in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Expliciunt explanaciones quinque librorum Boecii de consolacione philosophie< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr. 3143 (mit dieser Handschrift). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Courcelle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La Consolation, S.413. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La facult\u233 \'e9 des arts, S.264}

