\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  275ra\endash 277vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Glossa super Pater noster}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pater: Sanctus Thomas: Pater non dominus, quia amari appetit non timeri. Crisostomus: Patrem se magis dici voluit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hec oracio potissime ex intellectu et affectu dicenda est etc. >Explicit glosa super Pater noster etc.< 
