\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  97va\endash 99ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De dilectione dei et proximi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Nr.1) Gossembrot oben \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de dilectione dei et proximi et decem mandatis dei vide sequenti vertendo folio, vacat hic inceptum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Beginnt {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [S]cribitur Math. XXII, quod cum quidam legislator doctor interrogasset dominum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dicens: Magister, quod est mandatum magnum in lege, respondens ei dominus dixit: Dilige dominum deum tuum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... a captivitate dyaboli eripuit, ab eterna dampnacione nos liberavit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig). Wiederholung des Textes von 100ra\endash 101va. Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.167. \emdash  97r leer. \emdash  99r und 99v Noten }

