\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  137vb\endash 189ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De decem praeceptis decalogi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur ssna (summa?) omnium preceptorum moralium et aliorum (?) sparsim in sacra scriptura positorum< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr.1 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Precepta sunt multiplicia propter precepta legis nature communia ut sunt ista: Omne bonum est faciendum, nullum malum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed hoc faciut suave, quoniam ipsorum est regnum celorum, quod et nobis largire dignetur ... etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  140vb Nr.2, 145rb Nr.3, 154vb Nr.4, 160rb Nr.5, 167va Nr.6, 170va Nr.7, 175rb Nr.8, 178vb Nr.9, 183vb Nr.10, 187ra Nr.11, 188va Nr.12 \emdash  Endet 189ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... digna premio glorie sempiterne, ad quam nos perducere dignetur sancta trinitas et divisa unitas, pater ... Amen. Explicit etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Mit marginalen Noten Gossembrots (zu Gliederung und Inhalt). \emdash  Rest von 189r und 189v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nicolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S.169\endash 174 (Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt S.172)}

