\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  190ra\endash 224vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De tribus punctis poenitentiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Tractatus de tribus partibus (!) penitencie magistri Nycolay de Dinkelspuhel< Ecce nunc tempus acceptabile, 2\u176 \'b0 Cor. 6\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Duo sunt tempora hominis unum iusticie, quam incipit in hominis morte ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr.2 192va, Nr.3 193ra, Nr.4 196va, Nr.5 198ra, Nr.6 200vb, Nr.7 202va, Nr.8 204rb, Nr.9 208vb, Nr.10 210rb, Nr.11 211ra, Nr.12 214vb, Nr.13 218rb, Nr.14 220ra, Nr.15 222vb \emdash  Endet 224vb normal, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit tractatus de tribus partibus penitencie Magistri Nycolay de Dinkelszpuchel anno domini 1444< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest von 224vb leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.180\endash 186 (Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt S.184)}

