\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Weylheimer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Inhaltsangabe Quadragesimale Iohannis episcopi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Introducciones ewangeliorum per quadragesimam per quadraginta mansiones filiorum Israel. Tractatus de decem plagis Egyptiorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Darunter Herkunftsvermerk (siehe oben)}

