\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2ra\endash 296va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Episcopus de Sieghartskirchen}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quadragesimale }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Receperunt mercedem suam Mt. 6\u176 \'b0 capitulo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (5)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Licet karissimi teste ewangelista dignus sit quilibet mercenarius mercede sua, nulla tamen merces prompcior est quam peccatorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... eius gloria et doctrina per sequentes lecciones intelliguntur seu insinuantur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und die folgenden Bl. leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , III 465-467 Nr.1\endash 48 (diese Hs.); auch in: Graz, Bibl. des Minoriten Konvents, s.n. , s.XV, f.4\endash 276v (vgl. 'In principio'); Klosterneuburg, Stiftsbibl., 557, f.1\endash 289 (endet hier aber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  exultet iam angelica turba celorum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Zu Iohannes Bischoff OFM siehe VL\u178 \'b2 I 876\endash 878, und jetzt Chr. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Roth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Wie not des ist, daz die frummen layen selber p\u252 \'fccher habent.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Zum Predigtzyklus des Johannes Bischoff aus Wien (Anfang 15. Jahrhundert), in: ZfdA 130, 2001, S.19\emdash 57, diese Hs. S.20f., 41f. (jeweils mit Anm.).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  300ra\endash 302ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Episcopus (?)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Predigtanleitung und -material}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si volueris a dominica palmarum continuare per ebdomadam penosam A. (?), capias thema finem ewangelii Benedictus qui venit sive in fine huius folii in alio latere continetur qualiter benedictus Christus ut rex hodie venit. In secunda feria ut bonus consiliator dicit gesta eiusdem diei verso folio. In tercia feria regressus venit ut corrector quasi virga discipline ad eucharistiam indispositis dic que tunc gessit; infra post versionem folii et tunc valedixit per illud Non videbitis me donec dicatis Benedictus. Vel pro omnibus illis recipe thema Ecce rex tuus venit tibi mansuetus ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  300va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Divisione Christi ab eis et oracione triplici ... Dominus Landolfus (!) Karthusiensis Argentine notat in 2\u176 \'b0 suo libro de vita Christi ordinem operum Christi per ebdomadam penosam incipiens ab ewangelio ante sex dies pasce ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  300vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iterum rediit Bethaniam etc. ... Iterum regressus pharizeis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed pro XXXta denariis recepit triginta maledicciones; numera ro... (?) laudem}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  312vb\endash 313va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones theologicae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   
\line \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Queritur, in qua etate debeat quis ieiunare quadragesimam et alia ieiunia per ecclesiam indicta ... Quero, si aliquis abstinet per totam diem et non comedit, numquid ieiunat .... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  usw. 
\line Schlie\u223 \'dft 313rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Utrum aliquis peccet cognoscendo uxorem propriam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Iohannes Andree 1. Item secundum Ieronimum cum quis est ardencior adulter, in suam graviter peccat secundum racionem dominice p(?). }

