\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  313va\endash 329ra{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Iohannes Episcopus (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Introductiones evangeliorum per quadragesimam}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipiunt introducciones ewangeliorum per quadragesimam per quadraginta mansiones filiorum Israel< Cum ieiunatis etc., Mt. VI\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Cum dicat apostolus de populo antiquo sive de patribus veteris testamenti, quod omnia in figura contingebant illis ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  314va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Feria quinta< Cum introisset Ihesus in Capharnaum accessit ad deum (!) centurio etc., Mt. 8 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (5)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Hesterna die in prima mansione actum est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Cum autem Christus apparuit etc. 
\line Et sic est finis harum quadraginta mansionum brevissime summulatarum que sic simpliciter introducte sunt, ut si cui placet materiam dilatare valeat. Pro quo laus deo omnipotenti Christoque eius filio nostro eductori spirituique clementi nostro glorificatori, qui unus simplex deus regnat in evum, nunc et semper benedictus. Amen.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  329ra\endash 343ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collatio de decem plagis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Collacio de decem plagis< Plaga tumens non est circumligata nec curata medicamine nec fota oleo, Ysaie primo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Qui hanc materiam voluerit predicare per adventum domini, poterit assumere thema illud Exodi 3\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (7)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Vidi affliccionem populi ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Endet 341ra mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Decima plaga et ultima qua affligebantur Egipcii fuit mors primogenitorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  341vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in terram promissionis idest eternam beatitudinem, in quam nos perducat ipse verus agnus Ihesus Christus qui cum patre ... est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schlu\u223 \'dfst\u252 \'fcck 341vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quicumque vellet breviter illas plagas predicare in uno sermone posset accipere illud verbum Dominus vulnerat et medetur, Iob ultimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (5,18)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Vulnerat per plagas, sanat per precepta ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et finis est preceptorum. Et sic patent ista precepta, quomodo adaptari possunt ad decem plagas Egipciorum etc. >Et sic est finis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Darunter, in kleinerer Schrift, hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  No. m. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)}

