\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  428va{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Iuristische Noten (in Glossenschrift)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circa materiam de collationibus nota, quod peculium castrense ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (35 Zeilen), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Super l. filie lic(et) codice de coll.< Quero an libri scolarium sint conferendi. ad quod est notandum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (67 Zeilen) \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... debent similiter non conferri. Cynus. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Notata quaedam (possessoris) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCC\u176 \'b0 LXXIX et (?) die XX \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (dar\u252 \'fcber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que fuit die[s] Sabati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mensis Augusti abui (!) ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  darunter: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  recessit Girardus apud Avinionem die Veneris que erat dies XXVIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (oder \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  XVIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mensis maij \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Wochentagsangabe unstimmig f\u252 \'fcr Freitag 18./28.5.1379)}

