\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  82r\endash 83v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exemplum contra proprietarios}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Contra proprietarios< Legitur in vitas patrum quod quidam senior dixit cuidam iuniori negligenti, qui peciit ut pro se oraret: Impossibile est dyabolum a te discedere aliis pro te orantibus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ad quintum et ultimum quod eciam mala voluntas dici potest ... quia secundum voluntatem vadit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. Soest, StB, Cod. 17, f.100ra ('Legitur in vitas patrum quod quidam')}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  83v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Entwurf einer Entschuldigungsrede an den Konvent}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Venerabiles in Christo patres. Sicut reverencia et caritas vestra ultra annum licet multum (?) emeritum me fovit in vestra utique laudabili congregacione, sed quia intendo me recipere ad gremium monasterii, in quo me stabilivi voto meo, deberem regraciari paternitatibus vestris, sed recognosco me omnino insufficientem. Ergo peto humiliter quatinus velitis largitorem omnium habere et graciatorem et parvitatem voluntatis mee pro facto. Eciam recognosco quod multum offendi verbo et facto laudabilem conventum et singulos patres meos. Qua propter supplico instantissime reverenciis vestris michi indulgere et recommendo me vestris precibus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  In kleinerer Schrift am Seitenende angef\u252 \'fcgt}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  84r\endash 155v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones super oratione dominica}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermones egregii doctoris magistri Nicolai de Dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel super oracione dominica. Ihesus Christus< Si quid pecieritis patrem in nomine meo dabit vobis, Ioh.16 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (23)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sanctus Chrysostomus super illud Math. 7\u176 \'b0 Petite et dabitur vobis dicit ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  91v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo secundus magistri Nicolai in exposicione oracionis dominice scilicet Pater noster< Sic ergo vos orabitis, Mt. 6\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Circa orationem tria principaliter possunt suboriri ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  99v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo tercius magistri Nicolai super Pater noster< Pater noster qui es in celis, ubi supra. Oracio que dominus et salvator noster voluit per discipulos suos et per alios fideles suos deum rogari ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  104r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo quartus magistri Nicolai super Pater noster< Sanctificetur nomen tuum. In priori parte dictum est quis sit qui petitur ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  109v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo quintus ...< Adveniat regnum tuum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 6,10)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Secunda particula secunde partis principalis dominice oracionis que fideles ad celestis regni statum orando spirant ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  114r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Item sermo sextus magistri Nicolai super Pater noster< Fiat voluntas tua sicut in celo et in terra. Est tertia particula secunde partis principalis illius dominice oracionis ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  120r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo septimus ...< Panem nostrum cottidianum etc. Quarta particula secunde partis principalis ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  127r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et dimitte nobis debita nostra sicut et nos dimittimus debitoribus nostris. Beatus Ciprianus continuando hanc quintam particulam ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  135v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et ne nos inducas in temptacionem. Post peticionem qua deum rogamus ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  144r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sed libera nos a malo. In illa ultima particula petimus ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  146v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et quia superius dictum fuit in principio exposicionis illius oracionis dominice, quod octava condicio requisita ad exaudibilitatem oracionis est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... tandem mereamur videre deum deorum in Syon idest in celesti patria. Quo nos perducat qui cum patre et sancto spiritu vivit et regnat unus deus in secula benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Marginale Noten und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen 96v,128v\endash 129v, 146r. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 177\endash 180. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initien: N.v.D. Nr.246\endash 247, 249\endash 257}

