\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  156r\endash 158r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Edificate michi domum et erit acceptabilis michi, Aggei primo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1,8)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Augustinus: Quociens altaris vel templi festivitatem colimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... indignos et malos ibi contempnit. De quibus Iohannis III\u176 \'b0: Eiecit de templo vendentes et ementes oves et boves ... et mensas subbvertit. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Uppsala, UB, C 77, f.55; C 277, f.192v. Graz, UB, 578, f.200v. Budapest, Orsz\u225 \'e1gos Sz\u233 \'e9ch\u233 \'e9nyi K\u246 \'f6nyvt\u225 \'e1r, 98, f.156.}

