\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  158v\endash 160v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancto Udalrico}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Thesaurus desiderabilis et oleum in habitaculo iusti, Proverb. XXXI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 21,20)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Gregorius: Iustorum vita quasi quedam forma nobis imitanda preponitur ... unde debeant imitari; sic ille sanctus pater Udalricus in verbis istis commendatur de sanctitate vite eius et preponitur nobis tamquam exemplar imitandum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... tranquilla iocunditas, felix eternitas, eterna beatitudo. Quam nobis prestare dignetur qui vivit in eterna secula seculorum. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Rest der Seite und folgendes Bl. (160a) leer. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  161r\endash 164r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo in dedicatione ecclesiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie salus huic domui facta est, Luc. 19 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sicut domus secularium edificatur propter salutem corporum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in Psalmo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (30,3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Esto michi in deum protectorem et in domum refugii ut salvum me facias hic per graciam et in futuro per gloriam, ad quam etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  164r\endash 168r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Elegi et sanctificavi locum istum, 2\u176 \'b0 Paralip. 7\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Licet deus sit ubique per suam essenciam presenciam et potenciam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad secundum et subiungit et locum habitacionis glorie tue. Ad quam gloriam nos perducat qui regnat deus cum sanctis perhenniter.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  168v\endash 170r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce sacerdos magnus, Eccli. 44 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 44,16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In verbis propositis tria inteligimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo ergo ille magnus pontifex demonstratur ibi 'Ecce', secundo demonstratus commendatur ibi 'Magnus' ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ideo consulitur nobis Eccli. 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (33)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Agonizare pro iusticia usque ad mortem. quod nobis prestare dignetur etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Mit \u228 \'e4hnlichem Initium z.B. Graz UB, 1423, f.2r. Vgl. auch unten zu f.174v.}

