\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  170v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Neidhart von Reuenthal}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liebesgedicht}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Der arge winter wil von hinn dy bl\u252 \'fcmelin auf der haide dy sind gel prawn vnde rot ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... bey jm beleiben. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Hg. von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Keinz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Germania 15, 431f. Hs. ber\u252 \'fccksichtigt in der Ausgabe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wiessner/Sappler/Fischer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , T\u252 \'fcbingen 1984, hier S.XIV: Sigle m. Vgl. D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Boueke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Materialien zur Neidhart-\u220 \'dcberlieferung, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1967 (MTU 16), S.39}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  171r\endash 173r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de apostolis Petro et Paulo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Saul et Ionathas amabiles et decori in vita sua et in morte quoque non sunt separati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (dar\u252 \'fcber:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   divisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Verba ista scripta sunt in 2\u176 \'b0 Reg. 1\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II Reg. 1,23)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et dicebat ea David ad litteram ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sicut isti beati apostoli fuerunt mirabiles in sua passione, ita sunt sublimes in eterna retribucione. Cuius nos participes eficiat (!) qui sine fine vivit et regnat. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest von 173r leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Eichst\u228 \'e4tt SB, cod. 417, f.268ra\endash 269ra. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  173v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notiz zu einer Predigt auf den Hl. Ulrich}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex hoc eris homines capiens, Luc. XV\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Lc 5,10)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ista possunt esse verba Christi ad patrem sancti Udalrici, prole (!) iam nato et ablactato eo bonum prolis intendebant 4\u176 \'b0 Sentenciarum II. distinccione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Sent. IV 31,2,4)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Deus ut enim ut dicitur Actuum X\u176 \'b0. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 174r leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  174v\endash 178v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancto Udalrico}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce sacerdos magnus qui in diebus suis placuit deis (?), Eccl. 44 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 44,16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In verbis propositis tria notantur: primo iste magnus pontifex demonstratur, 2\u176 \'b0 commendatur, 3\u176 \'b0 probatur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... propter nostros excessus iuste inciderimus. Ubi nunc gaudet (?) in regno eternitatis, quo nos perducere dignetur virginis filius. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Verwertet eine Vita sancti Udalrici. \u196 \'c4hnliches Thema oben f.168v\endash 170r}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  179r\endash 182r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de beata Afra martyre}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In terra deserta aparui (!) tibi ut viderem virtutem tuam et gloriam tuam, Psalmo 62\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Verba possunt esse Christi ad beatam Afram eo quod eam paganam et ydolis servientem fenerisque (!) deditam ad fidem ac martirium ei per gracie sue largicionem apparendo vocavit. Sunt enim multi modi vocacionis divine gracie ad convivium celeste ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Tota vero corde amanda sunt ac omni diligencia querenda spiritualia ut eis mereamur celestia perpetuo duratura, que nunc possidet beatissima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  beata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  gestrichen)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   nostra martir Afra}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  182r\endash 183r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Narratio de miraculo sancti Udalrici}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1453}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 ) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad honorem omnipotentis dei ac sui almi confessoris Uodalrici. Noverint tam presentes quam futuri quod anno a partu virginis milesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo tercio secunda feria post sacrum pentecosten venit ad sepulchrum sepe dicendi confessoris Udalrici vir quidam canicie venerandus ac mirifica quedam narravit elemosinario nostro. A quo ad custodem, postea ad seniores deductus obtestatusque, ne quid diceret nisi verum nec putaret sanctum dei se placaturum mendacio, qui deo veritate dinoscitur placuisse. Ad quam obtestacionem respondit se per illum veritatem dicturum, qui est veritas et vita, et nullomodo dicturum se aliquid quod in sua patria non pluribus testibus posset fulcire; maxime cum ex perniciositate mendacii nil emolumenti caperet nisi proprie salutis disspendium (!). Narravit ergo sequencia, que utcumque scripsi non alias profutura, nisi ut ad tempus eruantur ab oblivionis interitu. Ceterum is qui hoc lecturus est ob mercedem eterne retribucionis emendet ac luculencius exprimat. Iudicia domini abyssus multa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Ps. 35,7)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ait vir ille secundum cor dei. Quod etsi in multis cottidie cernitur rebus, tamen nostris id temporibus valde mirabiliter potest pensari ac cum dolore perpendi. Hoc dico de inclito regno Bohemie, ubi ut seniores tradunt, fuere optimi Christiani, facti nunc proch dolor pessimi heretici ac non solum heresim detestandam sapiunt ac deffendunt, sed furiosa mente ac tirannica pravitate ecclesiam dei ac sponsam immaculatam, postquam sciderunt (!) errore, persecuntur gladio. Nam ipsi Hussite ab heresiarcha Husso, ne ita dicti e propriis finibus hostili manu erumpentes, vastantes omnia, villas incendentes, civitates destruentes et fugientibus cunctis pre timore cuncta diripientes perveniunt ad villam nuncupatam Sincistat in diocesi Arentesi (?) seu Eystetensi sitam. Habitabat autem tunc ibidem vir laudabilis fama dictus Albertus Smid, qui ut eos vidit una cum ceteris vicinis suis iniit fugam ac in uno moncium stetit volens videre finem sueque habitacionis flammas. Cumque ipsi Bohemi villam intrassent habitatoribus vacuam reperissent, consueta sevicia habitacula incendunt cuncta. Cumque hoc predictus Albertus Smid videret ac ipsos id circa suam edem attemptare velle conspiceret, iamiamque faces applicare, cordetenus ingemiscens conversusque ad deum suumque confessorem Udalricum, suam habitacionem eidem committens, inquiens: O sancte presul dei! O mee paupertatis pius hactenus adiutor! Ecce iam tempus tribulacionis, sis presidium piumque solamen famuli tui custodiendo mee miserie domum, venturum me enim polliceor ad tuam ecclesiam cum oblacione cere. Qui ut fiducialiter peciit fideliter inpetravit. Nam uno attemptante ac ignem supponente mox ignis mutato mirum in modum colore flaviusque factus cucurrit per nidum murilegi usque ad domus fastigium nec offuit (!) protegente eandem domum merita inclita patris Udalrici. Secundo id attemptante cessit ut prius. Tercio similiter. Tunc unus alterius cepit increpare inerciam ac omnes clamare: Heus heus incende incende. Tunc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  cod.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   illud in simul attemptantes usque ad terciam eciam vicem; confusi tandem recesserunt ac intactam domiculam contra suam voluntatem reliquerunt. Unde predictus Albertus memor voti sui cum oblacione cere transivit ad ecclesiam in Renbach ibique in ecclesia que dedicata exstat in honore sancti Udalrici ac sancti Egidii grates deo sanctoque eius immensas exsolvit. \emdash  Hic Albertus pater fuit viri illius qui nobis presens predicta enarravit. Qui Cuonradus Smid vocitatur cognomen trahens cum devocione ad sanctum Vodalricum a patre ut sequencia elucidabunt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Rest von 183r und 183v\endash 183c\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   leer. }

