\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  287va\endash 293va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Arnoldus de Seehusen}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestio 7. in librum IV. Sententiarum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Nota hic quod questio sequens debet sequi inmediate post primas duas questiones de penitencia, quas sequitur illud dubium de proprio sacerdoti (!), scilicet utrum quilibet teneatur confiteri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quem dicit esse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  gestrichen)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   proprio sacerdoti etc. et est de lectura Arnoldi sicud et cetere questiones usque ad finem quarti libri.< Consequenter queritur circa materiam de penitencia utrum opera satisfactoria in foro penitencie ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... invito domino volente inordinate; et tantum de illo dubio et de tota illa questione}

