\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  175r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Radulphus archiepiscopus Cantuariensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de beata Maria virgine}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Episcopi Cantuariensis super Omelya de assumptione beate virginis< Quid ad gloriosam virginem Mariam lectio ista pertineat ut in festivitate eius assumpcionis legatur plerique solent querere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Erst dann das Thema \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Intravit Ihesus in quoddam castellum ... secundum Lucam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (19,30)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Omelia Anselmi episcopi. / In scriptura sacra res una et eadem locutionis invenitur diversa significare ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Cuius et nos participes sumus (!) meritis et precibus eius per Ihesum Christum ... qui vivit ... in seculorum secula benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Marginalnote Gossembrots s.o. \emdash  Leer 176\endash 186. 187\endash 188 ausgerissen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: PL 158, c.644\endash 699}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

