\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  249r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Franciscus Petrarca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Clementem Sextum (Fam., V 19)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De emperico (!) et procaci medico. Franciscus Petrarcha< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Titel von Gossembrots Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Febris tue nuncius beatissime pater tremorem menbris meis et terrorem attulit. Nec idcirco blandiloquens aut similis dicam illo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... si tecum egrotantem ecclesiam salvam cupis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (37 Zeilen) \emdash  Zu Anfang am Rand von Gossembrot \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Valde indiget correctione. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Vom folgenden nicht abgetrennt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: Le Familiari II, 43\endash 45 ed.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Rossi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  Wie der folgende Text auch in der Schedel-Handschrift Clm 249, f.118r}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  249r\endash 272v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Franciscus Petrarca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Invective contra medicum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quisquis es qui iacentem calamum et ut ita dixerim sopitum leonem importunis latratibus excitasti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  253v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... novis erroribus extinxerunt. etc. Sequitur liber secundus. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Habes unde michi perpetuo gracias agas, de muto et elingui argutulus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  259v [A]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut ego fallor Yppocras (!) et Aristoteles secunde ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  267r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sciens gratissimam michi partem maledictorum tuorum ad ultimum reservavi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... lacessito faveas, lacescentem oderis et valeas precor. Deo laudes. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circa fontem Acheruntis vitulus depastus est / Non intravit sed rigavit, queritur quid iura (!) sit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  In Abschnitte eingeteilt. \emdash  Rest der Seite und 273r leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ricci \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (ed.), Francesco Petrarca. Invective..., 25\endash 98. Text mitsamt der Schlu\u223 \'dfverse in Clm 249, f.118r\endash 141r (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sottili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Nr. 92).}

