\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  278r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Versus et tractatus de coloribus rhetoricis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De coloribus rhethoricis quibusdam prolongandi materiam< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  a) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nunc capias flores qui pulcros dant tibi mores / In circum op \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  con\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   gestrichen)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et a pro di di con ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  b) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sexti sunt partes brevitatis emphasis artus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... uncto discedat leta pars communibus edat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vdat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   korr., Abbruch).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kommentar zu a) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sextus modus est digressio. Et est consequens ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  zu b) beginnt in Spaltenmitte 278ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In metris predictis ostendit magister modos abbreviandi materiam epistolarem. Absolucio primus modus abbreviandi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  278rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... compendiumque simul et prolixa solet abbreviare etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Leer 278v\endash 285. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Jaffe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.277 ('a brief treatise')}

