\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  307r\endash 333r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Plutarchus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vita Aristidis et Catonis Francisco Barbaro interprete}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Anfang des Vorworts fehlt nach Ausri\u223 \'df von Bl. 304 und 305 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  // nensi communi preceptori nostro quo hospite. Non enim verebor quod sencio dicere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... facile iudicabis. Explicit prohemium feliciter. Aristides Lysimachy filius ex Anthiochi de tribu et populo Alopeteno ortus est. De cuius fortunis ac facultatibus penes scriptores magna varietas est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  319v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... digna iudicatur. Explicit Aristides. 
\line Incipit N. (!) Porcius Catho priscus, idest pars comperacionis (!) etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [M]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  arcum autem Cathonem genere Tusculanum fuisse et priusquam ad miliciam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  331r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Iste Cathonis philosophy virtute ac gloria etate sua clarissimi annus (!) fuit. Explicit Aristides (!) et Cathonis vitae, dehinc sequitur Plutarchy exquisitum de utroque iudicium, idest comparacionis pars extrema etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  [C]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  um de hiis que mencione digna videbantur exposuerimus, si totam unius vitam universe alterius conferamus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  333r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... diligere propositum fuit etc. >Explicit feliciter vita valentissimorum Sarracenorum annorem (?)< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Giustiniani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Rinascimento s. II 1 (1961), 26f. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia, II 1451 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Aristides...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) u.a. \u220 \'dcberliefert ferner in M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, fol. Cod. Ms. 549, f.328r}

