\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur de speciebus adiectivorum< Est autem sciendum quod adiectivorum quedam pertinet ad animam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... De omnibus hiis et aliis ponantur hic exempla ut copiosior esse possit materia dicendorum etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  In Listenform: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De adiectivis pertinentibus ad animam: Doctus instructus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ferner \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad corpus, ad extrinsecus, ad laudem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Copulativa: nempe ... profecto etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in der Gossembrot-Handschrift Wolfenb\u252 \'fcttel, HAB, 69.11. Aug. fol., f.298rb\endash 300va}

