\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de arca Noe}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1r Prolog \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fac tibi archam de lignis levigatis, Gen. 6 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (14)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Karissimi, quam felix foret qui in presenti tempore de cursu tam periculoso et funesto archam firmam contra diluvium inundans haberet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Archa ecclesie< Nunc ergo ista ad archam moralem ecclesie sancte sunt applicanda ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  9r Lageskizze ... \emdash  57r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Sem et Iaphet qui benediccionem a patre receperunt. Quam benediccionem eterni patris nos consequi faciat Christus rex angelorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (57v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat deus in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit tractatus de archa Noe finitus anno 1447 in die conversionis sancti Pauli per me Iohannem Wylhaymer tunc temporis lectorem Ravenspurgensem, et fuit dies clarissima. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  31v marginal Datierung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Maria 1447< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 58r\endash 59v leer}

