\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exempla naturalia super evangelia dominicalia ex scriptoribus de rerum natura}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fontinus in descriptione universi sic dicit: Lapis intra aquam proiectus quatuor operatur, primo spumam gignit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  218rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fontinus ubi supra: Tempore quidem pluvii non statim arbor guttas suas stillat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  usw., die letzten Kapitel 253ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Legitur in libro rerum: ibex est animal habitans in altissimis montibus quos frequenter scandit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  253rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Legitur in libro rerum de symea que est simulitudo hominum in facie et animal stultum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  253va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Legitur in libro rerum anchaleps (!) est animal crudele ita quod nullus venator eum insequi audet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... capientes peccatores eos eternaliter cruciandos, deducunt ad infernum. A quo nos custodiat sancta trinitas unus deus alpha et o sit benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Siehe B. van den \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Abeele\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bestiaires encyclop\u233 \'e9diques moralis\u233 \'e9s. Quelques succ\u233 \'e9dan\u233 \'e9s de Thomas de Cantimpr\u233 \'e9 et de Barth\u233 \'e9lemy l\u180 \'b4Anglais, in: Reinardus 7 (1994) 209\endash 228, S.226 Nr.3. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Nr.652. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Thomas Ebendorfer Nr. 485ff. (abweichend). Auch in Eichst\u228 \'e4tt, Cod. st. 483}

