\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3ra\endash 50vc) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cacciavillanus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Adiectiones ad Brocardica Azonis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  durch Rubrum \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Adiectio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  markiert und durch rote Sigle \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Caz. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  beendet, z.B. 3va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Quod ceptum est prodest, licet completum non fuerit et econtrario< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u167 \'a71 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In his brocardis solvendis illud est ... quod dic ut notavi ff. de. verb. o. l. II \u167 \'a7 quedam. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (statt 'his' in der Hs. 'hic'). \emdash  \u167 \'a72 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Adiectio< Si hominem certum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quod ex facto. Caz. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \u167 \'a73 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec in principali obligatione ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. hierzu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kuttner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Analecta iuridica, 448.}

