\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  169vb\endash 175vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Conradus de Zenn}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus contra novam sectam, quae observantiam regularem impugnat}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Post consummacionem superioris tractatus insurrexit quedam nova secta malignancium adversus regularem observanciam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Qui potest capere, capiat. Opus enim uniuscuiuscumque probabit veritas. Ffinis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secta proprietaria loquitur hec nepharia. Doctrinam huius libelli confirmabit stix averni. Responsio: sic stix proprietarios falsos probabit monachos. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Folgt Note von anderer Hand \u252 \'fcber eine Sekte in Barcelona zur Zeit Papst Clemens VI. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota in libro inquisicionis parte prima questione decima habetur sic: Dominus Clemens sextus informatus per fratrem Nicolaum Roselli ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.225}

