\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  176r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestio disputata Romae anno}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   1463 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ferrandus Cordubensis: Nichil vel obstinate defendes vel pro temeritate affirmas, sed sacrosancte Romane ecclesie pro se vel contra determinanti se subiciens in plena curia ... defensurum sub hoc tytulo: Utrum Christus in cruce moriens Iohannem ewangelistam facere potuerit verum gloriosissime virginis filium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Im Anschlu\u223 \'df Reihung von \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incidencia methaphysica, physica, medicinalia, moralia, astronomica, geometrica, arismetica, musice, perspectiva, oratoria, loyce. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Presens questio disputata fuit in urbe Romana Anno domini 1463 post octavam Epyphanie. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u196 \'c4hnliche Quaestio in Soest, StB, Cod. 30, f.104}

