\line (73ra\endash b) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bonifacius episcopus etc. Quamquam detestandum f(er)itatis abusum quem ex more quodam horribili nonnulli fideles improvide consequuntur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quamvis non sit causa sine culpa tn (?). 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (73rb\endash va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bonefacius (!) etc. Proinde actendentes quod ut frequencius multorum interdicti sentencie proferuntur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... per ipsius sedis patentes litteras apparentes (?). Datum etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (73va\endash b) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Benedictus episcopus etc. Quid olim per se. re. Bonifacium papam VIII. predecessorem nostrum contra laycos exigentes sive recipientes a clericis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... gravissimas penas poterunt formidare nulli (!). etc. Datum Perusii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro usu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  cod.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   V\u176 \'b0 Ydus May pontificatus nostri anno primo}

