\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  38r\endash 44r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iordanus de Saxonia (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo super orationem dominicam}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Orate pro persequentibus et calumpniantibus vos, Mathei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (5,25)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quando discipuli pecierunt a Christo ut doceret eos orare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... me liberabit de corpore mortis huius. Advertendum est circa hanc oracionem dominicam quod primo tres sunt circa temporalia. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.8688 (nur diese Hs.). Auch in Salzburg, St.Peter, b. XII. 35, Nr.7 f.48\endash 51v (Iohannes de Saxonia, Lectum super orationem dominicam; Abschrift datiert 1470}

