\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  79r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (79r\endash v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Crisostomus super Matheum XI\u176 \'b0 capitulo loquens de condicionibus perversorum hominum dicit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sunt enim quidam perversi similes istis qui de omnibus malis iudicant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Si adulari rennuit, superbus est. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (79v) \u252 \'fcber Wucherer \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota usurarius peyor est dyabolo quia ille crucem fugit et aquam benedictam, iste vero non; peyor inferno ... latrone ... Iudeo ... morte quia ille accipit corpus et occidit, ille vero animam et corpus et cetera. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (79r\endash v) \u196 \'c4hnlich Cgm 644, Nr.4, und Ansbach, Schlo\u223 \'dfb., Ms. lat. 19, f.198rb. \emdash  (79v) Vgl. Berlin, SB, Ms. Diez. C oct. 12, f.1r und Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Ser. nova 3620, f.79r (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Usurarius peior est fure, inferno, Iudaeo, morte corporali ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  79v\endash 102v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Etymachia sive Tractatus de VII vitiis et virtutibus (Titulus 75 des 'Lumen anime')}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Misit rex Sawl VII apparitores ut raperent David, 1 Reg. 19 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sm 19,14)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . David qui interpretatur desiderabilis et (!) signat peccatorem, cuius conversionem tota celestis curia desiderat. Saul signat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Apparitores und Virtutes treten (im Unterschied zum Druck) abwechselnd auf (dazu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Harris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.53). Auf 87r ist zun\u228 \'e4chst der Text von 86v wiederholt. \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Seneca: Vicia sine modo et ordine persequenda sunt, quia modum et ordinem non habent etc. >Explicit tractatus subtilis de conflictu VII viciorum et VII virtutum< 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Im Anschlu\u223 \'df 102v\endash 103r Notabilia der Bibel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dyabolus decepit Evam et Caym (!) interfecit fratrem suum. Melchisedech panem et vinum obtulit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Virgo gloriosa Christum concepit die anuncciacionis (!) Marie facta est hec (!). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Titulus 75 des 'Lumen anime' (Tractatus de vitiis et virtutibus) in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  10329\endash 10333, nur Tit. 75 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   13437 (BSB-Ink D-67); verglichen mit 10329 (BSB-Ink L-286). Ausgabe von Nigel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Harris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Latin and German Etymachia, Textual History, Edition, Commentary, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1994 (MTU 102), Text S.108\endash 712, mit umfassendem \u220 \'dcberblick (ohne diese Hs.). Siehe auch M.A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rouse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   / R.H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rouse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The texts called Lumen anime, in: AFP 41 (1971) S.37\endash 38 mit Anm.60 und 97f. (recensio B, Part 2, diese Hs. nicht erw\u228 \'e4hnt). VL\u178 \'b2 2 (1980), 636\endash 639 (D.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schmidtke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  103r\endash 177v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aldobrandinus de Toscanella}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De duodecim articulis fidei (recensio posterior)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur tractatus de symbolo Thome< Funiculus triplex dificile (!) rumpitur, Ecci. 4 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Eccle. 4,12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Iste funiculus quo ad celum elevamur a terra est fides spes et caritas. Circa fidem primo ostenditur eius scilicet indigencia eius efficacia eius sufficiencia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... secundum sentencias philosophorum: Anime que in hac vita pietatem colunt et iusticiam ad sedes sydereas transferentur. Quod nobis prestare dignetur Ihesus Christus ... Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 1105 (zweiter Teil des Initium variiert). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr.133 ('Scala fidei'), Hs. genannt, doch weichen die Initialvarianten ab wie in Eichst\u228 \'e4tt, UB, cod. st 145-IV, f.1ra. In Clm 28260 (f.193ra\endash 221ra Aldobrandinus) folgt der in der Rubrica 103r genannte Thomas-Text auf f.221rb\endash 235ra; Thomas zugeschrieben in Salzburg, St.Peter, b. XII. 35, f.67v\endash 90v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Explicit Simbolum apostolorum Thome de Aquino 1470 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Zu dieser Zuschreibung vgl. T. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La tradizione manoscritta delle opere di Aldobrandino da Toscanella, in: AFP 8 (1938) 163\endash 192, hier 165 (Hs. genannt}

