\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2ra\endash 157rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aegidius Romanus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa super libros Rhetoricorum Aristotelis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Prolog \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quia qualis unusquisque est, talis eciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sibi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  andere Zeugen)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   finis videtur et talia dicit et operatur. Et sicut vivit bonis moribus decoratus morum noticiam ut per eam finem consequatur intentis iudicat ceteris proponendam, hac igitur intencione ut puto mota, Vestra discrecio a me hodie Romano cum instantia requisivi (!), ut super libro rhetoricorum quem Aristoteles edidit per modum summe aliqua scripta exponerem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... aggrediar postulata. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sicut scribitur in 30 (!) libro artis rhetorice cuius exposicionem intendimus prohemium est oracionis princpium, sicut in poesi prologus et in fistula for(?) preludium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  67rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dicta sunt tota. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Von der Hand des Glossators: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Liber secundus< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex quibus quidem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  123vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... de quibus determinabitur in 3\u176 \'b0 libro et in hoc finitur sciencia (?) secundi libri. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Buch III \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam autem tria sunt etc. ut dicebatur in principio primi libri artis ubi distinximus istum tercium librum a precedentibus duobus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 157rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum causam, et sic finit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sentencia super librum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (eine Zeile getilgt). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Vale mi homo< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Mit gelegentlichen Noten in humanistischer Minuskel mit r\u246 \'f6tlicher Tinte, z.B. 54vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omne rarum carum, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  55r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota bene de poetria. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  157v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les ma\u238 \'eetres ..., II 294 Nr.400e; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La facult\u233 \'e9..., 148 Nr.126e. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.60. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Faes de Mottoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.31\endash 34 Nr. 461.}

