\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2r\endash 18v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitio capituli Tuae de poenis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Repeticio c. tue de penis< Tue: Clericus in latrociniis vel aliis magnis criminibus deprehensus degradatus in monasterium detruditur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >Conclusio X.< ... et non coram ecclesiastico auferre nequit. Et tantum hic de hac repeticione}

