\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  19r\endash 75r{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Lectura super capitulum Omnis utriusque sexus (X. 5. 38. 12) }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnis utriusque sexus fidelis postquam ad annos discrecionis pervenerit, omnia sua solus peccata saltem semel in anno fideliter confiteatur proprio sacerdoti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  19v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et per illam postea prosternere sexum virilem; quod et fecerit domino permittente, etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  20r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini amen. Beatissimo Augustino testante sacerdotibus necessaria sunt ad discendum libri sacramentorum idest missale liber lectionarius, antiphonarius, baptisterium, computus, canon penitencialis, psalterium, omelie per circulum anni ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  21r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dimittendo. etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  21r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnis utriusque sexus etc. Hoc capitulum dicit in summa hoc: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quilibet doli capax}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ohne weitere Einteilung weiter bis 53r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... XVIII q. V. c. neque etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  53r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si quis autem: Hic est secunda pars principalis istius capituli, in qua instruit concilium Lateranense de confessione alieno sacerdoti facienda; unde dicitur hic, quod siquis alieno sacerdoti ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  63v Abschnitt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacerdos autem etc.: Hic est tercia pars capituli, in qua concilium instruit confessorem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 75r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... qui recedunt etc. Et illa pro presenti sufficiant pro huius capituli declaracione. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium: Concilium Lateranense IV, Canon 21, siehe J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Alberigo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Concilia Oecumenicorum Decreta, S.245. Auch in Olomouc, SVK, M II 108, f.142v\endash 156r (vermutlich nur der Anfang). Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich in Z\u252 \'fcrich, ZB, C 3, f.3v (Tractatus super c. Omnis utriusque sexus Ambrosii de Vignate)}

