\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  75r\endash 80r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Abbreviatio tractatus Iohannis Calderini de interdicto ecclesiastico}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De interdicto ecclesiastico< Dominus Iohannes Calderinus episcopus conposuit tractatum, in quo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   huiusmodi materiam sufficienter conscripsit. Pro simplicibus tamen maxime ecclesiarum rectoribus in villis morantibus de observacione interdicti ecclesiastici ex eodem tractat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   pauca collegi, de quibus quilibet ea perlegens videre poterit que tempore interdicti a iure prohibita sunt et que concessa etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  75v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primo sciendum quid sit interdictum, 2\u176 \'b0 ... Interdictum ecclesiasticum sive divinorum est suspensio ecclesiastice censure ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et est alius qui in illo includitur etc. Et illa fuit (!) breviter scripta et finita videlicet (!) etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Mit Korrekturen. \emdash  Rest 80v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Fulda, LB, Aa 135, f.176va. Graz, UB, 538, f.43. Klosterneuburg, 649, Nr.4; M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 2\u176 \'b0 680, f.279r. \emdash  Eine andere Epitome dieses Textes in Clm 3596. f.115r\endash 122r.}

