\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  80v\endash 101r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitio capituli Omnis utriusque sexus (X. 5. 38. 12)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Repeticio capituli Omnis utriusque sexus de penitencia et remissione< In nomine sancte et individue trinitatis ... Amen. LXXIII distinccione. In nomine domini de baptismo debitum. Patres prestantissimi ceterique domini in Christo precolendi. Pro divini nominis invocacione ut actum presentem sua gracia bene inclinet, melius mediet et optime terminet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Et sint hec breviter dicta cum supportacione (?) venerabilium etc., quorum interest talia interpretari et sufficiunt pro presenti. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  101v\endash 106r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestio, utrum symoniacus in ordine sui ordinis officium valeat exercere}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Utrum symoniacus in ordine sui ordinis officium valeat exercere. Primo nota, quod symoniacus dicitur a symonia. Simonia autem dicitur a Symone ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et macula sublata pro dispensacione exercere. Et tantum de questione (?) presenti. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  106v\endash 112r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Andreae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa de sponsalibus et matrimoniis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Summula domini Iohannis An. super quarto libro Decretalium< Christi nomen invocans ad honorem ipsius et reverendissimi patris mei archidiaconi Bononiensis qui divinam potenciam imitatus de me nichilo fecit aliquid, deconsedi (!) et reversi (?), ad utilitatem meam et scolarium meorum ... ego Iohannes Andree ... summam ... compilavi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad secundam partem rubrice et non ad propositum; unde quid dicant, vide per te. Et sic est finis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. Bologna, Coll. di Spagna, 279, f.101r\endash 102v (D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maffei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , I Codici del Collegio di Spagna di Bologna, Mailand 1992). }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  112v\endash 119v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitio capituli Presybter de celebratione missae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Repeticio capituli Presybter de celebracione misse< Dicit Plato in Thymeo quod homo volens aliquod opus inchoare et illud ad finem bonum deducere, debet primo divinam graicam implorare ... Quantum ad primum ista rubrica continuatur ad precedentem hoc ordine secundum Iohannem Andree in novella ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Adhuc multa de confessione essent dicenda, propter brevitatis (!) etc. obmitto}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  120r\endash 126v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitio capituli Ex transmissa de decimis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Sic dicit Canon LXIII distinccione in nomine patris de baptismo et eius effectu c.i. (?) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Reverendi patres magistri ac ceteri domini mei eximii. Cum preposterus sit ordo prius humana subsidia petere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et illis deficientibus divinus fautor et gracia postuletur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et id pro quo mutatum est consecratum erit domino etc. Et sic est finis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u196 \'c4hnlich beginnt (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Quia preposterus sit ordo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) der 'Apparatus super libro Sexto' des Iohannes Andreae}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

