\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  127v\endash 135v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Calderinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitio capituli Naviganti de usuris (X.5.19.19)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Usurarius est qui a debitore aliquid recipit ultra sortem, eciam si suscepit in se periculum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sic et usura est simile XIIII. q.III. etc. Ioh. Calderini. etc. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. Bologna, Coll. di Spagna, 126, f.64r\endash 68r (D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maffei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , I Codici del Collegio di Spagna di Bologna, Mailand 1992)}

