\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  135v\endash 136r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Poltzmacher}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Consilium}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Consilium domini doctoris bonum (!) Polczmacher< Quidam archidiaconus natus ecclesie kathedralis per annos quatuor a tempore sue confirmacionis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... speciali non obsistunt. Ita respondi ego Iohannes Polczmacher decretorum doctor testimonio huius subscripcionis et signeti proprii appressione sub cuiuslibet melius scientis correctione. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 4\u176 \'b0 Cod. ms. 806, f.173r\endash 174r}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  136v\endash 141r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitio capituli Thomas de corpore viciatis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini amen. XXIII distinccione. In nomine domini patrem omnium rerum in principio debemus invocare; quo pretermisso nullum rite fundatur exordium, Boecius de consolatu philosophico li. III prosa IX. Ideo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... In quibus patet quod defectus ibi expressi non relinquuntur superioris arbitrio etc. Et sic est finis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  141v\endash 147r{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Repetitio capituli Alma de sen. ex li. VI }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Patres prestantissimi ac doctores egregii ceterique domini in Christo precolendi. Quia in omnibus nostris actibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   primo et principaliter et ante omnia nomen dei debemus invocare, ut ipse sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [m]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   graciam bene inchoet melius mediet et optime terminet ... Ad instar serenissimi principis Iustiniani ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et Iohannes Calderinus in loco preallegato usque Sciendum an celebrans etc. Et tantum de ista repeticione etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Marginale Noten 145v\endash 146v. \emdash  Rest von 147r leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich in Klosterneuburg, 649, Nr.3 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Quia in omnibus nostris actibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  147v\endash 152v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Andreae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super arborem consanguinitatis et affinitatis (Apparatus)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Apparatus domini Iohannis Andree super arbore consanguinitatis et affinitatis< Circa lecturam arboris diversis olim diversum modum tenentibus Iohannes de Deo Hyspanus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Erster Abschnitt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Demum ad arborem consanguinitatis spiritualiter descendamus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  150r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad arborem affinitatis et eius materiam transeamus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in qua universi fideles et precipue studentes continue perseverent per graciam eius qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit Apparatus Io. A. super arborem consag. (!) et affinitatis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Drucke: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   1018ff}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  172v\endash 174r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Texte zu Verwandtschaftsgraden mit Schemata}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item iuxta supradicta datur casus, in quo quis ducere potest sororem fratris sui ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  173r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circa illud autem quod supra dictum est, quod pater et filius ducere possunt matrem et filiam, solet moveri hoc enigma ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schema mit Eigennamen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bertha mater, Theberga mater, Sempronius, Martinus, Seyus. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  173v Schema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abavus, abavia / propatruus, proamita ... Regula ascendencium et descendencium secundum canonem et legem. Quot sunt persone de quibus queritur computatis intermediis una dempta tot sunt gradus inter eas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... secundum leges declara. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zu 173v vgl. Schl\u228 \'e4gl, Stiftsbibliothek, 220 (822.234), f.345v\endash 350v. \emdash  
\line 174r Schema zu den 4 Graden \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Relictus relicte sororis: Hodie nullum genus affinitatis, olim quartum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uxor fratris olim relicta ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Vir proneptis sororis. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Darunter Vers von anderer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mutat nupta genus sed generata gradum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vers auch in Innsbruck, Stiftsarch. Wilten, s. n. (HMML 28, 776), f.260vb. \u196 \'c4hnlich Breslau, DomB, 309, f.191ra}

