\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  175r\endash 178r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus Iauriensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio ad Nicolaum V papam pro Ladislao Hungariae rege}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Oratio ad papam< Mandatum pridem suscepi laborem quem hodierna iubet explere dies tibi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... legendas exhibere. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Hauptteil \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic legatur credencia; et ea lecta ... Beatissime pater, tibi Christi vero vicario ac legiptimo (!) Petri successori ... cum tremore loquor ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... te a corpore exutum provehet ad gloriam domini Ihesu Christi, qui vivit in secula seculorum benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Glossen 177v und 178r. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia, II 11592. Gehalten 1452 nomine ordinum Bohemiae, Moraviae et Ungariae. Gedruckt: Annales regum Hungariae ... ed . G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pray\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , I\endash V, Wien 1764\endash 1767, hier III 103\endash 105 (nach Melk, 736, f.238\endash 241)}

