\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  178v\endash 180v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Concilium Basiliense: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Decretum de celebratione missae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1435}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 ) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Decretum concilii Basiliensis quomodo divinum officium celebrandum sit, Cap. 1. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Siquis principem seculi rogaturus habitu honesto, gestu decenti, prolacione non precipiti, sed distincta attenta quoque mente seipsum ac verba studet componere, quanto diligencius in sacro loco omnipotentem oraturus deum hec omnia facere curabit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Statuit igitur sancta synodus ut in cunctis kathedralibus et collegiatis ecclesiis ... laudes divine ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 180v mit dem Kapitel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De spectaculis in ecclesia non faciendis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... iuris remedia punire non negligent. etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  180v Mit Verweiszeichen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Supra ante decretum huius concilii. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Auf 178r Schlu\u223 \'dfbemerkung (mit entsprechendem Verweiszeichen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnes autem consuetudines statuta ac privilegia ... irritas esse hec sancta synodus decrevit data in sessione publica in ecclesia maiori solempniter celebrata die Iovis nona mensis Iunii Anno a nativitate domini M. CCCC.35to. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Siquis principem seculi rogaturus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   auch in Klosterneuburg, 637A 3.21, III; 637B, 3.23, III}

