\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  181r\endash 192v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tabula de materia electionis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eligere idest presentare de electione querelam (?). Item eligere idest ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis tabule in qua habetur quasi tota materia electonis. Amen. Deo gracias}

