\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  193r\endash 202r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Franciscus <de Zabarellis>}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus iuris canonici de electione summi pontificis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Licet de evitanda: formosum et de altissima materia est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... XII. quero hic de modo tollendi hoc scisma. Sic (?) ut in sequenti tractatu. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Kommentar wohl zu den Dekretalen Alexanders III., die mit 'Licet de evitanda discordia in electione' beginnen. Zu diesen vgl. Kassel, Fol. Ms. iurid. 15, f.2\endash 26}

