\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  146ra\endash 240rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Lapus de Castellione}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Allegationes abbreviatae per Antonium de Butrio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In nomine domini nostri Ihesu Christi allegaciones hic scripte sunt Lapi de Castionocho (!) de Florencia solempnissimi advocati Florentini abbreviate per me Antonium de Butrio< Allegacio prima de appellacionibus. In hac prima allegacione facit tria vel quatuor dubia. Primum an sola proposicio recusacionis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Allegacio C.XXX.II \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  230vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sic dico et consulo ego Paulus de Liezaris (!) de Bononia decretorum doctor faciens meum consuetum sigillum apponi. Et sic est finis. >Explicit Lapus< Sequitur tabula eiusdem. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Drucke: BSB-Ink C 179\endash 182, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Reichling\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   4578, u.a. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (231ra\endash 240rb) Register zu den Quaestiones des Lapus de Castellione \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit tabula super allegacionibus domini Lapi M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 XX\u176 \'b0 VIIa die mensis Iulii, de quo deus sit benedictus}

