\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quamvis dubia plura circa materiam ecclesiastici interdicti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... concesse (!) ipsi ecclesie a Christo, cui est honor et gloria per infinita secula Amen. >Explicit tractatus de ecclesiastico interdicto famosissimi decretorum doctoris domini Iohannis de Calderinis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Mit Noten. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Drucke: GW 5902\endash 3, verglichen mit GW 5903 (H 4249, BSB-Ink C-58). Reich \u252 \'fcberliefert}

