\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  150v\endash 153r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Michaelis de Buscoducis ('s-Hertogenbosch)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de dedicatione}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Per me fratrem Iohannem Mychaelis ordinis predicatorum de Buscoducis (?), Sermo de dedicacione< Vere dominus est in loco isto, Gen. XXVIII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Libenter debemus visitare ecclesiam, primo propter presenciam dei, quia hic est veraciter ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut ab illa pena possis supportari etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f.122, f.94v\endash 97v (anonym). Verfasser nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli/Panella}

