\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  102ra\endash 165rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Berchorius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Registrum super repertorium bibliae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abhominacio: Nota quod quinque sunt abhominaciones et peccata que hodie regnant in mundo scilicet invidia ... Absencia: Nota quod mors vel absencia boni prelati est valde dampnosa ... Abscondere: ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Zacheus: Nota quod per Zacheum figurantur boni seculares sciencia et moribus ... Zacheus figurat boni elemosinarii statum et condicionem, Luce 34 A, etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite und 165a\endash d leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Als 'Tabula alphabetica' auch in K\u246 \'f6ln, StA, W 219, f.328r\endash 384v}

