\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  166ra\endash 178va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de confessione}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit tractatus de confessione compendiosus reverendi doctoris et magistri Henrici de Hassia< >Assit in principio sancta Maria meo (?) etc.< Tibi dabo claves regni celorum, Mt. XVI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (19). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Verbum] hoc cuilibet dicitur confessori qui}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   absolvendi habet potestatem confitentem a peccatis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et est extravagans non revocata quo ad scripta, licet bene quo ad quedam alia et sic est finis. Amen 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   6019 (ohne die Handschrift). Auch in Clm 3596, f.20r}

