\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur sermo de eodem< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fortis armatus custodit atrium suum, Luce XI (21). Verba formacionis (!) fortem alligantis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   que licet dicta sint de principe tenebrarum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Et ergo bene potest de illo thema propositum, quod ipse ut armatus custodivit atrium suum. Primo dico etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Frankfurt, StuUB, Ms. lat. qu. 77, f.102rb\endash 104rb.}

