\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur sermo de cena domini bonus< Parasti in conspectu meo mensam, Ps. 22 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (5)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Mensa ista quam in conspectu vestro paratam esse prophetico dicente vaticinio cognovimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Huius mense celestis indeficientis ubertatis et refeccionis nos participes faciat ipse rex celorum Ihesus Christus Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Henricus Totting de Oyta, Nr.8 (ohne diese Hs.)}

