\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nequaquam ut mori solent ignavi mortuus est Abuer, II Reg. III\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (33).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Reverendissimi domini ac magistri, postquam Iudeis, paganis, scismaticis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ibi veritas et eterna salus exuberat; ad quam nos perducat Iesus Cristus in secula benedictus Amen. >Finis sermonis pro defuncto bonus et utilis valde etc.< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 14, f.33ra (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  quamquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   statt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  postquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), und Ms. lat. quart 77, f.10ra}

