\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1r\endash 33r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Register zum Speculum clericorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Et sic est finis registri secundum ordinem alphabeti compositi. etc. >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1457}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rot: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rubricatum per me Iohannem Welden filius fabri in Augusta in barochia sancti Iori etc. anno ab a (!) creacione mundi usque huc 6655 iar Ieronimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (mit dem Signet Weldens)}

