\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  174vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Welden filius Fabri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota de morte patris et sororis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item quarta die ante Urbani obiit pater meus nomine Kenlin (?) Schmid von Welden in die ascensionis Christi 1460 iar; et soror mea Otilia ante in vigilia Ambrosii, fuit proxima dies post dedicacionem ecclesie Udalricy 1459; quarum animarum requiescant in sancta pace etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Oben rechts das Signet Weldens}

