\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  175r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta moralia Gregorius}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Qui virtutes sine humilitate congregat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Greg. M. hom. in evang. I 7,4,43). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius in pastorali libro primo cap. X\u176 \'b0: Dum his qui displicet ad intercedendum mittitur, irati animus ad deteriora provocatur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Greg. M. Regula past. I 10,31; sprichw\u246 \'f6rtlich). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tulius: Pietas est cultus deo exhibitus et per oppositum impietas importat contemptum dei. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ferner werden zitiert \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus, Ezechielis, Berenhardus (!), Ieronimus, Ambrosius. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Einem Florilegium entnommen. \emdash  175v leer}

