\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  180r\endash 187r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De sacramentis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacramentum capitur tripliciter secundum (?) magistrum in 4\u176 \'b0 sentenciarum: Primo modo pro re sacra ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  180v Schema \u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacramentum: Baptissmus (!), confirmacio, Credo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Effectus eorum: a peccato mundat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ultimo notandum quod tres sunt virtutes theoloycales, scilicet vides (!) spes et caritas. Et sic est finis huius operis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1453}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   per Iohannem Fabri Explicit. >Iohannes Fabri de Augusta< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (mit Signet). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S.98 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Sacramentum capitur a Magistro Sententiarum tripliciter. Primo modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) und 118 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Sacramentum capitur tripliciter. Primo modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  187r De quatuor sensibus sacrae scripturae \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum est quod in sacra scriptura est sensus hystoricus, allegoricus, tropologicus et anagogicus. In hystoria est quando quid de plano sermone refertur secundum litteram ... Allegoria est quando aliud sonat in littera et aliud in spiritu (?) ... Trophologia (!) est conversio ad mores ... Anagoge est sensus locucionem ad superiora sive supercelestia ducens ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sive patriam}

