\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  187r\endash 188r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expositio in Pater noster}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pater noster: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quia multi vocant deum in hac oracione patrem, qui eius non sunt filii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in nobis et in aliis. Amen. Nota quod per pater noster dantur quinque virtutes. Mundicia per Sanctificare nomen tuum, adhesio dei per Adveniat regnum tuum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed libera nos a malo, amen. >Fides spes et caritas consciencia< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 188v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Pater noster Incipits. }

