\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  260ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iacobus de Paradiso}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   (Carthusiensis): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De arte bene moriendi (excerptum)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ex tractatu doctoris Iacobi Kartusiensis Ertfordiensis de arte bene moriendi capitulo 13 de celebratione missarum< Dicerem et ad hanc artem multum prodesse salutaris hostie oblationem divinissime eukaristie in qua denuo Christi amarissima passio renovatur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... a quantumcumque etiam peccatore celebratum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I 13 S.187\endash 188 ... missa celebratur). \emdash  Verweis (Gossembrots): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vide etiam ante a k.165 A. 
\line Et post passum precedentem, sequitur: Verendum est secundum Bernardi sentenciam, quod a multis hodie insignia hec Christi passionis transierunt in mercatum et quasi venatores per hec venantur, unde delicientes vel deliciosi utentes Christi corpore tanquam altera arte mechanica unde sustentantur, alias vero rarissime celebraturi et alias non habentes intencionem suam principaliter, nisi quatenus valeant habere corporis refectionem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I 13 S.118) \emdash  Rest der Seite und 260v\endash 264r leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: Jakub z Paradyza, Poglady i teksty, ed. S.A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Por\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 \u281 \'ea\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 bski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Warszawa 1994, Text S.94\endash 135, hier S.117\endash 118. VL\u178 \'b2 IV 478ff.}

