\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  264v\endash 267v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Flores metrici proverbiorum Salomonis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Flores proverbiorum Salomonis / Carmina proverbiorum Salomonis, eruditiva< Si Salmoniaci florem vis carpere libri hoc prece pratellum morali falce secandum Verba patris, fili, non surdis auribus audi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Iure perosus eris si quid sophistice queris. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Astucia vituperatur. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (264v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sigismundus Gossembrot}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notae ad Flores Salomonis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   
\line Gossembrot zum Titel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Auctoritates eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Salomonis)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   vide in flavo codice philosophicorum k. 127. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Am linken Rand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item flores Tullii in Tusculanis vide in eius epistolis a k.162 et Manipulum florum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Joachimsohn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bibl., S.259 'Cicero, Epistolae'). }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  267v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aenigma Salomonis Sybillae propositum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Enigma Salomon proposuit Sybille: duos videlicet puerulos utriusque sexus per omnia habitu et ornatu similes, quem Sibilla masculum, quem et femellam asseret, ediceret. Sybilla sagax poma inter eos iecit que masculus inter brachia circa pectoralia collegit, femella sed ad gremium. Unde ex huiusmodi gestis sexum agnovit. Viceversa Sybilla et Salomoni enigma proposuit, duo scilicet lilia per omnia similia eciam odore, verum et artificiale, inter manus a remotis tenens Salomonem id quod vivum et floridum esset(?), adiudicare cupivit. Ipse gnarus alveolum rumpens apum volitantes consideravit quod in sedendo lilium peterent, id et vivum iudicavit.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  394r\endash 399r \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Iohannes Gerson: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Donatus moralisatus (spiritualis)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit Donatus spiritualis Partes oracionis quot sunt. Octo. Que? Cognicio substancie. Cognicio qualitatis. Cognicio precepti domini ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ubi sunt vera gaudia. >Explicit Donatus spiritualis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest von 399r leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Opera IX 689\endash 700 Nr.479. \emdash  Auch in Clm 3592}

