\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  119r\endash 138v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Eugippius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vita sancti Severini}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Epistola Eugipii (!) presbyteri ad Pascasium diaconum de s. Severino monacho< Domino sancto ac merito venerabili Pascasio Eugipius (!) in Christo salutem. Ante hoc ferme biennium consolatu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (corr.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   scilicet Importuni ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  120v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit vita sancti Severini monachi< Tempore quo Attila rex Hunorum defunctus est utraque Pannonia ceteraque confinia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... a demonibus receperunt et recipiunt operante dei gracia sanitatem. Cui est honor et gloria in secula seculorum Amen. >Explicit Vita sancti Severini monachi< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mommsen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , MGH SS rer. Germ. 26, S.1\endash 55.}

