\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  139r\endash v Pascasius diaconus:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Rescriptum ad Eugippium presbyterum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Domino sancto semperque ... Egippio presbytero ... Carissime. Dum nos pericie tue facundia et ocii felicitate perpendes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... eatenus ampliatur. Finis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  SS rer. Germ. 26, S.57}

