\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  146r\endash 153r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Legenda sancti Maximiliani}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sancti Maximiliani episcopi et martiris legenda< In Celeya civitate fuit quidam vir generis nobilitate spectabilis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad proprias sedes, que deinceps non est (!) effecta tributaria Romanorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  153v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  BHL 5812 (inc.) und 5811 'Vita et miracula' (expl.). \emdash  Auch in Herzogenburg OSA, 57, f.231r.}

