\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  154r\endash 155v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ludovicus Junckherr}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antiphonae in festo sancti Maximiliani}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5130[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augsburg}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1500}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 ) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In festo sancti Maximiliani martiris et pontificis ad vesperas super psalmos antiphona< Inclitus Christi martir Maximilianus a nobilibus parentibus et deo devotis in civitate Celeya est genitus. 
\line >Psalmus omnia laudate antiphona< Qui beatus dum esset ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  155r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dignatus est ostendere. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  155v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad laudem et gloriam cunctipotentis intemerateque virginis ac omnium sanctorum, precipue beatissimi Maximiliani martiris atque pontificis necnon contemplacionem invictissimi domini domini Maximiliani Romani regis semper Augusti Ludowicus Junckherr presbyter civitatis Herbipolensis suprascriptam hystoriam ex legenda collegit notasque applicuit; cuius laboris in celis expectat mercedem. Actum anno domini Millesimo quingentesimo, indictione tercia, XXIIII mensis Maii in civitate Augusta. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. \emdash  Der Verfasser vertonte (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  notasque applicuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) seine Fassung der Legende. Die Vertonung siehe oben zu 140r. Hier der Text aller Strophen}

