\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  171r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Christophorus Brixinensis episcopus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Erla\u223 \'df (1518)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Facta sunt infrascripta in opido Hallis Valliseni dominica post Martini anno {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1518}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  < Cristophorus dei gracia episcopus Brixinensis universis et singulis prelatis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u220 \'dcber Glockenl\u228 \'e4uten, Fastentage. \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Datum Brixie in civitate et aula nostra episcopali vicesima die mensis Octobris anno domini Millesimo quingentesimo decimo octavo.}

