\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ad perpetuam rei memoriam< Debitum pastoralis officii nobis licet immeritis ex alto immissi ... Sane pro parte dilecti filii Bernhardi Behem laici oppidi Hall Brixinensis diocesis nobis nuper exhibita ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nulli etc. Si quis etc. Datum.}

