\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Simile est regnum homini patrifamilias ... in vineam suam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 20,1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paterfamilias iste (!) deus qui nos regit, unde psalmus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et pie operantes ut ab ipso domino Ihesu Christo denarium aureum scilicet vitam eternam consequamur ipso adiuvante Ihesu Christo amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Linz, Bibl. der Kath.-theol. Hochschule, A I / 3 (Hs. 2), f.9r.}

