\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce nunc tempus acceptabile, Apostolus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II Cor 6,2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Karissimi, tempus acceptabile sive gracie incipit esse ab adventu Christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ergo tempus acceptabile quia tales semper regnant in celo}

