\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ductus est Ihesus in desertum a spiritu ut temptaretur a dyabollo (!), Mt. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (4,1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Karissimi, hic tangitur de temptacione domini quam in se a dyabollo permisit fieri, de qua omnis homo expavescat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quod dominus gaudia celi sibi apperuit; quod nobis prestet altissimus. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zwettl, Stift, 111, 6v [386]; Zwettl, 118, 61r [391]; Graz, UB, *1083, 174r; 1505, 1*. }

