\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec est voluntas dei, sanctificacio vestra ... in sanctificacionem, Apostolus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Th 4,3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Reverendissimi, quantum peccatum maculet hominem, perpendere possimus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sanctificacio vestra. Rogemus ergo dominum ut sic det nobis convertere ad ipsum ut secum permaneamus in ewum.}

