\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Egressus Ihesus in partes Tyri ... filii David, Mt. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15,21)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic est notandum quod iste due civitates Tyros et Sydon fuerunt gentilium et per sorte (!) date sunt filiis Israel}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... male a demonio vexatur. Rogemus}

