\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Erat Ihesus eiciens demonium ... et admirate sunt turbe, Luc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (11,14)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Karissimi, in isto tempore, scilicet quadragesimali, magis temptator exercet conatus sue temptacionis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quando ita pie convertit ipsum. Quam eciam conversionem nobis prestet Ihesus Christus}

