\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tulerunt lapides Iudei, Ioh. V \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (8,59)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Karissimi illud ewangelium dicit quod quando Christus vidit quod Iudei voluerunt eum lapidare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Ideo doctor sanctus Thomas tercia parte q. XI art. IIII querit, utrum Christus debuerit mori mortem crucis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut coronam glorie accipiamus; quam nobis concedat etc}

