\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  81v\endash 85v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Iacobus de Voragine: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancta trinitate}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Alius sermo de sancta trinitate< Amen amen dico vobis, quod scimus ... et testimonium non accipitis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ioh. 3,11)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut dicit Ieronimus ad Heliodorum: Grandis (!) materia (!) ingenia parva non sufferunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... decantare instituit. Gloria patri et filio et spiritui sancto. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Im Anschlu\u223 \'df f.85v\endash 86r f\u252 \'fcnf Zeilen gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum quod dominus ascendit in celum ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium, III 227f. Nr.85. \emdash  Siehe zu Cgm 1127, Nr.1 (109rb); Clm 27424, f.262v; L\u252 \'fcneburg, RatsB, Theol. fol. 100, f.169vb}

