\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  111r\endash 116r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de nativitate domini}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Invenietis infantem panis (!) involutum positum in presepio, Luc. II \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 quod (statt: qui?) longe est ab aliqua re si eam invenire desiderat, necesse est ut prius viam qua ad eam veniat inquirat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Longe a deo est anima peccatrix ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... meta timoris transita desperando similiter cadat et puer extitat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Allegorisch. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Qui longe discat (!) a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   IV 28, V 401}

