\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quem constituit heredem universorum ... verbo virtutis, Hebr. 1\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In istis verbis quatuor atribuit (!) apostolus filio dei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... misericordia astitit illis contra iram dei. A qua ira liberet nos misericordia dei qui vivit et regnat d.p.o.s.s.A. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ('deus per omnia secula seculorum Amen'). }

