\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  128v\endash 130v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de epiphania domini}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnes de Sabba (!) veniunt, aurum thus deferentes et laudem domino annunciantes, Ys. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (60,6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec verba ad litteram de magis exponuntur, moraliter autem possunt exponi aut dici de peccatoribus a statu culpe recedentibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... angelis dei. Item de eodem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis vorn: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item II sermones de epiphanie (!) domini. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   I 663 (Ista verba ad litteram), I 185 (Verba ista ad litteram), V 604 (Verba haec ad litteram), VIII 354 (Ad litteram ista verba exponuntur)}

