\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  234va\endash 234vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo (Duo electi)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Duo electi discipuli qui audita resurrectione domini simul ad monumentum currunt, sed non simul perveniunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... non valet digne coequari. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  PL 177, c.526. Auch in W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f.239, f.35\endash 35v; Berlin, Theol. lat. fol. 649, f.189r. }

