\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  234vb\endash 235vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo (Iuxta phisicos)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expurgate vetus fermentum et cetera \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1 Cor. 5, 7)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Iuxta phisicos septem novimus purgaciones corporum, ad quarum similitudinem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ecce purgaciones et modi, quibus quicumque utatur, anima etsi mortua fuit vivet etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f.148, f.28v\endash 30v. Berlin, Theol. lat. fol. 469, f.187r. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Enqu\u234 \'eate sur les sermons ..., in: Analecta Sacri Ordinis Cisterciensis 18 (1962) S.146 Nr.7. }

