\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 42vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Sancto Amando}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus super Antidotarium Nicolai}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Mit Tinte \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Iohannes de sancto Amando super antidotarium Nycolai< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorwort \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Operacio medicine secundum Iohannem (!) in tribus con (!) consistit: In exibicione \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1rb Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit liber Nicolay< Ego Nicholaus rogatus etc. Iste liber dividitur in duas partes scilicet in prohemium et execucionem \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 et ipsum post ad exteriora expellit et secum ducit cum de eius proprietate sit ad exteriora moveri. Explicit tractatus Iohannis de sancto Amando super Antidotarium Nicholay. Deo gracias. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Mit zahlreichen Noten. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   1008,5. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Broszinski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Katalog, S.49 zu Kassel, StuLB, 4\u176 \'b0 Ms. Med. 14, 1ra (bietet auch \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Iohannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).}

