\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  43ra\endash 44vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Averroes}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de theriaca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Inquit magnus medicus Hamec Averroys postquam prius gracias deo egero ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et sufficiat satisfactio secundum tempus. Laus sit deo eterno qui michi comprelendi (!) posse largitus est. Explicit liber Averroys de tyriaca. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Mit marginalen Glossen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   750,2 (mit dieser Hs.). Vgl. Kassel, StuLB, 2\u176 \'b0 Ms. med. 7, f.238v\endash 244rb (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Broszinski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.14), Soest, StB, Cod. 23, f.120ra\endash 127rb (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michael\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.151f., mit Literatur)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  44vb\endash 48vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Avicenna}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de viribus cordis et medicinis cordialibus }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rubrikentext klein oben (beschnitten) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... translatus a magistro Arnaldo Barcinione Capitulum primum tractatus primi de origine spiritus et generibus eius et principiis sue generacionis et informacionis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Creavit deus ex concavitatibus sinistrum, ut esset armarium spiritus et munera generationis illius creavitque latorem virium anime in membris aliis tendentium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in sermonibus membrorum cordialium; finem huic operi imponentes cum laude dei, qui virtutem largiri dignatus est opusculum terminandi. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Spalte leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Drucke: mehrere Inkunabelausgaben (GW 3116ff.). \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   273.9. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Juan Antonio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Paniagua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Studia Arnaldiana. Trabajos en torno a la obra m\u233 \'e9dica de Arnau de Vilanova, c. 1240\endash 1311. Barcelona o.J. (1994), VIII 323 Anm.7 (mit dieser Hs.)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

