\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  49ra\endash 57r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Arnaldus de Villanova}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aphorismi de gradibus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorrede \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In medicinis per artem compositis consideratis artificiali processu ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Situs compositionis temperamentum est vel excessus: Lector \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (statt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  auctor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   volens investigare naturam et racionem gradus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  56vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... unde in hac consideracione super omnes linguas habet incarnate veritatis auxilio latina prerogativam. Illi igitur regraciari convenit tota mente qui vivit ... Explicit liber et secuntur tabule. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  56v Tabellen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit tabula prima de porcionibus qualitatum in quolibet situ principali ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  bis 57r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tabula quinta ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... calidum in quarto. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: M.R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 McVaugh\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Arnaldi de Villanova opera medica omnia, II, Granada/Barcelona 1975, S.145\endash 228. Diese Hs. S.XI Nr.2 (Sigle C) und S.143}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

