\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  57va\endash 61va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Arnaldus de Villanova}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Doctrina Galieni de interioribus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Oben von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Liber G. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (oder \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   de interioribus< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam diversitas membrorum corporis, que tam veteres quam moderni loca sepius appellant, diversificant formam curationis morborum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... coadunatam in essentia cerebri. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Glosse 58va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lege illa cum diligencia. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. Richard J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Durling\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Arnaldi de Villanova opera medica omnia XV, Barcelona 1985, Text S.305\endash 351, diese Hs. (Sigle C) S.302f. ber\u252 \'fccksichtigt. Vgl. Gerhard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fichtner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Corpus Galenicum. Verzeichnis der galenischen und pseudogalenischen Schriften, T\u252 \'fcbingen (Institut f\u252 \'fcr Geschichte der Medizin) \u178 \'b21992, S.60. Das Werk Galens 'De locis affectis libri VI' im Mittelalter unter der Bezeichnung 'De interioribus'}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

