\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  149ra\endash 188va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Isaac Israelita}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber diaetarum particularium Constantino Africano interpr.}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Capitulatio libri II \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De diversis accidentibus ciborum in sua substancia. / De genere tritici ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  149rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... De fisticis. De pinei etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Buch II \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Complevimus in primo libro universales significaciones generis cibarii et specierum eius, oportet in secundo singulariter de unoquoque cibo tractare ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  165ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... lapides expellunt. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Capitulatio libri III: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De melonibus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Buch III \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quia complevimus in secundo libro de granis, de leguminibus et fructibus et de custodienda sanitate in sanis et egrotis valitudinibus reddendis, oportet in hoc tercio libro ea exsequi que dimisimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... constipat epar et splenem et lapidem in renibus creant. Explicit. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vat. Pal. lat. 1115, f.124r-159v (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schuba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), ohne Einteilung in zwei B\u252 \'fccher}

