\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  188va\endash 214vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Isaac Israelita}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber urinarum Constantino Africano interpr.}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorrede \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In latinis quidem libris nullum invenire potui qui de urinis certam et autenticam cognitionem dederit ... Liber iste de antiquis collectus et excerptus est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  188vb Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Urina est colamentum sanguinis et similiter aliorum humorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dolorem renum significat. Explicit liber urinarum Ysaac. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vat. Pal. lat. 1146, f.15ra\endash 30ra (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schuba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.102). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   688.2, 1608.3(I). }

