\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  224v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notizen und Exzerpte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   wohl von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Fortis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Turpis cogitacio est cogitacio alicuius vicii cum consensu in eodem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic de fornicariis pulcra nota ... Duplex est fornicarius seu dupliciter sumitur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ieronimus: Quidquid dicitur et auctoritate sacre scripture non probatur ... Ieronimus in sermone de assumpcione: Quod natura non habuit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... adimpletur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Paschasius Radbertus, De assumptione sanctae Mariae virginis vel Epistula beati Hieronymi ad Paulam et Eustochium de assumptione, Corp. Chr. CM 56C , 1985 , p.109\endash 162, hier lin.264) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Usus quidam recte conversacionis est ut preesse non audeat qui subesse non didicerit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ut te domine nostre paupertati conformares ...}

