\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  20r Kapitelverzeichnis (1\endash 13, mit alten Folienangaben) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Registrum tractatus magistri Henrici de Hassia de erudicione sacerdotum< Prohemium illus tractatus 88 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Explicit registrum huius tractatus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (88\endash 97 alter Z\u228 \'e4hlung) 
\line \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit tractatus reverendi magistri (!) de Hassia doctoris sacre teoloie (!) pro sacerdotum erudicione< Tibi dabo claves regni, Mt. sexto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (16,19)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Verbum hoc dicitur cuilibet confessori qui absolvendi habet potestatem ... confitentem a peccatis .. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quo ad que alia etc. Explicit. >Explicit tractatus magistri Henrici de Hassia ad sacerdotum erudicionem compilatus< 
