\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  41r\endash 48v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sacramento altaris (1466)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo de sacramento altaris in die cene< Legimus in Apocalipsi 19 capitulo, quod beatus Iohannes vidit angelum in sole stantem, qui clamavit voce magna ... et dicit Anselmus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ibi solum vacabitur dei laudibus, quia ibi erit deus omnia in omnibus, quod nobis prestare dignetur. etc. >Anno domini 1466 in vigilia Bartolomei< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Graz, UB, 566, f.7; Clm 28273, f.109vb\endash 111vb (endet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  latrocinium perpetravit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Clm 3596, f.45v); Stuttgart, HB III 54, f.6ra}

