\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  107r\endash 110v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Franciscus Asculensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  De doctrina virtutum et fuga vitiorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quatuor sunt que prudencia nos edocet: preterita recolere, presencia disponere, futura previdere et dubia suspendere. Quatuor sunt que fortitudo nos instruet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Quatuor ex diviciis proveniunt, sui ipsius oblivio, contemptus pauperum amicorum, ingratitudo beneficii, superbia vite. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Anfang des Textes marginal (16.Jh.) in griechischer Schrift. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr.4449 (7 Zeugen, ohne diese Handschrift). Auch in Prag, Metr. Kap., J 77 (Incunab.), f.6vb, und D 109.1, f.2r (Ps. Eneas Silvius). Vgl. 'In principio'}

