\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  110v\endash 112r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Privilegia clericorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primum quod percuciens clericum est excommunicatus XVII q. IIII Si quis. Item capiens clericum et sine lesione corporali, de sen. Ex. Nuper. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Item si loca transferuntur (!) vel uniantur retinent privilegia, et si destruantur per hostes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... XVI q.1 Si vere. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u196 \'c4hnlich Schwabach, 7/12, f.175va\endash 178va; auch in einer Erlanger Handschrift und in Posen, Arch., 57, f.299r.}

