\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  112r\endash 115r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notae de usura}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   
\line 112r\endash 113r: Franciscus de Platea, De usuris: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Nota descripcionem usure< Usura est lucrum mutui pacto debitum et exactum. Sed hec descripcio non est sufficiens ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sit tibi iuncta. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mohan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.445 (Franciscus de Platea zugeschrieben). 
\line 113r\endash 114r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Opinio Innocentis (!)< Sumere (?) pro iusto precipio redditus ad tempora vite vel ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... insolescit idest superbe invalescit. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  114\endash 115r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Diffinicio usure secundum Hostiensem< Usura est quodcumque solucione rei mutuate excedit (!) gracia usus ipsius rei. Nota aliam et meliorem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... contra hereticos, vide in VI. et in Clementinis titulo de hereticis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Auch in Schwabach, Band 7, f.178ra\endash va; vgl. Clm 3247; Schl\u228 \'e4gl 121, f.240}

