\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  115r\endash 122r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Calderinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa abbreviata de ecclesiastico interdicto}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit summa Iohannis Calderini de interdicto ecclesiastico generali et speciali etc.< Ecclesiasticum interdictum et suspensio ecclesiastice censure a divinis officiis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  121r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Item quod excommunicatus non debet salutari vide in epistola Io. post pascha. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  121v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur de minori excommunicatione< Minor excludit a percepcione sacramentorum et non debent hic sepeliri ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ewkaristia debet dari vide c. ewkaristia. De fut(uris) fut(uris) (?) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Fassung identisch in Schwabach, 7/8 (Cl.40), f.164ra\endash 165va. \emdash  Der Anfang auch im Cgm 1115, f.10vb\endash 12rb; N\u252 \'fcrnberg, StB, Cent. III,83 f.110vb; Dresden, LB, App. 2243, f.100v\endash 102v. Schlu\u223 \'df jeweils abwei}

