\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  122r\endash 132r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Opiniones de horis canonicis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Quomodo hore canonice sunt dicende< Hore canonice secundum Gilbertum de Mon. Lau. de celebracione misse c. 1 in Clementinis (?) super verbo Horis canonicis sic diffinit: Hore canonice sunt sacrificium sine hostia laudis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... de actu de hiis etc. >Expliciunt opiniones de horis canonicis dicendis< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Schwabach, 7/8, f.165va-167vb, wo ein Traktat des Henricus de Bitterfeld, De septem horis canonicis folgt; hier m\u246 \'f6glicherweise mitverarbeitet}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  132r\endash 150v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paulus de Hungaria}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de confessione}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam circa confessiones animarum pericula sunt et quandoque difficultates, ideo ad honorem dei sanctique Nicolai ac fratrum utilitatem et confitencium salutem tractatum brevem de confessione copulari (!) ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  132v\endash 133r Liste der Rubriken, letzte \u220 \'dcberschrift \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De principalibus viciis. Rubrica 1 (!) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 149r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Etas ordo numerus mora delectacio sensus etc. etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zusatzkapitel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Peccata oris sunt hec: Crebra iuracio, periuirium, blasphemia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  149v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Peccata operis sunt hec: Gula, luxuria, ebrietas, sacrilegium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  150r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De peccatis omissis (!)< Peccata omissionis sunt hec: De deo non cogitare, ipsum non timere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... afflictos non consolari, admonicionibus non acquiescere. etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Gedruckt: Florilegium Cassinense, IV 191\endash 215. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 4919 (ohne diese Handschrift, mit weiterer Lit.). \emdash  Auch in Schwabach, 7/11 (Cl.41), f.170ra\endash 175va }

