\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  159v\endash 171r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De praeparatione ad missam}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad honorem gloriose ac individue trinitatis et ad honorem excellentissimi sacramenti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hoc autem non reputes posse tua virtute sed auxilio gracie eius. Quod ipse tibi et michi prestare dignetur. Amen. >Explicit devotus tractatus de corpore Cristi et de preparacione ad suscipiendum idem sacramentum salutiferum< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Bonaventurae opera, tom. VIII, Quaracchi 1898, S. CXVIII, 99\endash 106. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.29}

