\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  171r\endash 175r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Gerson}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De modo vivendi fidelium}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur modus vivendi. Et prima regula ad ad (!) nobiles potentes et scabinos spectant hec (!)< Ne pauperes per potenciam suam opprimant nec a subditis suis opprimi permittant, malos usus in villis suis destruant ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Quicumque hanc regulam secuti fuerint pax super illos et misericordia etc. >Expliciunt regule de modo vivendi< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , VIII Nr.399. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.3187 (ohne diese Handschrift).}

