\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ad cognoscendum differenciam inter peccatum mortale et veniale ponuntur regule sequentes< Prima quando amor vel affeccio ad creaturam tam ad se quam ad aliam tantum crescit vel ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et erit vobis iniquitas in ruinam. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , II 487\endash 504. Auch in Clm 5829, f.320vb.}

