\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S.1\endash 18 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Passio sancti Silvestri papae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rot und gr\u252 \'fcn: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In nomine sanctae trinitatis Incipit passio sancti Silvestri qui (!) caelebratur pridie Kal. Ian.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u220 \'dcber der Zeile korrigiert \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  passio ] vita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui ] quae. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctus igitur Silvester in infantia sua Quirino presbitero exhibebat obsequium. Cuius tam verbo quam exemplo instructus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S.8/9 Schriftwechsel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... hanc legem dedit: ut siquis / domino factus est in deserto ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet S.18 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ex quo coepit ab omni populo Romano magnificare nomen domini Ihesu Christi, cui est honor et gloria cum patre et spiritu sancto per omnia saecula saeculorum. Amen. Finit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  S.9 mit Korrekturen in karolingischer Glossenschrift. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  BHL 7740d, Novum Suppl. 7740d.}

