\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S.29\endash 76 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Passio sancti Iuliani et Basilissae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit passio sanctorum martirum Iuliani et Basilissae qui passi sunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rest abgegriffen)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S.30 Vorwort \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beati martires saeculum relinquentes hoc nobis exagiliarum (!) munus titolo (!) reliquerunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... qu\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'ea hic scripta sunt. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beati igitur Iuliani martyris non primum passionem intimabo, sed qualiter se ab infantia sua deo carum exhibuit, hoc non consilebo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... cum iuberet eam eculeo adplicari, si qui ex ministris ad // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Abbruch)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  BHL 4529, 4531. }

