\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S.88\endash 92 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Passio XXXVII virorum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >VII. Passio XXXVII virorum, XV. Kal. Febr.< Testimonium Pauli, Pansi, Dionisi, Thonii, Horpraesi (!), Horidionisi ... Hi XXXVII viri fortissimi adletae (!) Christi unanimiter accesserunt ad martyrium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... illos vero non inpertes gaudii eorum censuit qui prodere in eadem fidem (!) fuerint adiudicati. 
