\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S.92\endash 145 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Passio sancti Sebastiani }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >VII. Incipit passio sancti Sebastiani mart. XIII. Kal. Feb.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / Marginal: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In diebus illis / Sebastianus vir Christianissimus Mediolanensium partium civis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / interlinear: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vero Narbonensium oriundus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Diocleciano et Maximiano imperatoribus ita carus erat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S.116 Ende des Buch I: marginal eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contra / diabolicas acies praepararent. >Explicit liber primus. Incipit liber II< Diebus itaque accepta[e] dilationis expletis Agrestius Chromatius urbi praefectus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / korrigiert zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  urbis Romae praefectus / ad se Tranquillinum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet normal \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... derelinquens fecit ipsam ecclesiam heredem in Christo. Amen. >Explicit passio sancti Sebastiani martyris qui passus est XIII. Kal. Februarias< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Durchg\u228 \'e4ngig im 9.Jh. korrigiert. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  BHL 7543}

