\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Item vita sancti Medardi episcopi< Inter christicolas quos actio vexit in astris (astra) Pars tibi pro meretis (magna) Medarde patet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ego Fortunatus amore auxilium posso (posco) da mihi vota praecor (precor). >Explecit (!). Deo gratias.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Korrekturen). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  BHL 5863. MGH AA IV 1 (Venantii carmina), II 16 S.44}

