\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  58v\endash 72v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas a Kempis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De imitatione Christi li. IV}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  58v Registrum \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit registrum quarte partis huius libri scilicet de sacramento eukaristie< Cum quanta reverencia Christus sit suscipiendus 59. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  59r Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit thema presentis opusculi de sacramento eukaristie< Venite ad me omnes qui laboratis et onerati estis et ego reficiam vos, dicit dominus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 11, 28)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Panis quem ego dabo caro mea est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ineffabilia nec mirabilia dicendo. Amen. >Deo gracias< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  73r leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  De imitatione Christi, liber IV: Devota exhortatio ad sacram communionem, Vol. II (M.J. Pohl, 1904), S.90\endash 138. \emdash  Auch in K\u246 \'f6ln, HA, GB 8\u176 \'b0 40, f.74v sqq. }

