\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  91r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio ad beatam Mariam virginem}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O beatissima et sanctissima virgo Maria mater dei piissima domina angelorum mater omnium in te sperancium in sinum tue pietatis recommendo hodie corpus et animam meam, omnes actos (!) meos, cogitaciones ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et tandem in dilectissimi filii tui et tua dileccione morientem in vitam (!) salutis et pacis dirigas. >Amen< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und f.92\endash 105 leer; ausgenommen 92r oben von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De vera confessione}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  106r\endash 107r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta theologica}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Octo lapides preciosos quos dedit dominus sanctus heremitis, beato Francisco, beato Dominico ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... deus bona sua que ipse fecit appropriat iterum. Hec ille. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) 106v\endash 107r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Consideracio brevitatis humane vite est grata oblacio deo. Unde Gregorius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Greg. M. Moralia in Iob 8, 13, 19) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Si curiosas vestes requiris subter te sternentur et vermes esset operimentum tuum. Hec ille. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Aus dem 'Alphabetum divini amoris'? \emdash  Rest der Seite und 107v leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

