\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  124r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Versus de modo psallendi in choro}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur de modo psallendi in choro< Qui visitas chorum psallendi concipe modum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Nec timeat ire cum reprobis et mala vite. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 15733 (diese Hs., Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge: Frankfurt, StuUB, Barth. 140). Siehe auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Marx\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Handschriften-Verzeichnis der Seminarbibl. zu Trier 84, 15.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  124v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Versus de modo legendi epistolas et evangelia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De modo legendi epistolas et ewangelia< Sit hec doctrina quam tardo (!) tibi bene grata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum sit laus domini ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ut tibi laus dicitur, dominus et glorificetur. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 18307 (diese Hs., lies: 'trado'). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  124v Excerpta liturgica \emdash  F\u252 \'fcnf Abschnitte zu 2\endash 3 Zeilen, (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Est dignus? Dignus est. Est iustus? Iustus est. Dignum et iustum faciat illum dominus deus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Voluntatem tuam bonam et rectam ad perfectam sibi beneplacitam deus perducere dignetur. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. Michel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Andrieu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Le Pontifical Romain au Moyen-Age I\endash IV, Vaticano 1938\endash 1941 (Studi e Testi 86\endash 88, 99), hier I, 33, 134. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  138v\endash 143v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Conspectus psalterii}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beatus vir: Istum psalmum fecit David quando constitutus fuit rex in Bethleem. Et eciam de spiritu sancto ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quicumque wlt: Istum psalmum fecit sanctus Athanasius episcopus Alexandrie et est fides katholica integra. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u220 \'dcbersicht und Erkl\u228 \'e4rung eines sog. 'Psalterium glossatum'. \emdash  Rest der Seite und 144 leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. B.M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Xiberta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , De scriptoribus schol. saec. XIV ex ord. Carmel., 1931, S.481. \emdash  Auch in Mainz, StadtB., 471a, f.139r\endash 145v}

