\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  174r\endash 178v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus V}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bulla (Jubil\u228 \'e4umsbulle, 1449)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Copia bulle iubilei anni 1450< Nicolaus episcopus servus servorum ad perpetuam memoriam. Inmensa et innumerabila sunt divine misericordie munera ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... incursuris. Datum Rome aput sanctum Petrum anno nativitatis dominice M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 XLIX quarto decimo Kalendas Februarii. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pastor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Geschichte der P\u228 \'e4pste I, Freiburg 1901, S.414f. und Anm.2 (\u220 \'dcberlieferung). \emdash  Siehe auch zu Kassel, LB, 2\u176 \'b0 iurid. 26, I Nr. 25. Augsburg, SuStB, fol. cod. 343, f.2r. Cgm 1586, Nr. 19. Wien NB, Series nova, 355, f.186r. Initium abweichend in Mainz, StB, Hs I 121, f.121r}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  179r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Toletanus (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prophetia (1451)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo primo sole existente in libra convenient omnes planete insimul, quia sol erit in cauda draconis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Conveniunt in hanc sentenciam omnes philosophi et astrologi Grecie, Armenie et Hyspanie et plures sancti viri et Hebrei. Quod sic adimplebitur quod scribitur per Danielem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (12,12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beatus qui expectat ad annos 1452 (!). Et ista sufficiant ad evidenciam motus diei. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und f.180 leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  In Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, 273, f.44r, hinsichtlich des Initium entsprechende Vorhersage f\u252 \'fcr das Jahr 1329. Zu deren Autor Iohannes (David) Toletanus siehe M.T. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Alverny\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Avendauth' Homenaje a Mill\u224 \'e0s Vallicrosa, I, Barcelona 1954, S.31 (vgl. 'In Principio')}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  181r\endash 193v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola 'Videte quomodo caute ambuletis'}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Quedam epistola bona< Videte quomodo caute ambuletis non quasi insipientes ... quoniam dies mali sunt, Eph. V \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Apostolus Paulus conscius consiliorum dei sciens, quod infinite sunt delicie celestis patrie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschriften 187r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De avaricia, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  189r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De horis canonicis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  190r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De preparacione ad missam, De confessione ante missam, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  190v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De cottidiana consciencie examinacione, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  191r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De cottidiana memoria passionis Christi, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  192v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De graciarum accione post missam. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 193v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... qui nos omnes desideranter invitat et misericorditer exspectat Ihesus Christus dominus noster, qui regnat in seculorum secula. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Vorn im Inhaltsverzeichnis aufgef\u252 \'fchrt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: S. Bernardini Senensis opera, Venedig 1745, III 437\endash 440. Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.6443 (ohne diese Hs.). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hohmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initienregister, S.422. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.890. Als Verfasser erscheinen Heinrich von Langenstein und Bernardinus Senensis u.a. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  193v Monita ad clericos (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Hec a clericis precipue in mensa sunt servanda< Vita absencium non mordeatur. Presentes ibidem non irrideantur. Inania secularium non recitantur. Verba sacre leccionis legantur et audiantur. Cibus ad sustentacionem nature tantum capiatur. In principio et in fine deo laudes referantur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Item septem sunt que cottidie sunt cogitanda< Primum quod passionem Christi omni die homo recogitet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Septimum quod cogitat omni hora eius mortem, extremum iudicium, eternam penam}

