\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  200v\endash 201v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta theologica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1) 200v\endash 201r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Quidam doctor nomine Humbertus dicit quare ad matutinas libenter surgendus sit< Primo ne tempus oracionibus aptissimum amittamus. Secundo ut debitum benediccionis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... tamquam hostis interficiet eos etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) 201r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Crisostomus< Sunt quidam perversi homines similes phariseis, qui de omni re quam vident malum iudicant ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et detracciones depromere. Sicut dicit Bernardus super Cantica sermone XXIIII\u176 \'b0. etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  201v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dicta venerabilis Bedae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (cum nota) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Hec infra ex dictis venerabilis Bede< Sex utilitates eveniunt dicenti cum intencione et devocione cordis horas canonicas. Prima est quod deus eum numquam ita profunde in peccatum cadere permittit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >Nota< Ad horas dicendas quinque requiruntur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in horis statutis. >Hec ille< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. L\u252 \'fcneburg, RatsB, Ms. Theol. quart 83, f.92v (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sex utilitates eveniunt homini de corpore Christi ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).}

