\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  209v\endash 210r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Condiciones sex ad celebrandum ex vestimentis sacerdotis explicatae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Considera diligenter< Notandum quod sex sunt condiciones ipsum sacerdotem ad digne celebrandum ... Que quidem notabiliter colligi possunt ex sex partibus vestimentorum, quibus sacerdos induitur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et omnium virtutum perfeccionem induere. etc}

