\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  210r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Brigitta, S.}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Revelaciones (excerptum IV 23)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ex revelacionibus beate Brigide libro quarto capitulo 23 et sunt verba beate Marie (?) virginis (?)< Ex septem poteris cognoscere spiritum sanctum et spiritum immundum. Primo spiritus dei facit homini vilescere mundum, cuius honor reputatur in corde quasi aer ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ne a spiritu isto decipiaris. etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Uppsala, UB, C 259, f.32v; Dublin, Trinity College Library, 277 (C.2.14), Nr.74.}

