\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  212v\endash 213v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Recommendatio sacerdotum (versus rhythmici)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Viri venerabiles, sacerdotes dei / Precones altissimi, lucerne diei ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  213r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Inducat (!) vos dominus stolam eternalem. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  213v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen pie optavit qui hec exaravit Omnia tamen et singula super dicta possent per sacram theoloyam et scripta facilime probari, quod non forent ficta, que causa brevitatis hic non sunt depicta. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wright\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Walter Mapes, 1841, S.45\endash 47. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.6473. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Chevalier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium hymnologicum, Nr.21923.}

