\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  216v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bonam autem vitam ego puto et mala pati et bona facere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sine murmure et cum graciarum accione sustinere. Et hec Bernhardus in sermone prima (!) apostolorum Petri et Pauli \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ed. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   et H.M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1968, V 188). \emdash  (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Nota< Bonum deus non operatur in homine nisi homo voluerit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nec deus sine homine operatur. Hec Anshelmus.}

