\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  7ra\endash 120va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Turrecremata}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentarius in psalmos}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad sanctissimum ac beatissimum dominum dominum Pium secundum pontificem maximum edicio in librum psalmorum, quem alii soliloquium dicunt, incipit feliciter a Iohanne de Turrecremata Sabinensi episcopo ac sancte Romane ecclesie cardinalis sancti Sixti wlgariter nuncupato edita. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Prefacio< Beatissimo patri ... Pio secundo ... Iohannes de Turre cremata ... post humilem recommendacionem ad pedum oscula beatorum (!). Perscrutanti michi studiose psalmorum librum quem alii soliloquium dicunt, ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  8rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed ingenio et sapiencia prestantissimus haberis. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kommentar \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Psalmus primus in quo describitur processus in beatitudinem< Beatus vir qui non abiit: a via recta recedendo, in consilio impiorum: pravis eorum machinacionibus consentiendo quia: in via peccatorum non stetit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... concludens ait: Omnis spiritus sive angelicus sive humanus laudet dominum. Amen. Explicit. >Anno domini M CCCC XL et LXV et LXXIIII etc. Ulricus Lutz< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wohl 1474). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr.2734 (Werk entstanden 1463), mit dieser Hs. }

