\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  120va\endash 126vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas de Aquino (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber de peccatis et motibus carnis }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur tractatus sancti Thome de Aquino de peccatis et motibus carnis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  120vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sciendum est quod quando cogitas de iniuriis receptis et in memoria turbaris intra te cum aliqua mora et appetis vindictam fieri aut factam esse; aut doles quod non fuit facta per te aut per alium ... Hec omnia sunt confitenda ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  121va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Qualiter cogitaciones inhoneste confitende sunt< Plerique dubitant si cogitaciones inhoneste sint exterius explicande ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Weitere Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschriften, 122ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De motibus carnis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  122rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De periculo familiaritatis dominarum, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  124ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De verbis ociosis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  124vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Erudicio utilis ad omnia supradicta, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  125va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Modus cognoscendi se ipsum, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  126rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Peccatorum origo, Peccatum in spiritum sanctum, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  126vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Peccati descriptio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quod lex precipit sive fit quid lex vetat etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Folgender Text angeschlossen}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  126vb\endash 137ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de praedestinatione et libero arbitrio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Tractatus< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  127ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur quod presciencia vel predestinacio dei nullam inferat necessitatem< Cum apostolus dicat antequam malum vel bonum scirent, dictum est: Iacob dilexi, Esaw autem odio habui. Videntur quidam homines ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Honorius Augustodunensis, Inevitabile, PL 172, c.1201B\endash 1202B). 127rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur quid fit vel quid operetur, liberum arbitrium propter iusticiam homini datum< Secundum quosdam liberum arbitrium est libertas bonum et malum eligendi. Hec diffinicio licet plerisque placeat, perspicaciter considerata racioni contraria est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  usw. 
\line 128vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non impotencie necessitate sed ex magne potencie procedit voluntate ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 172, c.1205C) usw. 
\line 133ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur utrum prospera et adversa per liberum arbitrium fiant sive eveniant< Per graciam et iusticiam dei prospera et adversa erunt, gracia quidem prospera ministrat iusticia adversa dispensat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (entspricht PL 172, c.1215A) \emdash  136vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... debitam penam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (137ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  evadere est inevitabile. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 172, c.1222B). \emdash  Zumeist aus dem 'Inevitabile ' des Honorius Augustodunensis gesch\u246 \'f6pft.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  139ra\endash 140ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de oratione (carmelitica)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Via purgativa< Hoc exercicium practicari debet in secreto noctis silencio in loco occultissimo vel alias in loco tenebroso, ut toto affectu homo possit ferri ad deum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S\u252 \'fcndenbekenntnis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Confitebor tibi deo celi et terre omnia peccata mea, quibus tuam divinam pietatem tam multipliciter offendi et precipue illa et illa etc. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  139va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Nec tibi suffecit ut me ad aliquam simplicem statum penitencie adduxisses, sed ad istam sacratissimam religionem Carmelitarum pervenire voluisti, in qua heu negligenter et tepide valde conversatus sum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet mit Gebetsanweisungen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... O veni domine visitare nos in pace ut letemur coram te corde perfecto, et sic de similibus. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Grenoble, BM, 1845, f.33v (CGMBP 7 S.593)}

