\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  140ra\endash 141ra{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Tractatulus de divina sapientia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit tractatulus brevis de divina sapiencia< Cum ad deum tendimus et ad ipsum via artissima est, necesse est ut minus bene experti corroborato itinere semitas dirigant scientes quod tunc scitissime invenitur, dummodo gressus suos figunt in semitis mandatorum eius. Ideo triplex ponitur nobis via ad deum scilicet purgativa, illuminativa et unitiva, quibus anima bene expedita ad castos iocundosque amplexus ... ascendere possit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Nam per tribulacionem temptacionum et pugnam homo probatur purgatur humiliatur eruditur exercitatur et illuminatur, ut et capax fiat maioris luminis etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  253vb\endash 255ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo in die cenae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In die cene sermo< Panis cor hominis confirmet, Psalm. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (103,15)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Item queritur utrum liceat aliquem exeuntem in peccato mortali communicare ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et sic daretur ei occasio ad ydolatriam etc. }

