\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  255rb\endash 260va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de passione Christi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Passio domini nostri secundum Iohannem< Egressus Ihesus cum discipulis suis trans torrentem ..., Ioh. IX. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (18,1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Passio domini a quatuor ewangelistis scripta est, et ideo quatuor diebus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Incipiamus igitur hystoriam huius passionis mirifice secundum Iohannem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ymo Christus unicuique virium suarum sua propria dimisit. etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Cgm 1127, Nr. 1 f.70va\endash 78vb (Schlu\u223 \'df abweichend, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneider\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.137); Clm 14108, f.186ra (Expl. abweichend); Clm 26814 (dazu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Beobachtungen, S.140), u.a. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  260va Nota de peccatore \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota: Peccator septem testibus vincitur. Primus est Christus, unde Ieremias: Ego ero testis et iudex dicit dominus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ier 29,23) \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Septimus testis est opera mala, unde Apock. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (14,13)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Opera enim illorum etc.}

