\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  260va\endash 263va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo in die parasceue}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In die parasceuen (!) secundum Anshelmus (!)< Plango quasi virgo, pleba mea, Trenorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Ioel 1,8)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In verbis propositis dominus duo facit, primo nos omnes sibi ad condolendum et compaciendum invitat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Quis sit iste modus beatus Anshelmus insinuat. Nota: Beatus Anshelmus multis temporibus cum lacrimis et oracionibus rogavit beatam virginem Mariam, quod sibi revelaret quomodo filius eius passus fuit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. PL 159, c.271B) \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Et XXX Iudeos pro uno denario dederunt in ulcionem filii mei Ihesu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. PL 159, c.288B). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Verwendet ist der 'Dialogus beatae Mariae et Anselmi de passione domini' PL 159, c.271\endash 288; auch in K\u246 \'f6ln, StA, W 122, f.136r, und Basel, UB, A X 70r\endash 77r; \u228 \'e4hnlich Stuttgart, LB, HB I 71, f.58rb}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  263va\endash 264vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Historia fabulosa de Iuda Iscariota}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Legitur in quadam hystoria quod fuit quidam vir in Ierusalem nomine Ruben qui alio nomine dictus est Symon de tribu Iuda vel secundum Ieronimum de tribu Yscharia (?) qui habuit uxorem que Cyborea nuncupata est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Marginal zum Anfang: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iudas. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Consequenter videndum est de pena Iudeorum, quia post XLII annos dum noluerunt penitere, facta est destruccio Ierusalem, et Iudei expulsi sunt et occisi undecies cetena milia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig?, Blattende). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Cambridge, Corpus Christi College, 275, f.238 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 James\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   2, S.38); 323, f.3b (ebd. S.139), und in Clm 28642, f.272ra\endash 273va. }

