\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  358vb\endash 360vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Herolt}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones duo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  358vb\endash 360rb (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo de corpore Christi pro communicandis< Qui manducat hunc panem vivet in eternum, Io. 6 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (59)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Loquendo de manducacione huius venerabilis sacramenti sciendum, quod sacramentum tripliciter sumitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quem sic in cimiterium sepelierunt etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  360rb\endash vb (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In festo corporis Christi. Theuma (!) etc.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  360va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Caro mea vere est cibus et sangwis meus vere est potus, Io. 6 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (56)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut dicit Aristoteles 4\u176 \'b0 Ethicorum: Terribilissimum omnium terribilium videtur esse mors}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et sic vitam eternam possidere. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Johannes Herolt, Nr.91 und Nr.89.}

