\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  361ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hermannus de Schildesche}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speculum sacerdotum (excerptum)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Materia baptismi debet esse aqua pura vel de fluvio fonte vel puteo vel de mari. Et potest hec aqua resolvi de glacie ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in ea baptismus fieri non potest. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr. 3028. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 391. Vgl. 'In principio'.}

