\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  361ra\endash 368rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speculum artis bene moriendi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit tractatus bonus et utilis de arte moriendi< Cum de presentis exilii miseria mortis transitus propter moriendi impericiam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  361rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit prima particula< Cum omnium terribilium mors corporis sit terribilissimum, sicut philosophus in tercio Ethicorum ait ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Letztes Kapitel 368rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Informacio< Cum autem tota salus hominis in fine consistat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... unde unicuique bene et secure mori volenti super omnia est necesse ut prius antequam mors eum occupet mori discat etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Gedruckt: GW 2571\endash 2635. \emdash  Karin \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneider\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Art. 'Speculum artis bene moriendi', VL\u178 \'b2 9, 40\endash 42. Elisabeth \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wunderle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   zu Clm 14104, f.401va\endash 409vb, jeweils mit Literatur.}

