\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  368rb\endash va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Absolutiones pro peccatis et in extremis (1)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Absolucio pro omnibus peccatis et sentenciis in vita< Misereatur tui etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dominus noster Ihesus Christus te absolvat et auctoritate ipsius}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... ego absolvo te a vinculis excommunicacionis suspensionis et interdicti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  (2) 368va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Absolucio in extremis vite< Dominus noster Ihesus Christus per suam sanctam misericordiam te absolvat ... ego absolvo te ab omni sentencia excommunicacionis maioris vel minoris ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et indulgenciam tibi concessam a domino papa N. pro ultimo articulo mortis tue, in nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen.}

