\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  370ra\endash 370va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ritus in morte fratris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum frater penitus morti appropinquat, percuciatur tabula vel campanella etc. Concurrant omnes ad morientem dicentes Credo in deum, tam alte ut posset audiri ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Danach F\u252 \'fcrbitten: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Propicius esto exaudi nos domine, A periculo mortis libera eum domine ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Gebete \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Peccatores te rogamus audi nos, ut spiritum famuli tui in sinum Abrahe recipi iubeas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  370va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Oracio< Omnipotens superne deus, conservator animarum, qui quos diligis corripis et quos recipis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schlu\u223 \'dfabschnitt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quibus finitis si adhuc supervixerit dicantur septem psalmi sine gloria patri ... Mox autem ut frater obierit, terminent psalmos per requiem eternam. Statim sequitur commendacionis officium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et fratres ipsum cum versu et resumpcione secum prosequantur etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Andrieu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les Ordines Romani, 1931, I S.72. \emdash  Zu der 'Oratio' 370va vgl. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Deshusses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Le Sacramentaire Gr\u233 \'e9gorien II., Fribourg 1979 (Spicilegium Friburgense 24), Nr.2794.}

