\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  373ra\endash 373rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De religione fratrum Carmelitarum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Septem capitula de religione fratrum Carmelitarum. Primum capitulum< Postquam professores huius religionis fuerunt ab apostolis baptisati et plene intellexerunt illud misterium esse impletum, quod per deum fuerit Helie prophete in monte Carmeli revelatum. Legimus in libro Regum, quod Helias ascendit in vertice Carmeli ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  373rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Secundum capitulum< Quid fuit puerum Helie semel per X gradus ad prospiciendum contra mare et nichil apparuit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  373va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Capitulum 3m quod religiosis Carmelitarum fuit ostensum beatam Mariam esse servaturam virginitatem eorum exemplo< Quemadmodum autem hec nubecula scilicet beata Maria ... >Capitulum 4m quod antiqui Carmelite pro incarnacione filii dei oraverunt et exauditi sunt< ... >Capitulum 5m qua racione professores huius regule fratres beate Marie dicuntur et quare beate Marie specialiter famulantur< ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  374ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Capitulum sextum quod professores huius religionis in veteri lege fuerunt prophete et filii prophetarum et Carmelite appellati< ... >Capitulum septimum quod sub lege ewangelii professores huius ordinis fuerunt religiosi ...< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hiis vero quinque titulis professores huius religionis sub nova lege decorati fuerunt etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Philippi Riboti De institutione et pecularibus gestis Carmelitarum, Lib. VI cap. 1\endash 7 (stark gek\u252 \'fcrzt). Siehe Clm 471, f.85\endash 164. Weitere Zeugen siehe 'In principio'. \emdash  Zum Autor siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, Nr.6973. J. de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Puig i Oliver\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , El 'Tractatus de haeresi et de infidelium credulitate et de horum criminum iudice' de Felip Ribot, O.S.C. Edici\u243 \'f3 i estudi, in: Arxiu de Textos Catalans Antics 1 (1982) 127\endash 190. (Ders.), Arxiu de Textos Catalans Antics 16 (1997) 299\endash 389. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  374va\endash 377vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de beata Barbara virgine}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quesivi eam michi sponsam assumere, Sapiencie VIII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Originaliter recitative autem ad laudem huius sancte virginis Barbare, cuius hodie festum colimus, digne proferuntur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... assumere sponsam, que fuerunt verba thematis in principio sermonis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Neuer Absatz, 374va: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus noster Ihesus Christus flos et sponsus virginitatis dudum ante suam incarnacionem virginem hanc cui dedicata est presens festivitas elegit sibi in sponsam, dicens: Quesivi eam michi sponsam assumere. Notandum quod Christus in sponsa sua sex requirit, quorum si unum defuerit non placet sibi sponsa ista. Primum est pulchritudo non corporis, sed mentis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Et sic iuvenis tandem in servicio beate Barbare vitam suam finivit etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  377vb\endash 378rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exemplum de beata Katharina Alexandrina}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Episcopus quidam Mediolanensis videlicet Mayland Sabinus nomine vir vite venerabilis sicut refert Petrus Ravennas in libro gestorum notabilium post matrem domini virginem Katherinam in precipua devocione habebat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Sed cum tunc lingwa eius in ore eius minime appareret, nulli dubium virgo gloriosa eam tulit, que suo devoto eam per decennium mutuavit. In hiis quoque gloriosi episcopi memoriam annulus et cartha apud Mediolanum usque hodie servantur. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  BHL 1683. \emdash  Mehrere Zeugen, vgl. 'In principio'; z.B. Uppsala, UB, C 271, f.166; C 297, f.278.}

