\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  44rb\endash va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exordium Institutionum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sicut liberalium artium disciplina propriorum elementorum necessariam traditionem desiderat, ita iuris civilis doctrina institutionum precepta deposcit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut iuventuti cupid\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'ea legum componat institutiones. velud prima elementa tocius scienti\u281 \'ea. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pescatore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Miscellen, 81\endash 88. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kantorowicz/Buckland\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 52\endash 55 mit Anm.20 (diese Hs. ber\u252 \'fccksichtigt). }

