\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  10ra\endash 115ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aegidius Romanus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De regimine principum libri III}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Adresse \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex regia ac sanctissima prosapia oriundo suo domino speciali domino Philippo ... frater Egidius Romanus ordinis fratrum heremitarum sancti Augustini ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Praefatio \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oportet omnes principes non esse equaliter diuturnos ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  10rb Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oportet ut latitudo sermonis in unaquaque re sit secundum exigenciam illius rei ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  18va I 2, 38va I 3, 44ra I 4, 48rb II 1, 59vb II 2, 69rb II 3, 77ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit secundus liber et sequitur registrum super tercium 3m (!) librum< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  78rb III 1, 85vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit pars prima huius tercii libri et incipit eius secunda pars, et sequitur registrum secunde partis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  86va III 2, 104ra III 3 \emdash  Endet 115ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... pacem illam eternam in qua est summa requies quam deus ipse suis promisit fidelibus qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Kapitelverzeichnisse am Anfang der Partes bzw. B\u252 \'fccher. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr. 54. Dieser Zeuge bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Faes de Mottoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u252 \'fcbergangen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  111ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sigismundus Gossembrot}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Notiz zu 'De regimine principum' marginal: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vide de machinis urbes et arces expugnaturis et harum artium gnara gente ripharica (!) in Ethico philosopho libro X\u176 \'b0 a k. 141.k}

