\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  115ra\endash b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ulricus Berger}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Schreibervermerk 1445 und Ausf\u252 \'fchrungen zum Zeitgeschehen (Alter Z\u252 \'fcrichkrieg) mit anschlie\u223 \'dfendem Gebet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ffinitus est iste liber feria quinta post Vite \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   per me Ulricum Berger de sancto Gallo Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 45. Et anno isto fuerunt diversi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   lites in omnibus partibus mundi et presertim in partibus superioribus erga Sigismu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ndu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  m Regem Romanorum tunc temporis exeuntem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et ducem Albertum fratrem suum ex parte una et Switensium ex alia parte, et lis oriebatur ex parte Tureginensium, quia in hac civitate fuerunt quidam causantes hanc discordiam inter ipsos Switenses et Tureginenses propter quam multi de illis ex utraque parte perierunt. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \emdash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et talia plura pericula, que nimis prolongum esset narrare. 
\line {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O alme deus qui es unus in essencia et trinus in personis, qui omnia gubernas et regis gubernetque navem nostram dextera tua, ne \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   per eam in fluctibus huius maris periculis emergimur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , sed ad portum salutis eterne perveniemus sine fine te laudantes et glorificantes qui es benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zur historischen Situation vgl. A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Niederst\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 tter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Der alte Z\u252 \'fcrichkrieg, Wien 1995. \u196 \'c4hnliche Ausf\u252 \'fchrungen zur Zeitgeschichte (a.1388?) in Clm 4243 (als Schlu\u223 \'dfschrift)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

