\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  115ra-rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Widmungsbrief}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ad doctissimum et clarissimum virum Thomam de Seregano (!) Poggii Florentini de infelicitate principum. Liber incipit< Prologus. Rem minime probatam wlgo et que haud perswaderi nisi admodum paucis queat hoc libello aggressurus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  -urus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  korrigiert)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... hac nostra veluti provocacione tribueretur. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum ex mea consuetudine qua primum estate pontifex Eugenius ex urbe Florencione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korrigiert zu\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Floreucione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , am Rand\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   alias Florentie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   concessit meridie ad clarissimum virum Nicolaum Nicolum ... me contulissem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  123ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... que cum essent dicta et diei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korrigiert)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   estus remissior esset discessimus. Laus deo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. \emdash  Mit Noten und Lesarten, z.T. von Gossembrot (s.u.) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia, II 3195 (\u220 \'dcberlieferung). Druck: Basel 1538, 390\endash 419. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  115v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sigismundus Gossembrot}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notiz}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   zu Poggio 'De infelicitate principum' \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vide Petrum Blesensem in epistolis de descripcione miserie vite curialium et periculorum ipsius epistola 12 k.32. Et Pium papam secundum in codice Horacii textus modus k.254}

