\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  123va\endash 130va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Poggius Florentinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De nobilitate}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Poggius de nobilitate< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Widmungsbrief \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non dubito prestantissime pater nonnullos esse futuros qui hunc meum laborem non quidem aperte reprehendant ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  123rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Suscipe igitur hunc libellum de in quo de vera nobilitate disputatur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  usque modo prologus) De qua cum alias sepius multos disputantes audivi tum vel maxime dudum disertissimos michique summa familiaritate coniunctos. Nam cum olim ex urbe in patriam secessissem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (sic!), Initium des Textes in der Inkunabel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tum cum olim ex urbe in patriam secessissem areis mutandi gratia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Nunc autem quamvis estus polum declinavit deambulandum extra opidum censeo visendumque fluvium quem iste nobis sepius ob fertilitatem piscium laudavit. >Explicit de nobilitate< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Drucke: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   13206. Basel 1538, 64\endash 83. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  126rb et al. Sigismundus Gossembrot: Notizen zu Poggio 'De vera nobilitate' 126rb Subtiliter et profunde argumentat nobilitatem nichil esse nisi iactanciam. 129rb Decisio ulteriata quia nobilitas ex virtute tantum vera est}

