\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  85vb\endash 103ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Mesu\u235 \'eb Iunior}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antidotarium (liber III Grabadin)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit liber Iohannis Damasceni Nafrani filii Mesuhe Calbdei (!), quod est aggregatio vel antidotarium electarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (verbessert aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  electum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   confectionum. Incipit liber tercius< Sicut in libris urinarum ex hiis que experti sumus quedam rememoratione digna ex quorum aggregatione summam congessimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (am Rand\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   al. Conteximus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quam Grabadiu nostrum vocamus \u8230 \'85 
\line >Incipit prima distinccio de electuariis delectabilibus< Prima distinccio que est electuariorum subdivisionem habet \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 et quanto est antiquius tanto melius (?). Finem hic grabadiu accipit locus iste \u8230 \'85 Iohannis Nazafani filii Hebemesue grabadiu medicinarum universalium explicit \u8230 \'85 hec est secunda summa, in qua ponit medicinas singulorum membrorum egritudinibus appropriatis. / Explit (!) Hebemesue deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest von 103r und 103v\endash 103a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  104ra\endash 118va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Synonyma }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aer idem est quod divus. / Ayzon idem est quod acedula al. II\u176 \'b0 libro capitulo II curari g\u176 \'b0 / Aurisia \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Zuccoraria II. in mentridato (?) flos agni casti. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nunc requiem repetam, capiunt synonima finem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Reims, BM, 1002, f.259 und 1010, f.34v.}

