\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  147ra\endash 157rd {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rasis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Synonyma}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Alhaseph idest puncti rubei qui sunt ut pulicis morsus et fiunt in omnibus membris et precipue in oculis et cito recedunt. Algozodie idest nodi qui fiunt in collo et gula et sub assellis et inguinibus \u8230 \'85 Algafedi \u8230 \'85 Absrania \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Zaharat est herba \u8230 \'85 Zaror est species pomorum. Expliciunt Synonima Rasys. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Drucke: z.B. HC 13893, f.103va\endash 106vb (expl. Variierend). Siehe zu Vat. Pal. Lat. 1108 (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schuba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 110ra, 181rb. Auch in mehreren Erfurter Hs. (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   und \u8218 \'82In principio\rquote )}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  157va\endash 164rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Avicenna}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Synonyma }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Alphachim idest medicus. Arteria subethen idest faciens dormire \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expliciunt Synonima Avicenne. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Reims, BM, 1005, f.204. Weitere Zeugen siehe \u8218 \'82In principio\rquote }

