\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  164rc\endash 165vd {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tabula antidotarii}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Electuaria calida sunt hec: Dyadragagantum, dyazinziber \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Orimellis vel sirupi unciam I cum III aquis (?). Explicit tabula antydotarii. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. J.-P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rothschild\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bibliographie annuelle du Moyen Age tardif 1 (1991) Nr.784}

