\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  165vd\endash 167vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Parma}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Practicella sive de medicinis simplicibus }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorwort \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam quidam de melioribus amicis meis, quos habere videor, me rogavit, ut eis in scriptis redigerem breviter medicinas digestivas et evacuativas \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 incipiam autem a digestivis. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Medicine igitur digestive simplices colere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (oder\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   colore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sunt hec, scilicet viola, rosa, endivia \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cum medicinis infrigidantibus renes, que dicte sunt supra. Explicit practicella utilis et bona ex dictis Hebemesue principaliter abbreviata a magistro Iohanne de Parma. Deo gracias. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   861.2; 1295.10. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Catal. Of incipits further addenda, in: Speculum 43 (1968) 101. Auch z.B. in Vat. Pal. Lat. 1157, f.68va\endash 70rb (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schuba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   S.116, mit Lit.); Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 153, f.271v (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Powitz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). Augsburg, UB, Cod. II. 1. 2\u176 \'b0 38, f.188ra\endash 193ra (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haegele\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.200). }

