\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  167vb\endash 168rd {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus medicinalis Quid pro quo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam ea que sunt utilia in curationibus egritudinum inveniri ubique quandoque non possunt, placet hic dicere que airabalonomice (!) possunt poni idest quid pro quo \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85. Predoca in al. Se. Po. Medicamento medulla cervi (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  die Lyell-Hs. Bietet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro Zepon medicaminis medullam cervi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Pro yanti flore mirta. >Explicit quid pro quo< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch z.B. in Oxford, Bodl.L., Lyell Empt. 2, f.48vb\endash 51va, vgl. A. de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 La Mare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Catalogue of \u8230 \'85 medieval mss bequeathed to the Bodleian Library by James P.R.Lyell (Oxford 1971), S.281. Vat. Pal. Lat. 1280, f.55ra\endash 57ra (siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schuba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.361), Explicit variierend. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   1274.1; 1129.2.}

