\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  289ra\endash 296rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus de Dacia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Calendarium cum tabulis }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text in Rot und Schwarz \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quere inter numeros in superiori parte istius tabule primacionis unum numerum ex illis inter alios numeros ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Et sciendum quod dies et hore incipiunt a media nocte precedente. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Saaby Pedersen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.334\endash 335)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  289rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In ista tabula sunt quattuor cycli sive linee ad sciendum, que litera est primationis lune et hoc per annos domini. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Saaby Pedersen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.334)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Darunter die Tabelle (umfa\u223 \'dft die Jahre 1292\endash 1672). 
\line 289v\endash 295r Zw\u246 \'f6lf Monatstafeln (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Saaby Pedersen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.334\endash 335). 295v \u220 \'dcberschrift des anschlie\u223 \'dfenden Schemas \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tabula Petri Daci de loco sive inveniendo in quolibet die an (!) media nocte sui incepto. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Saaby Pedersen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.360)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  296ra\endash b Erl\u228 \'e4uterung in Rot und Schwarz \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hoc primationum cyclo 4 linee descendentes cyclis 19\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 bus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (decemnovalibus)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   deserviunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... centri epicicli lune. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Saaby Pedersen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.331\endash 333)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. Fritz \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Saaby Pedersen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Petri Philomenae de Dacia et Petri de S. Audomaro opera quadrivialia, Kopenhagen 1983 (Corpus philosophorum Danicorum 10/1), diese Hs. Sigle Y) S.246f., Text 331\endash 360. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   1191 und 685. Zu 296r (Canon super calendarium): \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   680.}

