\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  378ra\endash 403rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hippocrates}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prognosticon cum commento Galeni interprete Constantino Africano cum comm. marginali}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Hippokrates \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnis qui medicine artis studio seu gloriosam seu delectabilem amicorum copiam consequi desiderat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kommentar \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Videtur michi quod ex melioribus rebus est, ut utatur medicus previsione ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  386rb II \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit prima particula libri prognosticorum Ypocratis. Incipit secunda particula libri eiusdem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  395vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit secunda particula. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  396ra III \emdash  403ra Hippokrates endet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nostroque sunt exposite ordine preceptorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  403rb Galenus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in quibusdam earum in quadragesimo vel in quibusdam earum in LX. Explicit liber prognosticorum Ypocratis cum commento Galieni. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   1002.2. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Diels\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Handschriften der antiken \u196 \'c4rzte, I 20 und 130 (ohne diese Hs.). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schuba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   zu Vat. Pal. lat. 1079, f.49ra\endash 552rb.}

