\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quo nomine benedicendi ars apud grecos et latinos vocitetur quidve ea sit et circa indagacionem civilis veritas tis (!) versari. Socratum Eucratem bene appositeque dicere rethoricam, pontificii vero civilisque iuris interpretes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... maioribus tuis parem te, superiorem te reddere curabis. Pridie ydus sextilis. Vale. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Ohne Widmung. 61v Baumschema \u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rhetorica \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  63v \u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exordium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  66v \u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  status qualitatis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   13546, f.a2v\endash e5v (Varianten). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Studien, I 242}

