\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Widmung 75r\endash v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ad instanciam Florentini civis compositum opus< Sepenumero mecum Hieronime mi maiorum nostrorum incuriam, ne secordiam aut ignaviam dixerim admirari ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  75v Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Positura ac distinccio quam Greci thesim dicunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut hic locabis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Studien I 242, und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sottili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   zu Clm 663, f.125r\endash 128r}

