\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  77r\endash 81v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Cicero}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio pro M. Marcello et pro lege Manilia (47\endash 49)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Oracio Ciceronis pro M. Marcello< Diuturnum (!) silencii p. C. quo eram hiis temporibus usus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... non arbitrabar maximus (?) hoc tuo cumulus accesserit. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Im Anschlu\u223 \'df Exzerpt aus Cicero: Oratio pro lege Manilia 47\endash 49 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reliquum est de felicitate quam nemo de seipso prestare potest meminisse et commemorare de altro (!) possumus, sicut equum est, homines de potestate deorum timide paucaque dicamus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in rempublicam conservandam atque augendam communitatis (!) etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  82r\endash 88r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iacobus Publicius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ars Tulliano more epistolandi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Widmung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non me fugit illustrissime princeps quantum et oneris et insolentis existimacionis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De officio et genere epistorum (!)< Epistolarum officium ut maioribus nostris visum est, dicitur, quo absentes hiis de rebus que animo extrinsecusve geruntur, cerciores facimus. Harum genera tria sunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  87v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut trito cottidianoque usu te maioribus tuis parem equalemque et nostris superiorem reddas. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Im Anschlu\u223 \'df 87v\endash 88r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De temporis annotacione< Sex nonas Maius October Iulius et Mars ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ceteri deca septima ponunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia, 17607). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec habui illustrissime princeps que ... et meliorem existimacionem tibi ipsi te ut exoptabis reddent. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck z.B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   13546, e6r\endash f5r. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia II 5871 ('Epistularum officium ut maioribus ...'). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sottili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   zu Clm 4393, f.266v\endash 278r und Stuttgart, WLB, HB XII Poet. lat. 4, f.186r\endash 195r.}

