\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  107r\endash 115r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Alexander Halensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exoticon sive de vocabulis graecis et hebraicis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >TExoticon (!) magistri Alexandri de Halis< Et dicitur ab ex quod extra et otis: auris quasi extra aurem, ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Chere theoron (!) quem gignos crucis andro phalandro (!) / Cauma litos sex qui iabin (!) se gnoti philos qui: Expone O andro: aries quem theron: video gignos: nudum in phalando: ligno crucis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 114r mit Dist.19: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Troclaten calon copos uranos come ciclon ... et olos: Expone sic ciclon copos: rotunda incisio come ... obliquum. >Explicit exoticon magistri Allexandri de Halis< Qui si alicua (?) correcciorem et perfecciorem inveneris (?), non dedigneris sed utile tuum (?) affectuose amplectere. Greca vel hebrea possunt generare latina, non econverso, ne sit preposterus ordo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Distichon 1\endash 19 mit nachfolgenden Erkl\u228 \'e4rungen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: T. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Teaching and learning latin in thirteenth-century England, Cambridge 1991, I 304\endash 322; 301 diese Handschrift genannt, aber nicht ber\u252 \'fccksichtigt. \emdash  Zum Autor: O. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weijers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Le travail intellectuel \u224 \'e0 la Facult\u233 \'e9 des arts de Paris: textes et ma\u238 \'eetres (ca.1200\endash 1500), I: R\u233 \'e9pertoire de noms commen\u231 \'e7ant par A\endash B, Turnhout 1994, S.56\endash 57.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

