\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  115r\endash 120r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Garlandia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Praepositiones graecae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In lucem grece ponuntur prepositive Pone decem iungens octo numerumque tenebis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... 'Differencia quedam' Proson productum ... prosopopeya figurat. Prosoppeia (!) a prosopa et pero is: fingo quasi ficcio novi pere (!). Expliciunt preposiciones greci (!) Iohannis de Garlandria (!) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  120v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auszug (II 1068\endash 1230) aus dem 'Compendium Gramatice' ed. Th. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haye\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , K\u246 \'f6ln u.a. 1995, Text S.61\endash 269, hier 135\endash 142, \u220 \'dcberlieferung (diese Hs. S.44: Auswahl wie in Dublin, Trinity Coll., Ms. 270, fol.11r\endash 13r. Nachzutragen Weimar, Th\u252 \'fcr. LB, Q. 108, f.185\endash 189r, siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kristeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iter Italicum, III 434).}

