\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  121r\endash 160r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Poggius Florentinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Facetiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Facecie Poggii< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorrede \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Multos futuros esse arbitramur (!) qui has nostras confabulaciones tum ut res leves et viro gravi indignas reprehendant ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad ingenii exercicium scripsit. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Taletani (!) qui et plebei sunt ut plurimum navigio victum querunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  160r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... hiis dictis cadaver recubuisse. Opus faceciarum Pogii Florentini explicit feliciter primo (?) sabbato post festum pasce 1467. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia II 12448 (mit dieser Hs.). Explicit \u228 \'e4hnlich in Zeitz, Stiftsbibliothek, Cod.13a (Philos. Nr.5), f.71v}

