\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  217r\endash 228v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Engelbertus Admontensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dialogus concupiscentiae et rationis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam ut dicit Seneca communis vox nature est quod omnes appetimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nisi deus cuius plena sola fruicio faciet nos beatos. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rot: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit dyalogus moralis completus per studentem Henricum Goralicz (?) anno domini 1467 feria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sexta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   gestrichen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quinta post festum Michaelis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  20 Kapitel. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: Opuscula philosophica celeberrimi Engelberti abbatis Admontensis, ed. Demetrius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hueber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (in der Literatur h\u228 \'e4ufig falsch: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 J.C. Pez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Regensburg 1725, S.67\endash 102 (non vidi). Siehe VL\u178 \'b2 II (1980) 535\endash 549, hier 54f. G.B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fowler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Intellectual interests of Engelbert of Admont, New York 1947, S.187 Nr.8; (ders.), Manuscripts of Engelbert of Admont, in: Osiris 11 (1954) 481\endash 482. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Facult\u233 \'e9 des arts, Nr.92aj (mit dieser Hs.). Vgl. W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Baum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hg.), Engelbert von Admont, 1998, S.280. \emdash  Zum Schreibervermerk vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Colophons\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Nr. 6578 (diese Hs.)}

