\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Prolog \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Subscripta sunt sumpta de ternario Boneventure eo quod de triplici via ad sapientiam tractat< Ecce descripsi eam tibi dupliciter, Prov. 22. Cum omnis sciencia gerat trinitatis insigne vestigium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nunc primo breviter meditacionis formam licet (!) inspicere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et affectu et benevolencia debemus in ipsum tendere. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Enth\u228 \'e4lt Prologus und \u167 \'a71\endash 2. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: Bonaventurae ... Opera, Quaracchi, VIII 3\endash 7. Vgl. B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventurae scripta authentica dubia vel spuria critice recensita, Rom, 1975, S. 23, 129.}

