\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  252v\endash 253v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta de contemptu rerum terrenarum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quatuor de causis consulitur contemptus diviciarum. Prima quia earum amor retrahit ab amore dei ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  253v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... si non usui impendantur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius: Terrena omnia servando amittimus, sed bene (bne cod.) largiendo conservamus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus: Si vis esse mercator optimus, fenerator egregius ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Da temporalem substanciam ut recipias hereditatem eternam. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Gregorius Magnus, Moralia in Iob, XVIII 18 (CC SL 143A), \u228 \'e4hnlich \u246 \'f6fter; auch Bonaventura, Sermones dominicales 43, 9. \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Augustinus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Mit Varianten bei Alanus ab Insulis, De arte praedicatoria, PL 210, c.124}

