\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  159r\endash 160r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 M. Valerius Probus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De notis antiquis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Est eciam circa perscribendas vel paucioribus litteris notandas voces studium necessarium, quod partim ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... B e e p p v q p (!) i bonae (!) ex edicto (!). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Keil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GL, IV 271\endash 275 (zum Explicit vgl. Apparat). Auch in Clm 716, f.102\endash 103 (Hartmann Schedel, 1504)}

