\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  160v\endash 162r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola (de rebus geographicis)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum vestra (?) humanitas instincta (?) a veteribus (?) sit qui nata diligencia historicis disciplinis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... horas conservandas ..allit (?). Vale. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Kaum lesbar. Rest von 162r leer}

