\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  164v\endash 165r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Glossarium latinum breve}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nitrum dicitur a Nitra provintia ubi si in estate prolixior pluvia terram insudaverit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Beda, In proverbia Salomonis, III 25, 145) ... \emdash  165r am Schlu\u223 \'df \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Dipsas grece genus aspidis est quod latine dicitur situla ... nec tristiciam sentit moriturus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u228 \'e4hnlich Isid. etym. 12,4,13 und 32). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hilaris letum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... plaudens gaudens gestiens. Iobel grece remitto, inde iubeleus remissius. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Handwechsel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

