\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (nicht lesbar) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >... de vita solitaria epistola incipit e greco in latinum traducta< Agnovi litteras tuas ut hy qui amicorum filios ex ingenita ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... studio se proponit. etc. Vale. 
