\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  184rv {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta (de legibus)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Leges imperiales (?) licet vere et iuste sint, tamen imperfecte et incomplete ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... improbanda sunt (?). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Mit Noten, z.B. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Populus est cetus ... Iusticia }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  185rv {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta de arte metrica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quod scansio in heroicis triplex est ... Curandum est ut pedes alternat (!) ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  185v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Congruum est in pentametro ... Pentameter cum exametro ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich Vat. Reg. lat. 786, f.18\endash 19v (unter der Rubrik \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aliqua breviter hic notata in compositione metrorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

