\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  186r\endash 188v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Marius Servius Honoratus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De centum metris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finalis in omnibus metris indifferenter accipi, solucio est cum pro una syllaba longa due breves ponuntur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (variiert vom Original), Metra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Metra iambica locis imparibus quinque recipere possunt pedes, iambum tribrachum spondeum dactylum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  188r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ionica a minore ... Ionica a maiore ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (diese Kapitelfolge), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reliqua deinceps metra non ea lege ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  si tibi usus scribendi precium voluptatis exolvat (!). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Keil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GL, IV 457,5\endash 467,19}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  189r\endash 191v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Perotti}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De generibus metrorum (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit liber Nicolai Perotti de metris< Pes est metrica constitucio (!) sillabarum. Est autem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut Constantinus. Nunc dimissis pedibus de metrorum racione disseramus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Hier ohne Widmungsbrief (`Nihil a te iocundius ...\u180 \'b4). 189v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Metrum est connexio quedam atque ordinacio pedum ad delectacionem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  191r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut Homerus inquit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Textl\u252 \'fccke etlicher Kapitel (A IIIv bis B IVv), siehe unten 200r. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Peoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [c]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orum tria sunt genera ... Tercia dimetrum anacreo[nticum] ... ut misera est humana vita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C Ir).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Auf dem Rest der Seite Zitate, in abweichender Folge, aus dem Widmungsbrief (A Ir): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Multa in his discerentur que nescisse rectius fuisset. Ponderari non memorari sentencias cupimus ... Pluris nos facere alium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... similium ineptissimas reprehensiones. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schlu\u223 \'dfkapitel 191v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Postquam metrorum species executus sum, superest ut te admoneam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... tantum que in usu maxime erant. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  192r leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Text verglichen mit Hain 10892 (Venedig 1491). Nachweise siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Oliver\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Perotti, S.148. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leonhardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Mensura syllabarum, S.270 zu B 120.2 (f.189\endash 203 'De generibus metrorum' und 'De metris Horatii et Boethii'). \emdash  Zu 189v Initium auch in Forli, Bibl. com. A. Saffi, 454, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kristeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iter Italicum, I 231. Auch im Vat. Reg. lat. 786, f.19v\endash 36}

