\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  192v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Perotti}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De origine urbis Bononiae (excerpta)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Io. Gwidot(is)< Potes tibi hoc facere coniecturam summi mei erga te amoris ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... honestissimam speciem viderer fraudasse. / Aut enim cum primo sui iuris essent ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... mille sexcenti triginta septem. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Siehe unten zu 207r (Adresse lautet sonst: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Iohanni Guidotto viro gravi atque prestanti salutem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  193r\endash 199v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Perotti}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola de metris Horatii et Boethii ad Helium Perottum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Isagogicon moralis philosophie per Leon. Aret.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  so f\u228 \'e4lschlich auf linkem Heftrand. \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex omnibus immortalis dei erga me beneficiis duo sunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  194v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Usus autem est Oracius in eo libro ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  198r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Nunc promissi nostri memores Boetiana metra exequemur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (im Druck D IIv); am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iam satis terris / Mercuri facunde ... Pho[e]be silvarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (zu Kapitel 2), 198v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sex et viginti apud hunc autorem metrorum genera comperimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (nicht im Druck). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primum dicolon distrophon ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  198v/199r Sprung von Metrum 7 auf 18. \emdash  Endet 199v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... optamus cepisse te fructum intellexero. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia, II 6998 (Padova, Univ., 784, f.25\endash 40. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   10891\endash 10894). Verglichen mit Hain 10892. Auch in Firenze, BNC, Magl. XI. 141 (f.72\endash 100 De metris und De metris Horatianis, siehe P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 McGurk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Catalogue of astrological and mythological illuminated manuscripts of the Latin Middle Ages, IV Astrological mss. in Italian libraries (other then Rome), London 1966, 36, und im Vat. Reg. lat. 786, f.36r\endash 45v}

