\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  206r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Georgius Trapezuntius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Franciscum Barbarum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Geo. Trapezuntius equiti (?) Fran. Bar. Veneto S.< Reddite michi sunt tue littere quibus scribis ut Crysostomi opus a me nuper traductum ad te mittam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... humana (?) studia reduxisti. Vale ex Ro(ma) V Kalendas Mayas 1450. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in London., BL, Royal VI D. 4, f.296v}

