\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  234r\endash 253r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta de rebus naturalibus (ex Aristotele aliisque)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex operacione XI (?) docti auditoris est iudicari super sentencias dicentis decem habens easdem causas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  234v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sol facit estatem et hyemem omni anno \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Auctoritates Aristotelis 9, 219; De gen. animalium D2, 767 a 5\endash 6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Luna cum mense ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  usw., 244v/245r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mel melius est ex cera nova non veteri ... Mel bonum simile est auro \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Auctoritates Aristotelis 9,86\endash 87) ..., 246r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Femina est que (!) mas occasionatus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Auctoritates Aristotelis 9, 196), 249v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Empedocles dicit ..., Democritus dicit quod causa horum est sperma ..., Lucanus ..., Arestoteles (!) ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  250r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod intelligimus ex animalibus est ..., Sensus tactus ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  251v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sensus saporis ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  252r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mus ..., Palumbus ..., Turtur ..., Perdix in coitu facit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 253r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pullificacio piscium ... Pisces in mari parce commedunt carnes. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich in Reims, BMun., 867, f.81\endash 92 ('In principio'). Stellen z.T. in den 'Auctoritates Aristotelis' (ed. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hamesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Louvain/Paris 1974). Exzerpte (nicht n\u228 \'e4her bezeichnet) aus Aristoteles, De animalibus, im Vat. Reg. lat. 786, f.63v\endash 91}

