\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lamola quem genuit veneranda Bononia musis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Eloquio virtus quem supra astra (!). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2 Distichen. 
