\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  126rb\endash 129vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de beata virgine Maria }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Erwierdigkait des wei\u223 \'dfen glanczes ist ier geben, zierlichkait Carmeli des perges. Gloria Libani data est ei, decor Carmeli, Ysaie 35 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Verba ista per prophetam Ysaiam ad laudem et gloriam benedicte virginis sunt dicta sicut aperte testatur beatus Bernardus in quodam sermone scilicet laudis eius, qui incipit Loquamur aliud (!) de laude Marie virginis etc. Cum tamen secundum eundem, si alicuius hominis omnia membra verterentur in ligwas, laudes eius non sufficeret enarrare ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  129ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et devote ei vale valde decora. Quod nobis impetrare dignetur ipsa tota pulchra in secula benedicta. Amen. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  129ra Exempla \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoddam exemplum sequitur vel duo. Aput urbem Tholosam in Octitana ligwa (!) celebrem fratribus Carmelitis ibidem adhuc locum non habentibus erat residens Iudeus dives ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  129va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Intravit igitur capitaneus ordinem cum substancia sua tota, multis ibidem virgo beata cepit coruscare miraculis usque in hodiernum diem, prout wlgi fama efficaciter docet prestante Ihesu etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  129va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Preterea grande miraculum contigit in eodem ordine in eisdem partibus scilicet Occitanie aput montem Pessulanum qui tribus vel quatuor dietis distat a Tholosa. Nam mons ille mari vicinus est et ob hoc sunt ibi maiores et frequenciores tempestates. Cives igitur propter securitatem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  129vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... cepit choruscare miraculis nec cessat usque in presentem diem ex gloriose virginis beneficiis Christi que eius filii, qui est benedictus in secula. Amen. 
\line Nota autem dictum Bernhardi de gloriacione habitus et tytuli et de regule antiquitate ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Pudet enim modernos sequi antiquos quasi ad nichilum sint vocati nisi ad apparenciam religionis, quorum iudicium eo maius est quo perfecciores habuerunt magistros etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. \emdash  Dialekt des deutschen Textes oberdeutsch. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  131ra\endash va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rescriptum bulle Iohannis XXII. de indulgentiis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic nota quod dominus papa Iohannes 22. divinum cultum volens ampliare ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  131rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota de supradictis curatus sancte Genofephe Parisius ordinis canonicorum regularium bullam vidit in Avinione ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zeugen f\u252 \'fcr die Bulle und der Reskripta, namentlich \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Heinricus de Palude cum magistro Sigwerto ... magister Richardus de Bliton doctor sacre theologie qui fuerat provincialis ordinis nostri, puta gloriose virginis dei genitricis de Carmelo ... ego fratrer Sigwertus magister sacre theologie provincialis Almanie ... et ego frater Cunradus Altinger professus ... omnia predicta inveni ... in quodam magno libro magistri ordinis videlicet Bernhardi Ollerii generalis ordinis nostri, qui tunc temporis visitavit Parisius, ex cuius libri registro manu propria copiavi predicta in perpetuam genitricis dei memoriam. Amen. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  131va Versus (4) 
\line \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Clarior aurora fer opem mortis in hora 
\line Natum implora quod succurrat sine mora. 
\line Hic (!) que signantur a quoquam si reprobantur 
\line Ni revocentur eius viscera maledicentur.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  131va\endash 132vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de festo Mariae Nivis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur de festo Nivis beatissime Marie virginis in die sancti Dominici et Oswaldi. Ibidem ante (!) imperio suo acceleravit nivem. Sicut avis disponens ad sedendum aspergit nivem, Eccli. 43\u176 \'b0. Premisso miraculo tempore Liberii pape ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et glacies sustinebant vim ignis et non tabescebant. Quod et nobis concedat Christus eius filius. Amen. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachbemerkung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item si vis nota septem regiones aeris secundum Aristotelem: Prima roris scilicet infima, secunda nivis, tercia grandinis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Moraliza de frigore, de nube, de floris et fructuum dulcedine generaliter. etc}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  132vb\endash 134ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de visitiatione beatae Mariae virginis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Feria VIa quatuor temporum in adventu vel in visitacione beate virginis etc. Magnificat anima mea dominum et exultavit spiritus meus, Luce 1\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (46)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Karissimi, magnus dominus, ymmo maximus, cuius magnitudinis non est finis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Non despicere hominem iustum pauperem et non magnificare virum peccatorem divitem etc. }

