\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  136ra\endash 138rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Conradus Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancta Barbara virgine (cum nota) }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorbemerkung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O medium o oculi mentis eius, scilicet instar principii divini et nominis eius, hinc medica oculorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De sancta Barbara virgine< Soror nostra parvula est et ubera non habet, Cant. VIII\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (8)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Nos videmus inter creaturas corporales, quod ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  138ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... de qua dicit apostolus: Quam oculus non vidit nec auris audivit etc. Quam nobis prestare dignetur etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit editus a quodam suppriore Wiennensi Carmelita fratre Cunrado Dinkelspuhel. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Etymologie \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota: Siriace bar interpretatur filiacio et bara lectus vel creatura. Unde et Petrus dictus fuit Bariona idest filius columbe. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  138rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quod super filiacione beate Barbare a domino triplex allocucio ei fienda iubetur, primo a prelatis suis eam baptizancium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Speculum sine macula etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Thema entsprechend in Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, 29, f.1r. \emdash  Ein Karmelit Conrad von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl nicht bei Deckert oder Lickteig}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

