\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  138va\endash 140vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones II de praesentatione beatae Mariae virginis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) 138va\endash 140ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De presentacione beate virginis< Ascensiones in corde suo disposuit, Psalmo LXXXIII\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Dilectissimi. Instat festum benedicte matris dei virginis gloriose videlicet quo presentata fuit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut indefesse perseverent in caritate finali; dicunt (?) ultimum: Ecce nunc benedicite domino. Rogemus virginem etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  140ra\endash 140vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur alius sermo de eodem< Visa est archa testamenti in templo domini et facta sunt fulgura et voces ... et terre motus. Ita scribitur Apok. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (11,19)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Presentem sanctissimam virginis festivitatem sancte Marie in templum domini presentacionem multi astruunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad satisfaciendum. De quibus singulis applica. etc}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

