\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  144ra\endash 145vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo pro festo sanctae Mariae Magdalenae }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Pro festo sancte Marie Magdalene< Sic exhibete membra vestra servire iusticie in sanctificacionem, Rom. 6\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (19)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Karissimi, huic doctrine totaliter consensit, ymmo perfecte hanc regulam adimplevit beata Maria Magdalena ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... qui nos non vocavit in immundiciam, sed in sanctificacionem, sanctificet et nos. Amen.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  145vb\endash 147vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo pro recommendatione ducis Wilhelmi Bavariae (1435)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Arenga pro recommendacione ducis Wilhelmi Pavarie defuncti anno domini 1435< Collocet eum dominus cum principibus populi sui, Psalm. 112 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (8)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Dilecti, quoniam de terreno principatu aliqua tractaturi sumus, qui a deo est sicut omnis potestas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Erw\u228 \'e4hnt werden im Text Karmeliten, die S\u246 \'f6hne Adolf und Wilhelm. \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et nos cum eis vocemur in eternam patriam. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schmidt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Geschichte der Erziehung der bayerischen Wittelsbacher ..., Berlin 1892, S.XIX Anm.4. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  148rb Nota de populo \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De tercio membro si placet poterit fieri distinctio populo (!) dei et sathane. Primum dominus redimit a peccatis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zitiert wird \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de regimine principum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia turpia opera ut delectaciones corporis impediunt ascensum ad sursum etc. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  148rb\endash 154ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancta trinitate}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) 148rb\endash 149ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam ex ipso per ipsum et in ipso sunt omnia, ipsi gloria in secula, Ad Romanos XI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (36)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . De sanctissima trinitate ac indivisa unitate hodie ecclesia sancta solempnizat, de qua tanto est loqui periculosius quanto est ad capiendum difficilius. Unde Augustinus in libro 1\u176 \'b0 de trinitate et allegat magister distinccione 2a primi dicit, quod hec beatissima trinitas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... cum cantat ecclesia in prosa: Salve mater salvatoris dicens 'Salve mater pietatis et tocius trinitatis nobile triclinium verbi tamen (?) incarnati speciale maiestati preparans hospicium' \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Raby\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Christian-latin poetry, S.349) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hanc pro gracia suppliciter salutemus dicentes Ave Maria. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) 149ra\endash 154ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam ex ipso per ipsum et in ipso sunt omnia, ipsi gloria in secula, ubi supra. Festum sanctissime trinitatis ex institucione Karoli \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korrigiert aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Magni propter plures causas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... maxime in arduis materiis trinitatis, benedicite. Si cui nimis prolixa videntur aut populo nimis alta, lector eligere potest quod voluerit. Rogemus dominum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  151r unten Schema zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  essencia \emdash  mens, memoria, ratio, voluntas. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Gleiches Thema oben f.2r. \emdash  (2) Initium \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Festum sanctissime trinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   mit anderem Thema auch in Neapel, BN, VIII. A.7, Nr. h (vgl. 'In principio'). }

