\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Motto GOT}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Genitor per genitum glorificet genitos gratis / Ubi (!) super (!) Empedicles de circulari figura O / Thaw super nos. Ezechiel IX\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (4)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Amen. \emdash  >Sermo de dedicacione bonus< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Introibo in domum tuam in holocaustis etc. usque ibi Iniquitatem si aspexi etc. Ps. 65 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (13)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Si rex aliquis vel imperator domum aliquam construeret, in qua omnes quacumque afflictione gravati sublevarentur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in domo infernali miserias. Ab introitu illius domus oremus ut nos custodiat dei filius Ihesus Christus qui in trinitate vivit et regnat. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Predigt mit \u228 \'e4hnlicher \u220 \'dcberschrift und \u228 \'e4hnlichem Incipit in Clm 28202, f.114v. \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Empedicles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   zitiert oben f.134rb. }

