\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  159va\endash 163va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de origine ordinis fratrum Carmelitarum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit tractatus de origine ordinis fratrum beate Marie dei gentricis de monte Carmeli. Qui ordo incepit ab Helya et Helizeo prophetis dei sanctis et primo de patris Helye sompno, quod sequaces debent sui incedere in albo habitu ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... tempore Honorii pape IVti ipsum eius auctoritate dimiserunt et albas cappas assumpserunt etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Gedruckt?}

