\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  189rb\endash 204ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iacobus de Voragine (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collationes de mortuis (XVIII)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non est vir in domo sua ... in die plene lune reversurus est, Prov. VII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (17\endash 20)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Siquis quereret, cum (!) illa mulier dilacerata facie, scissis vestibus ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) 189vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Materia communis. \emdash  Fili supra mortuum produc lacrimas, Ecci. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ecclus. 38,16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Quia naturaliter homo compatitur homini, caro condolet carni ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3) 190rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Communis. \emdash  Non contristemini sicut et ceteri qui spem non habent, 2a ad Thes. IIII\u176 \'b0. Nemo minus dolet de re perdita quam is qui credit eam firmiter reinveniri ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3) 190vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Consolamini invicem in verbis istis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Thes. 4,18)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Nemo habet racionem recusandi consolacionem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  usw. 
\line Vorletzte Collatio 199rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Resurget frater tuus, Iohannis XI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (23)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Licet in absentacione persone multe dilecte oriatur dolor ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad quod bene responderi posset, quod in egestate magna temporaliu. Rogemus. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Letzte Collatio 200va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gloriosa dicta sunt de te civitas dei, Psalmo LXXXVI. Karissimi. Scitis quod cum regnum aliquod herede destituitur, divitibus et pauperibus mesticia generatur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... propter amorem domini mei Ihesu Christi etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1) Auch in K\u246 \'f6ln, Hist. Arch., GB 4\u176 \'b0 184, f.37v (anonym). \emdash  (3) Auch in Besancon, BM, 241, f.153 'Sermo secundus' (CGMBP 32 p. 169) und 242, f.177 'Sermo communis pro mortuis' (p.170): Iacobus de Voragine, Collationes de mortuis. \emdash  Alle in Clm 28202, f.124ra\endash 132rb und f.112ra\endash 114vb. \emdash  Nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP}

