\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  204ra\endash 209va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones duo de nativitate beatae virginis Mariae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) 204ra\endash 206rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ab inicio et ante secula creata sum etc., Ecci. 24\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (14)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Considerare debemus causas et utilitatem multiplicem que fuit in creacione beate virginis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... lucem magnam; lux orta est eis. Rogemus ipsam ut nobis lucem eterna (!) procuret etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) 206rb\endash 209va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ego sum panis vivus qui de celo ... vivet in eternum. Reverendi patres et domini. Licet huius panis sacramentalis tam miranda et et excellens sublimitas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad gloriam preparacio et ad vitam eternam produccio, ut supra in themate. Ad quam vitam nos omnes perducat qui sine fine in evum trinus et unus regnat in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1) Auch in Augsburg, SuStB, fol. cod. 420, 159rb ('In nativitate BMV').}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

