\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  211ra\endash 247rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De tribus punctis poenitentiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce nunc tempus acceptabile, 2\u176 \'b0 Cor. 6\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Duo sunt tempora hominis, unum iusticie quod incipit in hominis morte ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... contra caritatem, contra fidelitatem, contra triplex ius, ecclesiasticum, naturale et divinum. A quo nos custodiat qui sine vivit et regnat. Amen eternaliter. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 180\endash 186, hier 184; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initien, N.v.D. 258\endash 272. \emdash  Vorne im Inhaltsverzeichnis Thomas Ebendorfer zugeschrieben.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Hinterspiegel: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Brief an einen W\u252 \'fcrdentr\u228 \'e4ger des Karmelitenordens (Iohannes Soreth?)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reverende in Christo pater, domine prestantissime ... magister ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (durch Besch\u228 \'e4digung nicht lesbar). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Occurrit michi tantum in presens (?) Aristotelis summi philosophi in ethicis ... Sane cum venerabilis pater frater Wilhelmus nostri sacri ordinis ut puta ordinis fratrum beatissime dei genitricis virginis Marie de Carmelo provincialis provincie Allamanie superioris cum adiuncta sibi huius imperialis civitatis Nurbergensis conventus fratrum caterva volens vestram ... suscipere personam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... cum omnibus suis subiectis fratribus ad cuncta vestra beneplacita semper grata et accepta. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Darunter zierlich eine unleserliche Unterschrift. \emdash  Wilhelmus Amman war Provinzial von 1452\endash 1458 (siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Deckert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.141 Nr.15 und Reg.). Ordensgeneral dieser Jahre war Iohannes Soreth, an den das Schreiben gerichtet sein d\u252 \'fcrfte. }

