\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Anfang fehlt (f.43\endash 47). 48r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hortor eciam patres meos presidentes, ut per aspersionem sangwinis domini nostri Ihesu Christi habeant diligentem oculum ad fratres infirmos ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... eternaliter est benedictus. Amen. >Fratris Nicolai Lackmann sacre theologie doctoris ordinis fratrum minorum quintum verbum directorii sui foeliciter finit.< Pro labore detur scriptori perpetua morte non mori. >Amen. Mathafaris.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Vorne im Inhaltsverzeichnis IVr: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus de agonizantium commendacione et informacione fratris Nicolai Lackman doctoris ordinis minorum, folio 43. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wadding\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , XI (1932) 126. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   II 1,386; II 3,1232}

