\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  56v\endash 61r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de disciplina christiana}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit libellus beati Augustini de disciplina ecclesie< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  57r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Locutus est ad nos sermo dei et depromptus est ad exhortacionem nostram dicente scriptura: Accipite disciplinam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ego et pater unum sumus. Convertere ad dominum ipso adiuvante qui vivit et regnat in secula seculorum. >Explicit libellus beati Augustini episcopi de disciplina ecclesie< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  PL 40, 669\endash 678. CC SL 46 (ed. R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vander Plaetse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S.207: I,1. Vgl. S.XXIII}

