\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Omelia beati Iohannis Crisostomi super illud ewangelii Mathei 'Ve mundo a scandalis'< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (18,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ve mundo a scandalis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Necesse est enim ut veniant scandala}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , verumtamen ve homini illi per quem scandalum venit. Videtur quidam specialiter designare Iudam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... honora parentes in quantum te non impediant a servitute Dei, hoc est imperatoris tui, cui est honor et gloria ... Amen. >Explicit omelia beati Iohannis Crisostomi super hoc ewangelium Mathe 'Ve mundo a scandalis' de monachis pulchra dicens< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe: CC SL 78 (ed. G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Morin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1958), p. 503\endash 506. \emdash  Chrysostomi Opera omnia II, 486\endash 487. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  96v Origenes: In Numeri 22,22 (excerptum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Venerabilis Origines super illud Nm. 22 cap. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (22)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  < Stetit angelus domini contra Balaam ostendens quomodo divina sapiencia ex malis scit bona multa elicere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ex illis sciret maiora bona elicere. Hec ille etc}

