\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Liber beati Iohanis Crisostomi de reparacione lapsi< Quis dabit capiti meo aquam et oculis meis fontem lacrimarum. Oportunius nunc a me ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... alia medicamenta non queras etc. Deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber beati Iohannis Crisostomi patriarche Constantinopolitani de reparacione lapsi per fratrem Math(iam) F(arinatoris) ordinis carmelitarum 1472 Erffordie. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest von 124r leer. 
