\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  155r\endash 162v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speculum anime}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Speculum anime magistri Hainrici de Hassia incipit. Capitulum primum< Anima mea, novi quod curiosa sis rimando que foris sunt et assidue de fenestris habitaculi tui cuncta que circa te sunt conspicis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... mirificam in finem ultimum reduccionem etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Versus: Explicit hic anime speculum que te videt in se \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qui facis ut pro te sistat requiescat et in te. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Magistri Hainrici Hassonis sacre fronesis professi anime speculum foeliciter explicit. Deo gracias. Mathafaris. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  In 15 Kapiteln. Rest der Seite (5 Zeilen) leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   8401, 8402. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   418 (ohne diese Hs.). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kreuzer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Heinrich von Langenstein, S.74 Anm.196 (mit dieser Hs. und weiterer Literatur)}

