\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  163r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Damiani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Contra intemperantes clericos (excerptum, cap.VII)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Petrus Damianus de ancillis clericorum< Vos alloquor, o lepores clericorum, pul\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [pa]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  menta dyaboli, proieccio paradisi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nec habebit requiem die ac nocte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Apok. 14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Hec Petrus Damiani de ancillis clericorum< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 145, 410. MGH Epp. Kaiserzeit Epp. IV,3 Epist. 112 S.278,1. Vgl. K. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Reindel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , I S.36}

