\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  163r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Damiani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De caelibatu sacerdotum ad Nicolaum papam (Praefatio)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Idem ad papam de incontinentia episcoporum< Nuper habens cum nonnullis episcopis ex vestre maiestatis auctoritate colloquium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... videantur in culpa. >Ad papam de incontinencia episcoporum Petrus Damiani epistola< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 145, 379\endash 381}

