\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  163v\endash 164r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Damiani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Institutio monialis (excerptum e cap.XI)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Petrus Damiani epistola de Venecii (!) ducis uxore nimium delicata< Veracis et honesti viri didici relacione quod narro: dux Venetorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quodque perhibet mortua, testatur et viva. >De Venecii (!) ducis uxore prius nimium delicata et in putredinem mersa Petri Damiani epistola explicit< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 45, c.744.}

