\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  164r\endash 165r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Damiani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Institutio monialis (excerpta e cap.VI, VII)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Meditacio mortis et et (!) extremi iudicii Petri Damiani foeliciter incipit< Pensandum est cum iam peccatrix anima vinculis incipit carnis absolvi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quam condidit deus usque nunc neque fient etc. >Meditacio mortis et extremi iudicii Petri Damiani explicit< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 145, 737\endash 742}

