\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  165r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Blesensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Compendium in Iob (excerptum)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Petrus Blesensis in glosa morali super Iob dicit de religiosis< Illud mihi precipue materiam doloris subministrat quod hodie viri religiosi ... de ferculorum numerositate contendunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... certe hec caro et sanguis revelat miseris. >Hec Petrus Blesensis in glosa morali super Iob< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 207, c.803\endash 804}

