\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  165r\endash 165v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Damiani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber qui dicitur Dominus vobiscum (excerptum)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Petrus Damiani ad Leonem papam, inclusum in libro Dominus vobiscum< Iuxta consuetudinem meam non ad fontem Tuliane eloquencie, sed ad divine sapiencie pocius auctoritatem trito calle recurro ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Christi me simplicitas doceat. >Hec Petrus Damiani ad Leonem papam, inclusum in libro Dominus vobiscum< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 145, c.232\endash 233}

