\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  165v\endash 167r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Blesensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  165v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Epistola Petri Blesnensis (!) ad quendam qui hesitabat ad quam religionem transiret< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  166r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Viro venerabili dominoque in Christo karissimo R. abbati sancti Andeoni (!) Petrus Blesensis Londoniensis archidiaconus salutem et in correccione fratris verum se exhibere fratrem. Asseris te in omnibus requiem quesivisse et in omnibus dolorem et laborem generaliter invenisse ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad salutem tui arbitrii libertas dirigatur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit epistola Petri Blesnensis (!) ad quendam qui hesitabat ad quam religionem transiret< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  167v\endash 168v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. Lena \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wahlgren\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The letter collections of Peter of Blois, G\u246 \'f6teborg 1993 (Acta Universitatis Gothoburgensis ..., 58), S.201 (Handschrift in Auflistung ohne Angabe des Textbestandes genannt)}

