\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  169r\endash 189v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Eneas Silvius (Pius II)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio ('Non est apud')}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo bonus Enee Silvii poete laureati expost pape Pii< Non est apud me dubium viri ac femine circumstantes quin plerosque vestrum admiracio teneat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quam promisit dominus diligentibus se in regno celesti. Ad quod vos meque perducat Ihesus Christus quem cum patre ... regnantem per omnia secula seculorum profitemur. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit sermo bonus Enee Silvii laureati poete expost Pii pape secundi mutato nomine. Deo gracias. >Mathafaris< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: J.D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mansi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Pii II. ... olim Aeneae Sylvii Piccolominei Senensis orationes ..., Bd. 1, Lucca 1745, S. 54\endash 106. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sottili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Nr.90: Clm 215, f.329v\endash 342r}

