\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  190r\endash 190v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Alanus ab Insulis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Contra amorem Veneris (excerptum)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Infra hec Alanus in rigmo quem fecit contra amorem Veneris qui incipit: Vix nodosum valeo nodis denodare etc.< Dulce malum amor est et dulcor amarus Inimica caritas inimicus carus ... Subdit: A natura principe lex est instituta Ut sub certo tempore sub etate tuta ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Castitatis immemor castitatem vendit. Hec Alanus ubi supra. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Siehe unten f.217r. Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Vernet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Po\u233 \'e9sies latines..., 266.}

