\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  193r\endash 197r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernhardus de Kraiburg}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Brief an Silvester Pflieger}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Invectiva et declamatoria epistola Bernhardi de Krayburg< Bernhardus de Krayburg obsequutor humilis ecclesie Salczburgensis dulcissimo suo patri reverendissimoque domino salutem dicit, episcopo Chiemensi viro maturo et prudenti salutis et sua novissima memorari. Nudius tercius cepi mecum mirari super iniquitate huius seculi, presertim super ea malicia, que per omnem statum in nostra nobiscum volvitur etate ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quam affectus cupit. Vale. Ex Salczburg X. Kl. Augusti anno LIII\u176 \'b0. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 197v leer. Bl.198\endash 204 (leer) ausgeschnitten. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Thesaurus anecdotorum..., VI 3,362\endash 367; E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Herrmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Venit aquila de cuius volatu delebitur leo ..., in: Festiva lanx. FS Johannes Sp\u246 \'f6rl, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1966, S.95\endash 117, hier S.96 Anm. 6. \emdash  Auch in Einsiedeln, Stift, 328, f.315. Budapest, Magy. Nemzeti Muz., 211, f.25v. Clm 14185, f.371v\endash 374r}

