\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  205r\endash 214r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Apologia ad Guillelmum abbatem Cluniacensem}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Appologeticum beati Bernhardi abbatis Clarevallensis< Venerabili patri G. (?) frater Bernhardus fratrum qui in Clarevalle sunt inutilis servus salutem in domino. Usque modo si qua me scriptitare iussistis aut minus aut nullatenus acquievi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... hoc non est detraccio sed attraccio, quod ut vobis semper fiat omnino precor et suplico (!). Valete. >Explicit liber beati Bernhardi dictus Apologeticus ad fratres ordinis Cluniacensis. Deo gracias< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  PL 182, 898\endash 913 (in der Hs. ohne die 'Prefatiuncula'). Bernardi opera, ed. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   et H.M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , III 81\endash 108}

