\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  214r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Alanus ab Insulis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rhythmus de incarnatione Christi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Metra de sacramento ewkaristie< Exceptivam accionem verbum patris excipit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dum deludit racionem, dum naturam decipit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  214v letzte Strophe (mit Abweichungen): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Solis lumen nube tectum sub velamine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nostri vergit in defectum nec ebet in lumine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In affectum dans effectum sol natus de virgine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In effectum dat profectum nubis sub caligine. >Expliciunt metra de sacramento ewkaristie< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  PL 210, 577\endash 580. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dreves/Blume\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ein Jahrtausend ..., I S.286. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 6042. Analecta hymnica 20, 1895, S.15. Siehe auch 'In Principio'. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  214v Versus ('Sex lucror') \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In ecclesia acquiruntur sex bona:< Sex lucror in Syon peregrinor et instruor oro \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Adiuvor a sanctis, in quorum laude laboro \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacris participor, domini de morte recordor. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia 17607}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

