\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  217r\endash 219r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Alanus ab Insulis (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Carmen de virginibus ('Vix nodosum')}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Carmen Alani probans virgines et non mulieres esse ducendas< Vix nodosum valeo nodum denodare ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ergo nupta virgini in amore cedat Et innupta mulier nuptam antecedat. >Explicit carmen Alani probans virgines et non mulieres ad matrimonium esse ducendas< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Mit Glossen zu den Mythologica, 217r (aus der 'Ecloga Theoduli'): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quod inventor litterarum Grecarum fuit Cadmus. Unde in Theodolo: Grecorum primus vestigat gramata Cadmus, Inventrix litterarum Egiptarum (!) fuit Ysis, Carmentis autem poetissa Latinas litteras primo advenit. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 20763. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vernet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Po\u233 \'e9sies latines ..., 266. N.M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ring\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The poem Vix nodosum by Alan of Lille, in: Medioevo 3, 1977, S.165\endash 185 (Diese Hs. Sigle P, vgl. S.178)}

