\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  219r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Carmen de desolatione civitatis Constantinopolitanae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Grecorum gens induere cilicio dolenter ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ne nequam plebem sordibus subsannent nos pagani. >Explicit carmen de desolacione civitatis Constantinopolitane facta per Turcos anno domini 1453< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 7270. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Kleine ma. Dichtungen ..., 299. \emdash  Auch in Bern, 506, f.91r, und Erfurt, Amplon. Q 345 und Q 12 (CA 4\u176 \'b0 12, f.203v\endash 205). In Erfurt sind Teile dieser Handschrift geschrieben}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  219v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notizen und Exzerpte}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota bene quod quinque sunt fluvii inferni. Quorum primus vocatur Letheus interpretatur oblivio ... Secundus Flegeton ... Tercius est Acheron ... Quartus Cochitus ... Quintus est Stix ... De istis datur versus: Stix odium, Flegeton ardens, oblivio Lethes, Cochicus luctus, triste sonat Acheron. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fuerunt quidam viri fortes urbium conditores, quibus mortuis homines qui eos dilexerant simulachra erexerunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... deos estimaverunt et coluerunt. Hec Ysidorus libro 7\u176 \'b0 Ethimologiarum c.25 de invencione ydolorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Isid. etym. VIII 11,4 'De diis gentium'). 
\line (3) Sp\u228 \'e4ter eingetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quod a mane usque ad meridiem dominatur ignis, a meridie usque ad crepusculum noctis dominatur aer ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Illius est mensis cuius dat lunacio finem}

