\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  241r\endash 243v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Responsio de antiquitate ordinum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam dubitatur a quibusdam de antiquitate ordinum mendicancium nec non de confirmacione ordinis fratrum heremitarum sancti Augustini et fratrum de Monte Carmeli, ideo hic ad utrumque dubium respondebo. Et primo ad primum de antiquitate ordinum quattuor. Ad cuius intellegenciam est advertendum quod dicit textus decretalis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et sic de utroque dubio veritas elucescit etc. >Deo gracias. Anno domini 1472 per fratrem Mathiam Far(inator)is Erffordie< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  244r\endash 250r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Andreae (Ps.)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summula de processu iudicii}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De processu iudicii spiritualis< Antequam dicatur de processu iudicii, notandum, quid sit iudicium et quot sunt eius species et que sint persone ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... omnis enim bonus doctor laudem propriam et vanam gloriam capere non debet, sed magis profectum eorum quos informat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini 1260 dictata est hec summula iudicialis et processus iudicii. Laus Deo. Amen. Rescripta vero anno domini 1473 per fratrem Mathiam Farinatoris ordinis Carmelitarum Effordie in die Gregorii martiris. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ioh. Andreae irrt\u252 \'fcmlich zugeschrieben. Summula de processu iudicii, ed. A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wunderlich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Basel 1840; siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Geschichte..., II 1877, 225}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

