\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  250r\endash 252v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Heimburg}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Appellation Herzog Sigmunds an Pius II. (Jan. 1461)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Doctor Georgius Heymburgh istam appellationem fecit contra sanctissimum papam Pium, qui eum maledixit, excommunicavit et omnia bona sua infiscari iussit. Vis consilii expers mole ruit sua. Vim temperatam in sublime provehit deus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Horat. carm. III 4,65\endash 66). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Papa Pius iam pridie per breve non testatum, sed anulo piscatoris obsignatum fertur excommunicasse Georgium Heymburch ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... omnibusque remediis lege et moribus introductis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit appellacio Gregorii Heymburgh utriusque iuris doctoris, in qua domino pape Pio secundo non modicum detrahit. Utrum autem bene vel male, est alciorem habentis sensum quam ego habeo iudicare. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Siehe P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Johanek\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , VL\u178 \'b2 3, 637. K. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneider\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   zu Cgm 975, Nr. 37. Mindestens 11 Zeugen bekannt}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  253r\endash 254v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Christophorus Martignoni}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   (frater): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Brief zur Einberufung des Generalkapitels in Asti nach dem Tod des Iohannes Soreth (1471)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Epistola pro capitulo generali Astensi convocando< Frater Cristofferus Martignonus artium et theologie magister nec non tocius ordinis fratrum beate Marie de Monte Carmeli procurator et vicarius generalis universis et singulis ... salutem, Ex nostris mandatis, ymo verius apostolicis infrascriptis firmiter obedire \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Schlu\u223 \'df der Salutationsformel als Initium verkannt). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Litteras sanctissimi in Christo patris et domini nostri domini Sixti divina providencia pape quarti ... ... quarum tenor talis est: Sixtus episcopus ... Cristofero Martignono ... Inter ceteros ordines in agro domini plantatos sacrum ordinem beate Marie de Monte Carmeli ... ... per obitum cuiusdam Iohannis Soreth ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sigillum appendi mandavimus. Datum Rome apud sanctum Martinum in montibus die vigesima sexta mensis Novembris millesimo quadringentesimo septuagesimo primo cum nostra manuali subscripcione. >Frater Cristoferus procurator et supradicti ordinis vicarius generalis etc.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zum Leben des Christophorus Martignoni siehe Daniel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 a Virgine Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Vinea Carmeli, Antwerpen 1662, S.536 \u167 \'a7963}

