\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  255r\endash 256r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De cometa (1472)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De cometa< Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 LXXII in diebus Ianuarii et subsequentibus diem sancti Pauli heremite apparuit primo super orizontem Newmarkt stella caudata ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Beschreibt die astronomischen Ph\u228 \'e4nomene. Dann folgen die Deutungen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Significaciones eius discrete ponere volo: Homines erunt bellicosi, invidiosi, mendaces ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... propter comete magnitudinem et longitudinem. Deus suam ecclesiam dignetur misericorditer protegere etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finis ingenii (?) per quendam astrologum prope Nuerenbergam in opido Newmarckt concepti et estimatur ipsius Kunigsperg Wyennensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (scil. Regiomontani). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Some tracts on comets, in: Archives internationales d'histoire 11, 1958, 225\endash 250, hier 236 Anm. 41; (ders.), A history of magic..., 430}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

