\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3r\endash 23r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus ex Aristotelis libris excerptus (1451)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum omnis nostra felicitas in speculando consistat, ideo de speculacione scienciarum sciencie breviter videamus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  4r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... His visis aliquas auctoritates librorum videamus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aristoteles dicit primo phisicorum: Tunc unumquidque scire arbitramur, cum causas et principia usque ad elementa cognoscimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Folgen Zitate aus der Physik. \emdash  14r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In primo celi et mundi dicit Aristoteles: Naturalis considerat corpora et magnitudines ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Folgen weitere Zitate aus 'De celo'; 17r 'De generatione', 17v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De numero bonorum honorabilum: Una sciencia nobilior est alia quia est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  18r 'De anima', 18r\endash 22v Metaphysik, 18r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In prohemio metaphysice dicit Aristoteles: Omnes homines natura scire desiderant. Sensus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Endet mit zwei Exzerpten aus den 'Meteorologica' 22v\endash 23r; 23r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secundo metheorologicorum dicit Aristoteles: Cum congellatur nubes, nix fitt (!), sed cum congellatur vapor, fitt (!) pluvia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ergo pluvialis aqua est dulcis, est mare vero salsum. \emdash  1451. \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite und 23v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 24r Accessus iuris canonici et versus memoriales \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ignorancia iuris non excusat, quare breviter aliqua sunt videnda ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kopie des Textes von 1r}

