\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  53va\endash 82va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Agenda et legenda per quadragesimam}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hac die usque ad nonam officium differimus pro eo quod dominus noster hora nona in cruce expiravit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  53vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Legitur quod Elizeus propheta descendit de Samaria ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zitierte Autoritat\u228 \'e4ten in Auswahl: 54va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Damascenus in libro contra errores gentilium, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  55rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Haymo super apostolum, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  55vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Philaretus de crisi diuturna, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  56ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iohannicius de organizacione corporis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  58ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hugo in libro de claustro anime, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  61ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Allexander super 3\u176 \'b0 Machabeorum, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  62va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Basilius in Exameron: Nimia distancia errare nos facit circa tria ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  63vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Athanasius in symbolo, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  65rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ippocras in medicinis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  66rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Egesippus, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  67va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Philaretus de naturis morborum, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  68rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Seneca de clemencia ad Neronem, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  69ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iohannicius de regimine sanitatis: Medicina non solum est sumenda a langwidis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  70ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Commentator de impressionibus aeris dicit: Terre motis et tempestates aeris duobus de causis generantur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  usw. bis 79vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Galienus in anchidoro (!): Cumque sanguis humanus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  80rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bartholomeus in prima practica sua: Numquam wlnera tergenda sunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  81ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Constantinus de naturis liquidorum: Qui naribus suis sanguinem sorbet calidum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  81va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Alkabicius in theorica planetarum: Sol cumque ecclipsim patitur grandem, tunc superficies ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  
\line Endet 82rb\endash va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Teophilus in breviloquio: Misso in stagno sale mox tacent ipsi rane tacte. Dic: nisso (!) sale panis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  p\u176 \'b0anis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  cod.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Christi in stagnum nostri cordis protinus silent rane demoniorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (82va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Parabola (?) Christi patet in epistola \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ad Rom. 3,10)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et 3\u176 \'b0 Ysaie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Is 53,1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Dixit Ysaias Domine quis credit auditui nostro etc. >Et sic est finis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Am Rand rot die Wochentage, 54rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Feria Va \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  u.\u228 \'e4. \emdash  Rest von 82v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f.137, f.277r\endash 290r (umfangreicher; Initien im einzelnen von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thurn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   verzeichnet)}

