\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Priusquam te formarem in utero meo novi te ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ier 1,5)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In verbis predictis adventus nativitatis beate virginis laudabilis ostenditur in multis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et hoc tangitur ibi: Antequam exires de ventre sanctificavi te etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  L\u228 \'e4ngere Marginalnote 122r. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 123r Sermo \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Signum magnum apparuit in celo, Apok. XII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecclesia sollempnizans de gloria in qua mater dei assumpta in celesti curia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... a calore eius misericordie. Sequitur ex alio latere de XII stellis in capite, divisionem facias ut placebit}

