\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec ex quodam sermone de assumpcione quem habuit dominus Melchior. Signum magnum apparuit in celo mulier amicta sole ... stellis XII, Apok. XII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Mulier hec signat beatam virginem que fuit amicta sole}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... fieret figura probitatis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Behandelt die 12 Sterne der Marienkrone. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich in W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.f. 121, f.163r\endash 164r. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  124v Exemplum de sacerdote virgini Mariae devoto (auf unterer Blatth\u228 \'e4lfte eingetragen): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quidam sacerdos virgine (!) Marie devotus contra dolorem V wlnerum Christi eam cottidie per hec verba 9 consolari studebat dicens: Gaude dei genitrix virgo immaculata ... }

