\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De portacione crucis ex voto. Moraliter loquendo de portacione crucis Christi advertendum, quia Christi crucem spiritualiter portant diversemode diversi; quidam portant cum Symone Cyreneo, quidam cum latrone ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... coronetur in celo eo quod nemo coronabitur nisi legittime certaverit etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und Bl\u228 \'e4tter 125a\endash b leer. }

