\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1r\endash 24v \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Petrus Aureoli: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de conceptione beatae virginis Mariae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit tractatus de conceptione virginis Marie editus a fratre Petro Aureoli ordinis fratrum minorum, magistro theologie in Tholosa anno domini 1314< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorrede {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nondum erant abyssi et ego iam concepta eram, Proverbiorum 8vo (24). De concepcione immaculate virginis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Capitulum primum. Argumentum secundum ordinem< Virginem inquam (!) in originali fuisse conceptam videtur auctoritatibus biblie comprobari ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quoniam ipsa sola caput fidei et katholice veritatis a Christo constituta est. Qui cum patre et spiritu sancto in secula vivit benedictus. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 351c}

