\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  105r\endash 114v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Carpentarius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones in honore sancti Hieronymi }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  105r\endash 109v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo ad clerum de sancto Ieronimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (rot hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt:)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   fratris Iohannis Carpentarii provincialis< Adest nobis perceleberrimi patres ac domini dies optatus beatissimi patris et doctoris fidei Christiane sancti Ieronimi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... veri dei vobis promitto in hoc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite leer. 
\line 110r\endash 114v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De sanctissimo Ieronimo sermo ad clerum< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Oben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Ieronimo: Gracia domini nostri Ihesu Christi ... sit semper cum omnibus vobis. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nemo accendit lucernam et in abscondito ponit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 11,33)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verba hec in hodierne sollempnitatis missali officio leguntur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dator et rector dominus noster Ihesus Christus nunc et secula per cuncta benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  110v oben Bitte \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >O sanctissime Ieronime ora pro Io. Car. provinciali< }

