\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  128r\endash 129v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Albrecht von Eyb}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio in laudem Bambergae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ad laudem et commendationem Bamberge civitatis oratio< Bamberga civitas regia atque florentissima intra (!) clarissime et opulentissime patrie Franconie que plerumque Francia orientalis dicitur et inter Germanie nationes non minima ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Henrico et Kunigunde quibus Bamberga gaudet patronis in excelsis vivit et regnat per infinita secula seculorum benedictus. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: GW 9529, f.423v\endash 425. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia, II 1753. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sottili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Censimento, Nr. 106: Clm 522, f.192v\endash 194r, und Nr.221: W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M. ch. f. 59, f.333r\endash 334r}

