\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  129v\endash 134r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Poggius Florentinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Carolum Marsuppinum de obitu Laurentii de Medicis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Poggii Florentini ad Carolum Lauren   tii de Medicis laudatio funeris incipit< Si serius, mi doctissime Karole, ornatissimi atque amantissimi quondam viri Laurencii nostri debitum virtuti munus prestiti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... De exilio ad patriam, de carcere ad palatium et sanctiorem regionem vitamque beatam felici radio evolavit. Dixi. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Perugia, BCom., Fondo Vecchio, C 1, f.11r\endash 17r; Neapel, BN, VI D 2 (E 2 n\u176 \'b0 14), f.174v\endash 179r; Dijon, BM, 857 (491), f.27; D'Orville 59, f.72v\endash 78; Milano, Archivio di Stato, Codice Cibrario (or Codice Castiglioni) deperditus, p.259\endash 267. \emdash  Aus der 'Margarita poetica}

