\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  134r\endash 136r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Perotti}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio pro imperatoris Friderici receptione Bononiensi et versus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Pro serenissimi Romanorum regis domini Frederici iocunda receptione ex parte communitatis Bononiensis oratio Peroti< Si qua fides veri proferri maxime Cesar ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dii michi dent et tu que volo si mereor. 
\line >Versus Nicolai Peroti cum post orationem prescriptam imperator eum laurea coronasset< Cinxisti viridi Cesar mea tempora lauro Ecce meas ornat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... pro munere gratus cantabo laudes dum michi vita tuas. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: Albrecht von Eyb, Margarita poetica, ff. 273vb\endash 275ra; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sottili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   I, Nr. 98 f.133r. Auch in Clm 522, f.207r. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Studien, II 342\endash 343. \emdash  Zu den Versen: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia, I 712 (\u220 \'dcberlieferung). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 2798}

