\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  136r\endash 139v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo in quarta dominica quadragesimae (1475)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo 4te dominice Xlme presentis anni etc. 1475< Honeratis (!) penitencie sarcina, Io. 6to (?). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fidelibus Christianis pater sanctissime hodie rosa illa rerum animum (?) pulcherrima ad tocius populi Christiani solamen offertur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nach einigen Merks\u228 \'e4tzen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mens humana per devia currens in rectum trahitur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  beginnt die eigentliche Predigt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Honeratis (!) penitencie sarcina lo. c. v.8 (?). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Superioribus annis pontifex sanctissime presentis ewangelii lectio singulari exposicione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   variisque misteriis aperta est, sed inpresenciarum novo quodam ordine illam pertractare astringimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia eis volentibus deus vult. Et ita fiet per dominum nostrum ... per omnia seculorum secula. Amen. }

