\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  140r\endash 141v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sulpicius Severus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola dedicatoria et praefatio in Vitam sancti Martini et excerptum de Origene (dial. I 6) }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Epistola Severi Sulpicii ad Desiderium de vita sancti Martini< Severus Desiderio fratri ... Ego quidem frater unanimis libellum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... non loquatur auctorem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorwort \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur prefacio eiusdem episcopi Severi in vitam sancti Martini< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  140v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Plerique mortalium studio et gloria (!) seculari inaniter dediti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  141r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dicere maluissem. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u220 \'dcber Sulpicius: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum quod sanctus Severus Sulpicius discipulus edidit tres libros de vita et miraculis cuiusdam (!) sancti Martini ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... optimo latinitatis stylo composuit. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Exzerpt aus Sulpicius' Dialogi (I 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iterum notandum quod in primo libro dyalogi tercio capitulo refert ... de erroribus Origenis, de quibus in Alexandria inter episcopos et monachos feda certamina gerebantur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Nec vero ausus de quoque temere iudicare, prestantissimi tamen viri et doctissimi ferebantur in hoc certamine dissidere. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  139v unten \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Versus: Severus veris vitam depromere scriptis Gliscit Martini mirandam presulis almi. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vita s.Martini, Epistolae: SChr 133 (ed. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fontaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1967), S.248\endash 344. Dialogi: CSEL 1 (ed. C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Halm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1866), S.152\endash 216.}

