\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  156r\endash 159v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Carpentarius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestio ex dictis Arnoldi et Suchenschatz collecta}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Questio lectoris Carpentarii ex dictis Arnoldi et Suchenschatz collecta< Utrum ad peccatoris iustificacionem de necessitate requirantur cordis contricio, oris confessio et operis satisfaccio. Dicitur ad ambas partes prout moris est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ista namque sunt exil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [l]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ima que de presenti questione minus bene scio, que omnia sunt dicta cum omni honore et reverencia. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zu Michael Suchenschatz (+1414) siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. bibl. 5641\endash 5644. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  159v\endash 160v Excerpta et notata \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circa hoc quod dicitur penitencia esse sacramentum notandum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  160r \u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contritio, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  mit Zitaten aus Bonaventura}

