\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1r\endash 4r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Christianus Borgsleben}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ars praedicandi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum in his temporibus plures sunt universitates in quibus nutriuntur viri oculativi (!) sacris scripturis experti sicut et in actibus habentes ex acquisita sciencia et usu scripturarum legendi sedule modum colligendi dictandi modo collaciones modo sermones modo epistolas modo introductiones sive erengas (!) ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec extra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (statt: 'exempla')\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   aspicite vos qui proficere capitis (!) et per ingenium iuxta hanc minimam et quasi nullam artem colligere addiscite, pro me etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Leipziger Hs.: ' eciam Christiano')\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   fratre minorum deum exorate, qui hec puerilia tradidit (!) allicere vos sathagens ad maiora per hec parva etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Darunter: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  z. J. F. (?) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ausgabe von Georg \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Buchswald\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Ars praedicandi des Erfurter Franziskaners Christian Borgsleben, in: Franziskanische Studien 8 (1921) 67\endash 74 nach der Hs. Leipzig, UB, 616, f.1r\endash 4r ('aus Borgslebens Erfurter Zeit'). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Charland\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Artes Praedicandi, S.33. Siehe auch G. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mohan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia Operum Franciscalium, in: Franciscan Studies 35 (1975) 277 [1\endash 92] ('In Principio'). Initium auch beginnend mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Quoniam}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4v\endash 15v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de morte}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et mors ultra non erit neque luctus neque clamor neque dolor erit ultra que prima abierunt, ita scribitur Apoc. 21\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (4)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et assumitur pro nostri sermonis exordio. Reverendi mei, secundum sentenciam Origenis super epistolam ad Romanos sic inquiens: Mors dicitur multipliciter, primo enim mors dicitur separacio anime a deo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et hec est pena quam sancti abierunt eo quod hic rectissime vixerunt. Ista iam dicta possis applicare ad thema quodcumque volueris etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  16r\endash 26r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de laudibus et fructibus missae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De laudibus et fructibus misse< Honorabilis domine a. (?). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quia multum instatis de laudibus et fructibus misse aliqua scire ut hec possitis populo predicare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et ipsum ad devotionem excitare, ideo aliis occupacionibus ad momentum depositis volui desiderio vestro ... satisfacere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... perducuntur per veram et eternam salutem prestante domino nostro Ihesu Christo benedicto in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 26v leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  27r\endash 35r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de chorea}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Queritur de chorea an sit licita. Videtur quod sic, quia illud dicitur licitum et honestum quo deo deservitur et placetur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et secum ad gaudia celestia et ad coros (!) sanctorum transeatur prestante domino nostro Ihesu Christo benedictus (!) in secula. >Amen< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Halle, UuLB, Cod. 134, f.182r; M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, fol. 137, f. 31vb (hier beginnend mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Quaeritur utrum choreizare sit licitum et an chorea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  36r\endash 50v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Tractatus de confessione }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Considerandum est enim cui sit confitendum, et circa hoc queruntur plura, scilicet utrum sit confitendum presbitero ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kapitel 36v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Postea considerandum est cui presbitero sit confitendum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  44v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deinde considerandum est in speciali descendendo ad personas spirituales ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  47v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Postea considerandum est qualis debeat esse confessor et quomodo se debeat ad confitentes habere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  49v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deinde considerandum est de interrogacionibus faciendis a confessore ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed confessor discretus eliget secundum quod qualitas persone et verborum exiget et quod expedire videbitur. Hec enim dicimus ad erudicionem simplicium. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

