\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  55r\endash 79v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de negligentiis occurrentibus circa sacramentum altaris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In nomine domini nostri Ihesu Cristi Incipit tractatus de negligenciis circa sacramentum altaris et de remediis earum< Esto vigilans, dixit iste qui habuit septem spiritus dei et septem stellas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Apok. 3,1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ad angelum Sardis essclesie, ut habetur Apostolorum (!) tercio capitulo. Et intelliguntur dicta ad quemlibet fidelem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut post huius vite curricula possit cum eo in perpetuum regnare eodem prestante qui se ipsum per (!) nascendo dedit socium, moriendo precium, regnans imp(...?) in secula seculorum Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u196 \'c4hnliches Initium: G\u246 \'f6ttingen, SuUB, Theol. 157e, f.110ra. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  79v Dubitatio de ritu Carthusiensium (Anhang zum vorangehenden) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dubitatur an bene faciant Carthusienses finiendo missas sine benediccione. Videtur quod non per canonem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et proverbialiter dicitur: Si fueris Rome, Romano vivito more. Anno domini 1458. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schlu\u223 \'dfvers auch in Lilienfeld, 23, f.66v (in einer Sammlung von 13 Versen)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  80r\endash 110r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Indagine}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 :{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Expositio missae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Widmung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Karissime in Christo. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Desideras ut brevis expositio super officio misse tibi scribatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Volens autem tandem tue peticioni satis facere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Et sic digne ad celebrandum accedat. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  80v Kapitel 1 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ante misse celebracionem dominicis diebus aqua benedicitur exemplo Moysi et Helizei ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  81v Datierung und Lokalisierung (Eisenach 1457) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iste modus prope Ysenach in Thuringia in aliquibus villis servatur, sed tamen hoc semper cum timore dei facere debet et cautus esse, ne ex avaricia solus duas ecclesias officiat et filiis aut amicis redditus ecclesie donet, quia tunc peccaret gravissime. Prohibitum est hoc anno 1457. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ut quod meritis consequi non valeo, vestris oracionibus obtineam scilicet vitam eternam, per Ihesum Christum dominum nostrum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit exposicio misse fratris Iohannis Hagen Carthusiensis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Messe, S.52, 600.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  110v\endash 122v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Memento ut diem sabbati sanctifices}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Memento ut diem sabbati sanctifices. Sex diebus operaberis et facies omnia opera tua, septimo autem die scilicet domini dei tui non facias omne opus ... famuli sui Moysi, ut legitur Exodi vicesimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (8ff.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et illud preceptum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   non est tantum ceremoniale, sed eciam mortale, ideo omnes obligat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... que superius dicta sunt. Ideo hiis finem nomine domini imponam. Amen}

