\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  122v\endash 142v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dialogus inter Iudaeum et Christianum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorwort \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Legitur in libro regum quod Asverus spreta regina Vasci (!) eligit sibi Hester in uxorem sive reginam. Cui adiuncte sunt tres pedisseque. Fuit autem Hester regina valde speciosa ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et ita hoc operari (!) ut possideamus (!) vitam mereri eternam. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Dialog \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum uterque populus scilicet Christianus et Iudaycus non concordet in instruccione divinorum, necesse est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christianus: Quid prodest multa cavillacio ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut simul possumus (!) salvari. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich dem 'Tractatus contra Iudaeos' des Petrus de Pennis, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr.3310. Vgl. zu K\u246 \'f6ln, StA, GB quart. 66, f.16r}

