\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  187r\endash 197r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Indagine}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Soliloquium hominis devoti sua novissima providentis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Soliloquium hominis devoti suos defectus cognoscentis et deflentis ac sua novissima providentis< Verbum michi est ad te, o princeps regum terre, fili eterni regis, Ihesu Christe, fili dei vivi, ne confundas faciem meam, sed tua solita et benigna misericordia audi verba famuli tui ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut ad te dominum meum post huius vite misere finem valeam iocunde te duce pervenire, qui cum patre et sancto spiritu es benedictus deus in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit soliloquium predictum compositum per venerabilem patrem Iohannem de Indagine Carthusiensem anno domini 1458 in Carthusiam apud Erdfordiam etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mertens}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

