\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  197r\endash 207r{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Iohannes de Indagine}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De modo exponendi divina eloquia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In nomine Ihesu Christi incipit de modo exponendi et intelligendi divina eloquia sine exteriori et humano doctore< Beatus homo quem tu erudieris et de lege tua docueris eum, Psalmo 93 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ipse est enim qui docet hominem scienciam qui habet cathedram in celis et docet homines in terris, dicit sanctus Augustinus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... tenent duo precepta caritatis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  N\u228 \'e4chster Traktat schlie\u223 \'dft an. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. bibl., Nr. 4592}

