\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  211r\endash 234v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentum in 'Peniteas cito peccator'}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  211r\endash v Vorwort \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Non est dignus scientia qui insurgit sciencie preceptori. Anno domini 1479< Istam proposicionem scribit Boecius de disciplina scolarium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Istis premissis ad textum procedamus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Peniteas cito peccator cum sit miseratus iudex: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste liber sua divisione principali dividitur in duas partes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  234r Letzter Vers \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Non nuptas cupias nec res queras alienas. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  234v Ende des Kommentars \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in Egipto propter peccata hominum que continentur in versibus 'Sangwinis'. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finis adest cui (?) laus. 1479 Erffordie in die Saturni post Marie nativitatem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Als 'Summa penitencie' in Troyes, BM, 2015 (CGMBP s\u233 \'e9rie in-4\u176 \'b0, 2 S.825; vgl. 'In principio', \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   3255). Haupttext: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 13564; siehe dazu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Henkel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Schultexte, S.268f. (mit Lit.) VL\u178 \'b2 III, 393}

