\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  305r\endash 313v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Seneca (Ps.)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De formula honestae vitae (cum glossa interlineari)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Prolog \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quatuor virtutum species multorum sapientum sentenciis diffinite sunt, quibus humanus animus comptus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ac bene morigeratum virum efficiunt. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Interlinearglossen zum Anfang: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  numero, cardinalium, membra, philosophorum et virorum documentis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quisquis ergo prudenciam sequi desideras, tunc per racionem recte vivas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... compos ipse sui devitet insaniam aut deficientem contempnat ignaviam. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Letzte Glosse (zu 'ignaviam'): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  stulticiam seu ignoranciam. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Durchg\u228 \'e4ngig interlinear kommentiert. \emdash  Rest der Seite und Bl\u228 \'e4tter 313a\endash 313c leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Seneca, Opera. Supplementum, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haase\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Leipzig 1902, 67\endash 73; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barlow\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Martini episcopi Bracarensis opera omnia, 237\endash 250}

