\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  334v\endash 341v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Compendium in Anticlaudianum Alani}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Conpendium seu distigium in Anticlaudianum Alani foeliciter incipit< Magister Alanus peritus quondam in multis scienciis quendam autorem compilavit bene quatuor milium versuum vel plus, quem Anticlaudianum nominavit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet wie Clm 3586. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit venerabilis Alani compendium in Anticlaudianum< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ochsenbein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ZfdA 98 (1969) 81\endash 116, Text 93\endash 109; VL\u178 \'b2 3, 2\endash 4 ('Compendium Anticlaudiani'). \emdash  Auch im 3586, f.233r\endash 238v}

