\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  363r\endash 364v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aristoteles (Ps.)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Alexandrum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur de ordine vivendi quem ipse Aristoteles Magno Allexandro transmisit et dicitur arabice Tialacater (?) quod latine dicitur secretum secretorum. Hunc Iohannes Ispalensis translatum latine in latinum scripsit (!) regine Tarasie in Hyspania de dieta et custodia corporis sui et exscriptum (!) eius positum est hic causa breviacionis. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oportet te Allexander cum a somno a sponso (!) surrexeris, modicum ambulare et membra pariter extendere et caput pectere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Nam duobus modis homo inveteratur a.. (?) deficit vita naturali et debita qui ex siccitate provenit in hominem invincens (!) ipsum corpus destruit, secundo accidenti ex infirmitatibus et curis pessimis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zum 'Secretum secretorum' siehe Friedrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wurmser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Studien zu den deutschen und den lat. Prosafassungen des pseudo-aristotelischen 'Secretum secretorum', Hamburg 1970, Reg. S.288. \emdash  Auch in Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 44, f.2v. \u196 \'c4hnlich Bad Gandersheim, StiftsB, Gandersheim Hs. 222, f.393vb. Vat. Barb. lat. 165 (29)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  364v\endash 372v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Toledo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber de conservanda sanitate sive Diaetarium}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scribitur ab Ysaac in quinto viatici quod quicumque continuam wlt custodire sanitatem, stomachum custodiat, ne cum sibi necessarius sit cibus, eum prohibeat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  372r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et hec de balneis sufficiant. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Folgen vier Abschnitte \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Debes quoque sollicite custodire quatuor tempora anni ... Post hoc sequitur tempus estivale calidum et siccum, in quo exiccatur (!) colera rubea ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  372v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur autumpnus frigidus et siccus ... Sequitur hyiems et est tempus frigidum et humidum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nec habundancia cibi quia eo quod fit indigestio calida etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis regiminis principum (!). Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1413.6. Auch in Soest, Stadtbibl., 23, f.92 (bis Kap.11), vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michael\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.151 (mit Lit.); Uppsala, UB, C. 643, f.24v (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig). }

