\par \pard\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Amen (?) in cena domini sermo bonus de corpore Christi.< Probet autem seipsum homo et sic de pane illo edat et de calice bibat, prima Cor. XI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (28)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Aristoteles 2\u176 \'b0 de anima: Simile a simili nutritur, sic patet in cibo degesto (!), a quo corpus nutritur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Unde confusus et contritus post confessionem et penitenciam digne communicavit. 
