\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  9r\endash 15v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de passione Christi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Inclinato capite emisit spiritum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ioh. 19,30)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Iohannes de sancto Geminiano: Mors salvatoris, karissimi, quam hodie ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  12v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quantum ad secundam partem illius sermonis sciendum quod Christi passio fuit valde amara, ymmo amarissima ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... affectaret. Item nota aliud exemplum de dulcedine passionis Christi: Erat quidam homo bonus qui multum dilexit deum et ob reverenciam quinque wlnerum Christi cottidie dixit quinque paternoster. Hoc exemplum require in precedenti sermone \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (am Schlu\u223 \'df der vorangehenden Predigt f.9r). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Johannes Herolt 54}

