\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Item sequitur in festo sancto pasche sermo< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  16r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec est dies quam fecit dominus, exultemus et letemur in ea, Ps. 117 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (24)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sciendum quod presens festum vel festivitas precellit alias festivitates ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et stans in medio eorum dixit eis Pax. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  18v\endash 22v leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Iohannes Herolt 56 (expl.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  et sic vacuae redierunt ad suas sorores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \emdash  Vgl. 'Gesamtindex'. Herzogenburg, 66, 9r; 34, 83r; Melk, 409, f.99v; Schlierbach, 26, f.77va. M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, oct. Cod. ms. 85, 219. \endash > }

