\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Clemens episcopus servus servorum dei ad memoriam reducentem (!) causam cuius gracia deus pater filium suum celo misit ex alto quia inquid ipse nolo mortem peccatoris sed ut magis convertatur et vivat. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 At (!) illa verba beati Gregorii }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... se noverit incurrisse. Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCC\u176 \'b0 2 invenitur hec gracia etc. etc. (?) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.q. 160, f.148 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thurn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   II) und Nr.8 an: I.t.q.VIII, f.49v (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thurn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   IV). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  26v Forma absolutionis (tempore Nicolai V) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus noster Ihesus Christus per meritum sue passionis dignetur te absolvere et ego eiusdem auctoritate ... necnon sanctissimi in Christo patris ac domini domini Nicolai pape quinti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... penis eisdem respondentibus. In nomine patris ... Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Auch in L\u252 \'fcneburg, RatsB, Theol. fol. 77, f.175v; Ansbach, Schlo\u223 \'dfB, Ms. lat. 40, f.63r; Zwettl, 160, 210v}

