\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  121r\endash 124r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de dedicatione ecclesiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce tabernaculum dei cum ho. et ha. cum ei (!), Apoc. XX \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (21,3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Hystoria: Imperatorie maiestatis est tres implicacio (!) habere mansiones ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... tercia domus in qua quis quiescit est celum trinitatis; ad quam nos prodicet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   pater et filius et s.s. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Fiecht, 74, 238r}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  124r\endash 127r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de dedicatione ecclesiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Idem (?): Suscipiens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Ihesus vidit illum etc. usque 'manere', Luc. XIX \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (5)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ewangelium istud in quo agitur de conversione magni peccatoris scilicet Zachei legitur in dedicacionibus ecclesiarum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... aquarum conspersio idest lacrimarum effusio, plorum (!) posicio idest virutum assumpcio. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Klosterneuburg, 546, Nr.2. Budapest, E\u246 \'f6tv\u246 \'f6s L. Egyetem K\u246 \'f6nyvt., 42, Nr.8a, f.26\endash 30 (Expl. von Clm 3580 abweichend), vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sopko\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mezey}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  127r\endash 129v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo generalis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo generalitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   etc. Querite dominum dum inveniri potest, Ysayas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Is 55,6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Duo possunt notari, primo consilium prophete cum dicit: querite dominum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... veram fidem vilipenduntur; caudam visu delectabilem et perspicuam sicut tales etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.776. \emdash  Auch in Brno, SVK, A 87 (IV.Z.e.11), f.196v\endash 199 (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dokoupil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, Stiftsbibl., 284, f.95v}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  130r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sacramento eucharistiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Benedicamus patrem et filium etc., in ympno trium puerorum ad commendacionem sancte trinitatis. Exodi: Cum dominus aperuit Moysi volens eum mittere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korr. aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nutrire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ad pharonem (!) ut educeret populum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... 3\u176 \'b0 testimonio prophetarum. Nota benedicat vos}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  130r\endash 131v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ladislaus Postumus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio ad Nicolaum V}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nos Ladislaus rex etc. Car. serenissimo domino nostro pape Nicolao quinto pronuncciamus illa scripta in anno nostre etatis 13\u176 \'b0 14a die mensis Marcii. Maxime michi beatissime pater voluptas est ingens gaudium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nec audiam discolos enormesque iuvenes qui michi per adulacionem secus nituntur perswadere. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nicht vom Voran- und Nachfolgenden abgesetzt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia II 11681. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sottili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Nr.131, f.227r, Nr.139 f.197r. Vgl. Albrecht von Eyb, Margarita poetica, 267va\endash 268va}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  131v\endash 133r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De pane salutifero sive de corpore Christi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De illo pane salutifero qui est medicina infirmorum, vita mortuorum, viaticum peregrinorum, thesaurus egenorum, robur pugnatorum, virtus activorum, dulcedo contemplativorum. Hii sunt septem effectus vivifici huius panis, qui designatur per septem panes ewangelicos ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hoc petebat sanctus Ambrosius: Panis condidissime (!) habens omne delectamentum ... et dulcedine saporis cui repleatur anima mea i.r. (?)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  133v\endash 139r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancta Margaretha}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scit omnis populus qui habitat ante portas urbis mulierem te esse virtutis, Ruth \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3,11)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   idest ad beatam Margaretam. Unde in predictis verbis 'mulierem te esse virtutis' predicatur laudabilis in tribus. Primum est quod ipsa in primevo iuventutis sue anno ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... omnis pestilencia est agata (!). Rogamus etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis vorn genannt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 139rv De sex gradibus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fecit (Eerat cod.) rex Salomon thronum de ebore grandem et vestivit eum auro fulvo nimis qui habebat sex gradus, III Reg X\u176 \'b0 (18). Primus gradus est habere deum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et captivum de celo duxit. De secundo (?) exemplum de quinque fratribus Heremias (?).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  139v\endash 141r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De domibus columnisque sapientiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sapiencia edificavit sibi domum, excidit columpnas septem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prov 9,1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Nota quod Christus sibi triplicem domum edificavit, scilicet domum gracie, domum penitencie, domum glorie ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Numquam legimus tantam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Abbruch)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich in Freiburg, UB, 282, f.56vb (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hagenmaier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , I/3)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  141v\endash 145r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verteidigung des Dominikanerordens gegen Kritiker}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Divina providencia beatum Dominicum mirabiliter illustrante ordinem fratrum predicatorum ipse beatus Dominicus in altissima perfeccione instituit et fundavit, sed quidam non intelligentes veritatem sacrarum scripturarum sed pocius ignorantes ordinem predictum ... nituntur ... obfuscare ... Unde quidam emuli inpingunt sacrum ordinem predictum ... dicentes quod ordo predicatorum non servat formam apostolorum nec vivit secundum formam apostolicam propter tria: primo quia predicatores vadunt calciati, 2\u176 \'b0 quia predicatores abstinent a carnibus ..., 3\u176 \'b0 quia predicatores habent aliquem sui ordinis qui pecunias et alias elemosinas sibi datas recipit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hec est determinacio facta de perfeccione status ordinis fratrum predicatorum et (!) per Bernhardum (!) fratrem Iacobum de Voragine ordinis eiusdem archiepiscopum Ianuensem contra detractores. Istud predicavit Hermannus de Lazanna (!) de capitulo generali \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Leerraum)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   anno domini M. CCC XXVII. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zu einem Henricus de Lausanna oder Haereticus (12.Jh. [!]) siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , II 674. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli/Panella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr. 3878. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  145r\endash 146v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Medizinische Rezepte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oculis: accipe ligwam passivam et euffrasiam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Leerraum)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et de hiis stilletur et excoquitur aqua sicut ... Item: Quando est fluxus oculorum accipe masticis et grani albi ..., Accipe arma (!) piperis ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  145v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sucus absinthii infusus necat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Karlsruhe, Bad. LB, L 31, f.142 [Heinzer])\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  146r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ffacilitas partus.< Cyminum (!) cum melle et vino bibitum statim matricem cum fletu mulieris liberat ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  146v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ad peliculam in oculis ...< >Ad calculum ...< >Ad furtum ...< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  u.a. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \emdash ... Ut ovum induretur ... quod si contra murum proicies non frangetur}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  147r\endash 162v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De verbo dei et eius efficatia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primus titulus de verbo dei quod in ultimum spe concepta de dei misericordia consequenda (?) redeundum ad deum peccatorem promovet et movet; unde psalmus: Memor esto verbi tui ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zitiert werden Exempla, z.B. 148v: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item audivi quod quedam mulier de villa (!) dum sequeretur sermones de villa in villam expendisset quidquid haberet nec scieret (!) quo se verteret sedens turbata nesciens quid commederet, tunc lepus inopinate venit et sedit in eius gremio; quod munus sibi a deo datum; de cuius precio per dies plurimos fovebatur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Auch Verse, 151v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dat bona bissena sermo sacer et duodena Pascit et edificat verbum bene regat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vermutlich Exzerpte aus Stephanus de Borbone, De septem donis spiritus sancti. 
\line 160v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Quintus titulus< Quinto loco quod dominus efficaciam verbi sui subtrahit diversis generibus predicatorum et auditorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hoc exemplum valet (?) quod eciam vivi pro defunctis possunt satisfacere}

