\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  165v\endash 174r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pharetra fidei contra Iudaeos (eine Redaktion)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota triplicem cautelam; prima est in plurimis disputacionibus studeas eorum errores reprobare quam nostre fidei articulos probacionibus declarare, quia numquam proficiunt seria virtutum et veritatis nisi prius extirpentur spine et tribuli falsitatis. Secunda cautela est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet mit Kapitel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De passione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (173v). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iudeus: Vos dicitis deum pro nobis passum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .. viso enee (!) serpente omnes qui morsibus aliorum // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Abbruch am Seitenende. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli / Panella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr.3672}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  189r\endash 192r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce nunc dies salutis, 2. Cor. 6 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Nota: Medicus diligens infirmum et de eius curacione confidens inponit ei artam dietam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... usurarii redderent simplum. Sequitur hodie huic domui salus facta est; quam nobis prestare dignetur Ihesus Christus Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Melk, 987, f.43v?}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

