\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  195v\endash 199v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de dominica in passione domini}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Semetipsum obtulit immaculatum deo, Hebre. 9 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (14)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sancta conswetudo ecclesie habet quod pro mortuis facit oraciones et oblaciones ut deus misereatur ipsorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia nec timor sine fiducia et spes valet sine timore et penitencia. Rogemus ergo deum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Vorn im Inhaltsverzeichnis als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de dominica in passione domini}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  199v\endash 203v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de triplici munditia pro cena domini}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iam vos mundi estis propter sermonem quem locutus sum vobis, Ioh. 11 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ioh 15,3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Omnem hominem appetere esse beatum est ex dictis omnium antiquorum et appetitum nature tam certum ut nulli nisi stulto vertatur in dubium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  202r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Item per nostram mundiciam adimplemus voluntatem dei, require in libello plavio (!) numero tali XIIII c. primo membro. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zweiter Teil \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secunda mundicia que est nobis necessaria est mundicia oris ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... unde subditur Si volueritis et audieritis me bona terre comedetis idest me gustando videbitis. Psalmus: Gustate et videte. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Vorn im Inhaltsverzeichnis als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de triplici mundicia pro cena domini}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

