\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  203v\endash 214r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de septem virtutibus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Stelle dederunt lumen in custodiis suis, Baruch III\u176 \'b0 capitulo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (34)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sciendum quod per septem dies discurrit hominis vita et omnis etas huius seculi. Primus vocatur dies solis, secundus lune ... Per hos septem dies designantur septem virtutes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Die sieben Virtutes werden nacheinander behandelt und den jeweiligen Gottheiten der Wochentage zugeordnet: 213r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Septima est perseverancia que per Saturnum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... qui sanat omnes langwentes corporaliter et spiritualiter. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Vorn im Inhaltsverzeichnis als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de septem virtutibus}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  214r\endash 217r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de multiplici gratia dei}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gracia dei sum id quod sum, 1a Cor. 15 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (10)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Inter omnia que sunt homini in hac vita necessaria est gracia dei super omnia; primo quia homo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... a statu culpe et ad eum non redire. Rogemus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Vorn im Inhaltsverzeichnis als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de multiplici gracia dei. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Hamburg, Staats- u. UB, Petri 49, f.261v}

