\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  222r\endash 229v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancto Iohanne evangelista}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exaltabit (!) illum apud proximos suos, Eccl. XV\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (4)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sicut dicitur eiusdem XLV \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (20)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Ipsum elegit ab omni vivente. Hec verba predicta propheta presciens futura proprie locutus est de beato Iohanne ewangelista, cuius hodie festum agimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... de qua idem psalmus dicit: Porcio mea domine sit in terra vivencium; quod nobis prestare etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Vorn im Inhaltsverzeichnis als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de sancto Iohanne ewangelista}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

