\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  231v\endash 234r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de beata Maria virgine }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Induta est Hester vestimentis regalibus et processit, stetit in atrio domus regie ad interpellandum pro populo quem Aman prodere cogitabat, Hester 5 (1). Et ut scire possitis et cognoscere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in quo decore vel quibus virtutibus mater domini hodie processit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia ex passione Christi restaurata est eorum ruina. Rogemus ergo beatam Mariam. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Mit \u228 \'e4hnlichem Thema mehrere \u246 \'f6sterreichische Hss. (aber beginnend: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Hodie carissimi celebramus diem in qua sancta Dei genitrix ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).}

