\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  283r\endash 284v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Questio de peccatis< Queritur an peccata semel confessa iterum sit necesse confiteri ... >Iterum< Queritur an peccata semel dimissa iterum redeant quando reciditur in peccatum mortale ... Queritur an existenti in mortali peccato prosint opera de genere bonorum que facit ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  283v\endash 284v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Questiones de peccatis< Queritur si est aliquod peccatum mortale ita grave quod per dei graciam et misericordiam non possit deleri. Secundo si est aliquot (!) peccatum mortale ita leve ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Surge et vade in domum tuam}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

