\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  314r\endash 316v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo pro novo anno}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur sermo de novo anno< Actuum III\u176 \'b0 dicitur: Non aliud nomen est quo salvari possumus nisi in nomine Ihesu Christi. Unde figurative ponit quidam doctor nomine Symon de Monte, quod quidam prepotens rex edificavit quendam (!) civitatem opulentissimam; qua edificata multos in ea consideravit defectus; nam populus in ea vivebat sine omni lege ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dilata si vis etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Mit einigen Randnoten. \emdash  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis vorn aufgef\u252 \'fchrt. }

