\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  200va\endash 202vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stella clericorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quasi stella matutina in medio nebule peccatorum. Proprietates huius stelle possunt referri ad quemlibet doctorem fidei ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Bricht am Lagenende ab \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut dicere possitis cum propheta // \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   15050\endash 15080. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.4435. Auch in Clm 28202, f.89r\endash 97r, und Clm 3592, f.189r\endash 198v}

