\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  245ra (243ra)\endash 247vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Regulae iuris libri VI decretalium ordine alphabetico }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vorbemerkung Regula est que rem breviter enarrat. Non ut regula ius sumatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , sed ex iure quid est regula fiat. Per regulam enim brevis rerum enarracio traditur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Beginn \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Accessorium naturam consequi congruit principalis, li. VI. / Actus legittimi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (erstes Wort korrigiert) \emdash  Endet 247vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Utile non debet per inutile viciari, etc., li.VI. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Mit Noten. 
\line 247vb Zus\u228 \'e4tze, endend mit einem Merkvers \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bis mille sunt decretales, sed adde novem bis / Bis centum tituli, sed septem remanebis (?). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Verse auch in London, BL, Royal 9 A. VI, f.106v). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dolezalek\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , II. \emdash  Vorbemerkung auch in Douai, BM, 649, f.29\endash 30. Vgl. zum Initium 'In principio'. \u196 \'c4hnlich dem 'Commentarium in Digestorum titulum de diuersis regulis iuris antiqui' des Bulgarus Bononiensis. \emdash  Ohne Vorbemerkung in Klagenfurt, Bisch. Bibl., XXX e 11, f.102, und Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 141, f.79r\endash v. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  248ra (246ra)\endash 276va{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Explicatio vocabulorum tam iuris civilis quam canonici ordine alphabetico}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini amen. Quia in libris sacrorum canonum et in legibus imperialibus plerumque restat difficultas vocabulorum, que intellectu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [m]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   hominum et sensum obscurant, quemobrem (!) sub compendio certa et debita vocabula per cursum alphabeti eliciuntur et subiunguntur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... pocius est divinitatis quam humanitatis. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vokabular \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abigeus proprie dicitur ille qui pecora a pascuis et armentis (!) subducit et hoc abigendi studio ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  276va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Xenodochum< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et infirmi recipiuntur et curantur et alimentis cottidianis educantur, ut Il (?) illud C. de episcopis et cle. Et in autenticis de sanctis episcopis coll. IX post principium etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 2\u176 \'b0 249, f.141r. Brno, SVK, R 584 (D/K.I.a.18), f.79v\endash 99v; vgl. auch Reims, BM, 712, f.249. \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Abigeus dicitur proprie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.q. 6, f.2v; Gie\u223 \'dfen, UB, Hs. 747, f.116ra. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  276va\endash b Vocabularium iuris canonici lat./germ. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Actor sacher. Reus widersacher. Sentencia diffinitiva uszgesprochen urtail ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Census zinsz. Redditus gilt. Angaria ungelt. Aura morgengeb (!).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  277ra (274ra)\endash 291va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nepos de Monte Albano}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Libellus fugitivus sive Libellus pauperum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum plures libelli super causarum exercitiis a predecessoribus nostris facti fuerint, alii prolixi, alii cum magna solempnitate et subtilitate compositi, et pauperes presertim minores illa magna volumina vilipendunt tum propter caristiam tam propter subtilitatem nimiam, idcirco ego pauperibus et minoribus compaciens et nimiam subtilitatem reprobans ad opus reorum fugiencium ... presens scriptum seu libellum ... proposui ... componendum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  277rb Register. Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rescriptum non valet si tacita veritate et suggesta falsitate sit impetratum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  endet 291rb mit Kapitel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Contra prescripcionem excepciones< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  291va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Item prescripcio non nocet XXX an agenti pro libertate C. de lo. tpe. presi. 4 in fine. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und f.292\endash 298 leer. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Savigny\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gesch., V 503\endash 504. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ, II 314\endash 315. \emdash  Mehrere Drucke im 16.Jh. Auch in Freiburg, UB, Hs. 252, f.348ra. Stuttgart, LB, HB VI 95, f.27r. Graz UB, 363, f.186r, u.a.}

