\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  346\endash 352 (Kanzleistil) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  345r (332r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Samuel Karoch}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De beano et studente }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nudius cum sol per universum orbem sua extendit cornua singula montium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   cacumina, convalles quoque declinas (!) suo illustravit splendore ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed potius in asineitate desipere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (dar\u252 \'fcber\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   non intelligere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   vel tamquam ceci perseverari. etc. Finit congestum per Samuelem Karoth contextum quidem ob deverunciam (!) alme universitatis Lipsensis pro quo prandio poetatus est etc. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Karoch, Nr.21 (mit dieser Handschrift). Ferner in Basel, UB, F V 44, f.43\endash 44. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  348r\endash 349r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Samuel Karoch}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exhortatio coram rectore universitatis studii Lipsiensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incliti domini alme universitatis. Insignis huius studiis (!) rectoris licencia prehabita gressus meos ad vos eximios ac egregios dominos doctores dirigo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... incomptam meam deinceps regularem (!) inerciam etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec est exhortacio quam Samuel Karoth peroravit coram rectore universitatis totaque universitatis (!) alme studii Lipsensis in prandio Aristotelis Anno \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1466. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Karoch, Nr.13 (mit dieser Handschrift).}

