\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  353v, 356v\endash 357r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Lang}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notariatsentw\u252 \'fcrfe (1470)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) 353v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Subscriptio super litteram confirmacionis. Et ego Iohannes Lang clericus Augustensis diocesis ... notarius quia predictarum litterarum reservatarum presentacionem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... rogatus et requisitus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (11 Zeilen). 
\line 356v (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Forma procuratorii. Ego Iohannes N. de M. cooperator in divinis in opido imperiali Norlingen (?) Augustensis diocesis publice recognosco ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Erw\u228 \'e4hnt werden \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Udalricus Schaller, Georius de Gotzfeld. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Datiert am Ende \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... anno domini{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  LXX}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   pridie S. Agathe. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Alia forma. Ich Margaretha bekenn und vergich offenlich mitt disem brieff f\u252 \'fcr mich ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... so vil gewalts alsz er bedarff. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (4) 358r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vicarius reverendi in Christo patris ... Burckhardi ... episcopi Constanciensis ... dilectis decanis ... in Lauphain ... salutem ... Conquestus est nobis dilectus in Christo Iohannes Fuchs presbiter, rector ecclesie in Richtissen (?), quod quidam Iohannes de Strezingen (?) ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Datum Constancie anno domini etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und die folgenden leer. }

