\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1r\endash 2r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de gratia et amicitia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si gloriari oportet que infirmitatis mee sunt gloriabor. Deus ... quod non mencior \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II Cor. 11,30)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Qui per suam misericordiam meam forsan personam vilem vobis preesse voluit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nescio an Christiane amicicie putande sint, in quibus magis valet proverbium vulgare: obsequium amicos, veritas odium parit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Aug. epist. 82)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Teste Ieronimo in prologo super genesi loquente de amicicia vera ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sempiternam iuxta illud Mt. 19 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (17)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Si vis vitam ingredi serva mandata. Ad quam nos perducat Ihesus ... Amen.}

