\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  9v u.a. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notabilia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   9v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Notabile de lacrimis< Nota lacrimis impetratur quitquit (!) a deo postulatur. De hoc sunt octo exempla precipua. Primum est de Anna ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota propter peccatum luxurie hec mala contingebant: Primum deus delevit totum mundum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota a tempore formacionis Ade usque ad nativitatem Christi fluxerunt quinque milia annorum quadringenti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anima secundum Aristotelem sic diffinitur: Anima est actus primus corporis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zitiert auch die Definitionen des Expositor und Augustinus}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

