\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  135r\endash 137v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Swinfordia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 :{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Sermo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   (1458) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Dominica 2a post pasca< Peccata nostra ipse pertulit in corpore suo super ligno. Ita scribitur 1a Petri II\u176 \'b0 capitulo (24) originaliter et primitive et in epistola hodierna doctrinaliter et recitative. Queritur utrum passio Christi sit omnibus passionibus maior ... >Questio secunda< Queritur an mors Christi causavit nostram salutem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ista karissimi pensetis et in bono usque ad finem vite perseveretis, quia qui perseveraverit usque in fine, qui (!) salvus erit, Mt. X. Quod nobis concedat trinitas ... Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nicolaus Swinfurt anno domini LVIII\u176 \'b0 in Magdeburga protunc lector Hetzstedensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hettstedt)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  190r\endash 198r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moralizatio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   de Aaron, Abscondere, Abhominari, Abstinere \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aaron. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum Aaron fuerit summus sacerdos et pontifex legis dei a deo principaliter electus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et eidem precipue dedicatus, videtur quod per Aaron potest intelligi vir perfectus et maxime ecclesiasticus vel prelatus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  192r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et tantum de illa materia. Vide de Aaron capitulo de De sacerdote etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  192r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abscondere. Nota quod multa sunt genera absconsionum. Est enim absconsio avaricie, verecundie, luxurie, symonie ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  195r\endash v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abhominacio ... horum satellites atque consultores mundi leticiam sectatores Christi ecclesie pravi servitores. Patet quod deus abhominatur mundanos ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et abhominatus est hereditatem suam. Et hec de abhominacione sufficiunt. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  196r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abstinencia potest accipi dupliciter, spiritualiter et corporaliter. Spiritualiter quando quis abstinet a viciis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia vere restringit sanguinem}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  198v\endash 199r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones de nuptiis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Nota de nupciis< Queritur utrum solempnitas nupciarum sit de essencia matrimonii ... Queritur utrum prohibicio nupciarum a LXX usque ad octavas pasche intelligatur inclusive vel exclusive ... Queritur si nupcie celebrentur tali tempore interdicto impediant matrimonium contractum ... Queritur utrum tempore quadragesime possit contrahi matrimonium ... Queritur utrum Ioseph cognovit virginem postquam genuit filium suum primogenitum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... non tactu libidinis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite 199r leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

