\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  199v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Applicacio cur pestilencie et alia mala superveniunt nostris temporibus plus quam ante ipsa< In cronicis Romanorum legitur, quod cum Romani sepius succumberent in bellis consuluerunt deum suum, cur hoc accideret ... Invenerunt in una porta tria C, in secunda tria F ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quod in Roma est vanitas. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  4 Zeilen angef\u252 \'fcgt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum quod in Iohanne XVIII cap. dicitur Ihesum duxerunt ad Caypham in pretorio ... \emdash ... Hec Nicolaus de Lyra. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Augustinus, In Ioh. evang. tract. 114,1). \emdash  Rest der Seite 199v leer. }

