\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  210r\endash 214r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Legenda de sancto Vito patrono Bohemiae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit legenda de sancto Vito patrono Bohemie< In provincia Lucania sub temporibus Dyocleciani et Maximiani imperatorum multas virtutes Christo domino opitulante operabatur beatus Vitus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Celebrantur autem natalicia eorum sub die XVII Kal. Iulii prestante domino deo ... per infinita secula seculorum. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. BHL 8712}

