\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  275r\endash 280v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo pro novo anno diversis statibus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Pro novo anno diversis statibus< Sciendum quod sicut Christus hodie nobis pro novo anno tria maxima dona dedit, scilicet spem nostre resurrectionis ... Primo coniugatis do cingulum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  275v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secundo viduis do monile ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  276r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Virginibus coronula datur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  276v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequuntur alia munera ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  277r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Viduis speculum ... Virginibus datur crinile (!) ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  278r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequuntur alia munera: Primo principibus do aquilam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  278v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Consiliaribus dominorum et consulibus civitatum cignum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  279r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mulieribus coniugatis columbam ... Viduis turturem ... Virginibus phsip (!) psitacum ... Beginis fenix ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  279v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacerdotibus gallum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  280r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Est autem unum genus hominum, quod in nullo ordine est ... Et dicuntur cursores noctis et truffatores ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... omnes salvos faceret. Quod et facere dignetur qui vivit et regnat sine fine. etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schlu\u223 \'dfabschnitt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sed quid dabo pro novo anno istis ociosis panem ocio manducantibus? Im (?) kalten winter und kain prot in hausz ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Vade ergo piger ad formicam et disce vias eius, quomodo colligit in estate ut vivat in yeme videlicet Prov. 6\u176 \'b0 (!). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Pseudo-Isidorus, Testimonia divinae scripturae, prol. lin.10, ed. A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lehner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , CC SL 108D). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Augsburg, SuStB, fol. cod. 472, f.182ra (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Secundum principale de novo anno. Pro quo sciendum sicut Christus hodie ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \u196 \'c4hnlich Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Series nova 3619, f.180r (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Sicut Christus hodie pro novo anno tria maxima dona dedit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), u.a. (vgl. 'GI'). \emdash  Vgl. zu Clm 3554, f.123ra\endash 126rb}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  281r\endash 282v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notabilia de spiritu sancto}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum quod ignis excedit omnia elementa in tribus, in specie, in ordine, in virtute ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Notabile bonum ad idem s.s.< Qualiter ergo spiritui sancto preparanda sit habitacio. Notandum quod ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  282r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ad idem< Apostolus 1 Cor. 12 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (7)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dicit: Unicuique datur manifestacio spiritus ad utilitatem. Primo ergo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Augustinus: Gustato spiritu desipit omnis caro etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In die concepcionis 81\u176 \'b0 (?), etas 59 mea \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Altersangabe des Schreibers).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  283r\endash 285r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \emdash  Themen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christus, Ihesus, Ewangelium, Philosophus est amator sapiencie ..., Dyaconus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / 283v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Notabile de tribus viciis que communiter habent omnes homines< In libro de septem profectibus religiosorum dicitur: Tria sunt communia vicia ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u252 \'fcber Pr\u228 \'e4destination, dann \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De consciencia, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  mit einem Zitat aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Seneca: Si vis omnia tibi subicere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / 284r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Bernardus de indignis sacerdotibus< Hew quod dicam, quod quidam sunt sacerdotes qui lotis manibus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Bernardus de contemptu mundi< Colloquium feminarum non est nisi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  gefolgt von einem Seneca-Zitat. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Nota frater Carmelita< Induxi vos in terram Carmeli ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  usw., letzte Prosa-Exzerpte \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius: Necesse est ut vacillet ligwa cui subest egra consciencia ... Ieronimus: Facile contempnit omnia qui se semper cogit esse (?) meliorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Hier. epist. 53,11 '... cogitat moriturum', \u246 \'f6fter in Florilegien). \emdash  284r oben und unten Verse (s.u.) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 284r Versus de sancto Hieronymo \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aspice Ieronimum non ex doctoribus ymum Nec miris minimum sed ligue munere primum Expositor legis veteris suprema tuba legis Ieronimus clerum doceat cognoscere verum. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  284r Versus (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Auditis gallis si non surgis neque psallis Clerice te fallis, tibi pandetur ignea vallis. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Prov. 1738. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia 1735. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 284v\endash 285r Explicationes vocabulorum in Biblia occurrentium \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beatus: Bene auctus vel aptus, quasi omnia bene succedunt ... Pre fulgore idest valde lucide ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dixit dominus domino: Tabescere idest putrescere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... attenuati idest inonerati. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash - Rest der Seite und 285v leer wie folgendes Blatt (285a). }

