\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  287r\endash 289r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancta Barbara}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Soror mea parvula est et ubera non habet, Cant. 8 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (8)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Nos videmus inter creaturas corporales quod ille sunt magis celestibus similes ... ... Unde verba preposita possunt esse verba angelorum beatam Barbaram a tribus commendancium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... propter caliditatem cordis et corporis}

