\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  289r\endash 291v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo et notabilia de novo sacerdote}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro salute vestra me misit dominus ... in Egyptum, Gen. 1 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 45,45)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Secundum sanctum Maximianum in sermone appostolorum qui honoravit missos nunctios manifestum est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  290r Ende des Sermo \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... cum gaudio ad propria reversus est. Videte carissimi ministri dignitatem. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Notabilia quedam pro novo sacerdote< Tu eris super domum meam ... populus, Gen. 41 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (40)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ex divinis actibus huius Christi novi militis agimus hodie festum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  290v\endash 291v Zitate aus den Kirchenv\u228 \'e4tern \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus, Ieronimus, Crisostomus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bernardus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schlie\u223 \'dft mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius: O sacerdos, corpus tuum cottidie efficitur sepulchrum domini ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... que tenent tenentem omnia. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   7,475 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Secundum Maximinum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). Mit \u228 \'e4hnlichem Initium ein 'Sermo optimus de novo sacerdote' in Wien, Dominik., 205/171, f.162va\endash 166va (aus dem 'Quadragesimale Lakkarii ordinis minorum fratris').}

