\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  292r\endash 292v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de nativitate beatae Mariae virginis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ora pro nobis quoniam mulier sancta es, Iudith 8 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Idt 8,29)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Conswetudo et cautela fuit antiquitus habencium causam magnam, negocium arduum coram rege ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut autem benivolam ipsam reddamus ad interpellandum pro nobis, salutemus eam. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De quadruplici sanctificacione eius require. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite leer. }

