\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  293r\endash 298r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de annuntiatione gloriosissimae Mariae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo de annunctiacione gloriosissime virginis< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ortus in monte Oliveti erat in quem introivit Ihesus, Ioh. 18 (1). Hodie ecclesia veneratur festum annunctiacionis. Racio Augustini}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  293v marginal \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Primum (?) principale< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Erat ortus in monte Oliveti etc. Introductio: Principes valde delectabiles consweverunt habere ortos ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Exzerpte aus theologischer Literatur. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secundum principale continet alia sex, de quibus hic ortus laudandus est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  297r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ymago virginis in ecclesia pro Christo peciit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite leer. \emdash  297v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoad secundum scilicet quod tristes inveniunt consolaciones ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Folgen Exempla. \emdash  298r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... matres enim thezaurizant filiis. Hec ille}

