\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  298r\endash 300v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo pro festo purificationis Mariae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lumen ad revelacionem gencium, Luc. 2\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (32)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sciendum quamquam ecclesia pluries celebrat festum beate virginis quam alicuius alterius sancti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut post vite huius circuitum ipsa virgo omnibus sibi famulantibus Christum filium suum benedictum ostendere dignetur. Amen. Finit feliciter. K. M. (?) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Augsburg, SuStB, fol. cod. 278, f.2r, und Frankfurt, StuUB, Ms. Leonh. 1, f.129r}

