\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  301r\endash 305r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Auctoritates diversorum doctorum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hugo de Sancto Victore in suo Dyascalicon li.3\u176 \'b0 c.15 de studio querendi: Alii calcabunt (!) honores alii proiecerunt divicias ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et Promotheus (!) ob inmodicam meditandi curam in monte Caucaso wlturi expositus memorabatur etc. 
\line >Auctoritas diversorum doctorum< Augustinus et Crisostomus: Omne nostrum tunc magis nostrum erit si sit commune. Bernardus: Totus debet esse conatus novicii ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zitate folgen aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus in quodam sermone, Anshelmus episcopus in libro commensuracione crucis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  302r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius in registro et habetur in decretis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ps. Augustinus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O vita quantos excepisti, quantos seduxisti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. 'In principio'). Usw. \emdash  Schlie\u223 \'dft 305r mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hugo de claustro anime libro 2\u176 \'b0 cap. ultimo: Nunc nostris temporibus in ecclesia evenit, sunt enim nonulli qui delicatam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und einem Schema nach Augustinus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Utinam saperent: dampnatorum multitudinem, salvandorum paucitatem ... Utinam intelligerent ... Utinam utique providerent: mortem qua nichil certius, extremum iudicium quo nichil terribilius, et jehennam qua nichil intollerabilius. }

