\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  305v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Versus circa librariam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Circa librariam< Hac sunt in cella doctorum grata labella Que stillant mella, radiant pariter quasi stella Huc acies mentis divertatur sapientis Non cadens ventis, sed eius herens documentis. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia 7437 (ohen diese Hs.).}

