\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  369r\endash 380r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de vita aeterna comparanda}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si vis ad vitam ingredi serva mandata dei, Mt. XIX \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (17)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In istis verbis describitur summa tocius salutis nostre quantum ad duo. Primum ad precium retribucionis eterne ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... homo debet proximum suum precavere a dampno quantumcumque potest. Et sic est finis. Amen. Solum crede dictum nec mires etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich der Explicatio decalogi des Bonaventura (vgl. 'In principio').}

