\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 60vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Innocentius III}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De mysterio missae (cum orationibus)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit opus Innocencii pape de mysterio misse. Prologus< Tria sunt in quibus precipue lex divina consistit: mandata promissa et sacramenta ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Capitula prime particule< De sex ordinibus clericorum quos Romanus pontifex secum habet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit prima particula de VI clericorum (!) quos Romanus pontifex habet secum in missa< Cum apostolice sedis antistes agit missarum sollempnia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  12vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipiunt capitula secunde particule< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  13vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit secunda particula de accessu pontificis ad altare< Hiis indumentis ornatus episcopus ad altare procedit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  28rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Capitula tercie particule< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  28vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De silencio post prefationem< Post acclamatum preconium sequitur secretum silencium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  34ra IV, 48va V \emdash  Ende des Textes 60rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... totum continue censui subscribendum. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  60rb Anhang (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Te igitur clementissime pater per Ihesum Christum filium ... supplices rogamus ac petimus uti accepta habeas et benedicas hec dona, hec munera ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Communicantes et memoriam venerantes inprimis gloriose semper virginis Marie ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  60va (3) II \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quam oblacionem tu deus in omnibus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (4) III \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qui pridie quam pateretur accepit panem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (5) IV \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Unde et memores dominorum (!) nos tui, sed et plebs tua ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (6) V \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Supplices te rogamus omnipotens deus iube hec perferri per manus sancti angeli tui ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Memento eciam domine famulorum famularumque tuorum illis et illis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nobis quoque peccatoribus famulis tuis de multitudine miseracionum tuarum sperantibus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9) VI + VII \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per quem hec omnia domine semper bona creas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pater noster qui es in celis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (11) VIII \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pax domini sit semper vobiscum et cum spiritu sancto. Agnus dei qui tollis peccata mundi, miserere nobis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  PL 217, c.773\endash 916 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, Nr.397. Siehe D.F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wright\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A medieval commentary on the mass. Ann Arbor 1977, S.61 Vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maccarone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Studi sul Innocenzio III, Padova 1972, S.428f. \emdash  Zum Anhang (1) siehe A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dold\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Das Prager Sakramentar Cod. O.83 der Bibl. des Metropolitankapitels (Beuron 1949), Liber sacramentorum Nr.235, 3. \emdash  (2\endash 6) ebd. Nr.235, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11 \emdash  (7) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 F\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rotin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Liber ordinum, 1904, S.228 vgl. 693. \emdash  (9) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dold\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ebd. Nr. 235, 13. \emdash  (10) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dold\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.235, 18.}

