\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  61ra\endash 72ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Gerson}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Compendium (sive Opusculum tripartitum)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Compendium magistri Iohannis Ierson (!) Francigene doctoris sacre theologie concellarii Parisiensis editum ab eo in Constantia tempore synodi universalis< Cristianitati suus qualiscumque zelator prosperum ad virtutes viciis depulsis incrementum. Salubre duxi subsequens opusculum tripartitum de preceptis, de confessione, de sciencia mortis ... tradere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  61rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gloria sit altissimo deo in cuius nomine aggrediar presens opus ad salutem fidelium ... >Capitulum primum affirmat mundum a deo fuisse creatum ...< Firmissime credendum est et nullatenus dubitandum, quod solum unus est deus omnipotens omnia sciens ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  62va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Primum preceptum< Primum preceptum est diliges dominum deum tuum ex toto corde ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  66va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Secundum capitulum ostendit qualiter ...< Hec igitur sunt decem legis divine precepta superius narrata ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  66vb Sprung zum 16. Kap. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sedecimum capitulum Sciens nichilominus noster misericordissimus pater ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  69va Confessio \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sicut in domo dei Parisius laudabiliter observatur etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 72v leer. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Du Pin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1706, I c.427\endash 442. Widmungsbrief ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Epist. II Nr.18 S.74.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  73ra\endash 91rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hugo magister}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De mysterio missae (1416)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit prologus sequentis operis< Fons hortorum puteus aquarum, scriptura sacra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cant. 4,15)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Fons est a quo per canales aqua fluit ad areolas ut hortus inde rigatus germina producat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  73rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... periculosius erratur. >Item prologus< Omnis historia divine pagine scriptura sive iuxta rerum gestarum seriem ewangelii materiam precedat sive sequatur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  73vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... typice valeat comprehendi. >Capitula< In qua figura primo cantatur introitus ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  74rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit opus magistri Hugonis de misterio misse, in qua figura primo cantatur introitus et secundo cum psalmo reincipitur< Multi reges et prophete voluerunt videre Christum et non viderunt, et audire illum, non audierunt. Ut enim in spiritu eum venturum prescirent ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  84rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et postea diversi martires et sancti novi testamenti, quibus ipse dixerat: Vado parare vobis locum. 
\line >Sermo ad sacerdotes< Tolle thuribulum de altari et hausto igne mitte incensum de super pergens cito ad populum ut roges pro eo. Iam enim egressa est ira a domino ... plaga cessavit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Num 16, 46)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Non alienum ut arbitror fratres intencione in ea et utinam nec ab utilitate vestra sermonis primum fundamentum quod ut melius prius elucescere valeat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  84vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ecce de sacramento, nunc de virtute. Virtus autem misse est crucifixio Christi ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  85ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Distinccio canonis in VIII partes< Prima est a Te igitur usque Quam oblacionem ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  86rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De ordine et miserio signorum crucis in canone misse< In virtute sancte crucis et sacramento altaris magna est conveniencia et magna efficacia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (auch in Olmouc, SVK, M II 125, f.213v\endash 216, expl. var.) 
\line 87rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De ordine signorum crucis< Primus ordo est a Te igitur usque ad Quam oblacionem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in duobus primis est conveniencia, in tercia vero differencia. Deo gracias. Laus deo omnipotenti. Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 16. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  So nicht nachweisbar}

