\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  91va\endash 92va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Eugenius IV}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bulla (1433) promulgata concilio Basiliensi 1434}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacra (!) sancta generalis sinodus Basiliensis in spiritu sancto legittime congregata ... Huius quoque rei gracia pie peticioni nonnullorum duximus acquiescere qui transcripta certarum litterarum apostolicarum domini Eugenii pape quarti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quarum quidem litterarum tenor sequitur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Bulle \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eugenius episcopus servus servorum dei .... ad perpetuam rei memoriam. Excellentissimum corporis et sangwinis ... Christi sacramentum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ac si originales littere forent exhibite vel ostense. Datum Rome ... anno M CCCC XXX III\u176 \'b0 ... Datum Basilie quinto nonas Iulii anno a nativitate domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 XXXIIII\u176 \'b0. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite und 93r\endash 96v leer. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Bulle: ed. Bullarium Romanum 1, 258f. \emdash  Wien, Schottenstift, 283 (279) (54.c.1), f.388\endash 389v}

