\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  97ra (91ra)\endash 212vb (206vb) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antoninus Florentinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Confessionale 'Defecerunt' (rec. brevior) et alia}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  97ra\endash 105vb (99vb) Confessionale 'Defecerunt' P.I cap.1\endash 8 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit prologus super tractatu de institucione seu directione simplicium confessorum< Defecerunt scrutantes scrutinio, ayt psalmista \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (67,3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Scrutantes aliorum peccatorum sunt confessores. Scrutinium autem est inquisicio ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... unde prius de excommunicacione interrogandum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (auch in Frankfurt, f.1\endash 12r). 
\line 106ra (100ra)\endash 180va Antoninus Florentinus: De censuris ecclesiasticis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit quarta pars presentis operis intitulata de censuris ecclesiasticis. Titulus primus de exercacione (!) maiori.< >Prologus in materiam excommunicacionis< Excommunicacio dicitur exclusio a communione ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... habes eciam infra in tercia parte titulo de iudicibus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (auch in Frankfurt, f.12r\endash 85r). 
\line 180va\endash 186ra Richardus de Sancto Victore: De gratia contemplationis (excerpta) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Richardus de Sancto Victore de sex generibus contemplacionum< Primum genus contemplacionis est in imaginacione ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... discere nequibat. Hec extracta sunt de libro Richardi de Sancto Victore de contemplacione ... deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (auch in Frankfurt, f.85v\endash 91v) 
\line 186rb\endash 205ra Confessionale 'Defecerunt' P.III\endash IV cap.30\endash 49 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit tercia pars huius summe< Nunc formande sunt interrogaciones non ad omnes sed ad quosdam status hominum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet mit einer 'Absolutio generalis', \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in augmentum gracie et in premium vite eterne. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Frankfurt, f.92r\endash 112r). 
\line 205rb (100rb) Confessionale 'Defecerunt' P. cap.12\endash 22 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit summula fratris Antonini ordinis predicatorum ad informacionem seu instruccionem simplicium confessorum< Postquam ille vult confiteri dixit ex se que voluit de peccatis suis ... Circa primum preceptum: Unum cole deum. De votis: circa hoc potes interrogare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... cum advertunt mortale est. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Frankfurt, f.112v\endash 120v). 
\line 212rb\endash 212va Notabilia (auch in Frankfurt, f.120v\endash 121r): (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cogitacio delectacio Consensus racionabilium pervertunt sensus, primo asperitate ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  212va (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Septem apud inferos plagas que animos reproborum cruciant legimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  212vb (3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Octo sunt principalia vicia que humanum infestant genus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quod de iure communi peccata luxurie non sunt reservata ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et audis confessionem. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr.256 (mit dieser Hs.) und Nr.253 ('De censuris ecclesiasticis', ohne diese Hs.). Textbestand und -verwerfungen wie in Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 147, f.1r\endash 121r.}

