\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  213ra\endash 227va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones variae ex iure canonico}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beneficium: infra quod tempus conferri debeat vacans beneficium. Respondetur: ecclesiastica ministeria seu beneficia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  214rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Penitencia quatuor modis potest accipi, unomodo pro remedio contra peccatum mortale ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet mit dem Abschnitt 'Maledictio' \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et sic iudex iuste maledicit illum cui precipit iustum etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nicht in Praed. 147}

