\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  227vb\endash 229rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clemens V}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De statu monachorum et canonicorum regularium ex constitutione concilii Viennae, capitulo XXX (Clement. 3, 10, 1)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ne in agro dominico sacra videlicet monachorum nigrorum religione indecorum aliquid obrepat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... idem puto de absoluto ab irregulari et suspenso. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nicht in Praed. 147. }

