\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  229va (223va)\endash 239ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antoninus Florentinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de restitutione ('Circa')}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit tractatus de restitucionibus editus per venerabilem religiosum fratrem Antoninum ordinis predicatorum< Circa materiam restitucionis seu satisfactionis notandum quod cum restitucio set satisfactio que fit homini ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... per applicacionem meriti Christi. >Explicit< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr.247 (mit dieser Hs.); die Schrift entstand um 1443/52. In Frankfurt, Praed. 147, f.122r\endash 132r.}

