\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  247rb (241rb)\endash 250va (244va) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antoninus Florentinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De ornatu et habitu mulierum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit brevis tractatus de ornatu mulierum< Queritur primo utrum ornatus mulierum secundum morem patrie qui videtur vanus et superfluus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed quis invenit eos. >Explicit< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr.249 (mit dieser Hs.). In Frankfurt, Praed. 147, f.141v\endash 145r}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  250vb\endash 259rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antoninus Florentinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dubia}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipiunt dubia quedam decisa per supradictum dominum Antoninum. Dubium primum< Et primo: Si potest quis habere columbariam in comitatu vel si tenetur restituere vel destruere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  253ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dummodo non fiat in fraudem usurarum. >Alia dubia decisa per prefatum dominum< Item dubitatur: Utrum secularis extra suam dyocesim constitutus tempore peregrinacionis possit confiteri ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  259ra endet mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item queritur: Utrum polimitarii et scarpatarii ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  259rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item queritur: Utrum habens ordines minores et excercens actus eorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... non incurrit irregularitatem, secundum Wilhelmum (W.?) dist. excer. (?) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr.241 (Consilia, decisiones, dubia). Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 R. Creytens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les cas de conscience ..., in: AFP 28 (1958), 149\endash 220 und ders., Les 'Consilia' de St. Antonin de Florence, in: AFP 37 (1967) 262\endash 342. \emdash  Auch in Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 147, f.145r\endash 155r; siehe dazu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Powitz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S.334f.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  259va\endash 265rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De absolutione sacerdotis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De absolucione sacerdotis< Sciendum est quod nullus sacerdos potest absolvere aliquem religiosum alterius professionis sine licencia prelati illius ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  259rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primo interrogandus est religiosus de peccatis seculi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... vel de adulterio suspecte habeantur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  In Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 147, f.159v\endash 164r; Angers, BM, 319, f.111v (vgl. 'In principio'). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  265va\endash b Nota de usuris \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quosdam casus in quibus secundum quosdam potest quis dare pecuniam suam et licite inde recipere lucrum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et custodiam adhibere et in fine termini restituere. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schlie\u223 \'dft, wohl unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, mit Seitenende. \emdash  Auch in Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 147, f.164r\endash v (expl. var.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... rusticus iuret quod ita sit rei veritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  266ra\endash 269ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaguida de Aretio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de dispensationibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Attendens ego Bonaguida de Aretio licet insufficiens canonici iuris professor quod de casibus in quibus possunt episcopi dispensare cotidie dubitatur ... Dispensant episcopi in adulteriis et in aliis criminibus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... potest tamen de ipso dici quod de aliis dicitur: Ortulus iste brevis dulcia poma gerit. >Explicit< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung siehe 'In principio'}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  269rb (263rb) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Deo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Decretum abbreviatum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Liber decretorum distinctus est in tres partes quarum prima vocatur distinctiones, secunda cause, tercia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in quinta de confremacione (!) et ieiunio, et sic terminatur liber decretorum in tribus capitulis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer. \emdash  H\u228 \'e4ufig \u252 \'fcberliefert. Auch in Clm 28566, f.193r\endash 195v (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kudorfer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )^.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 272va\endash 273va Tituli librorum decretalium \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In sexto domini Bonifacii habentur hy tituli qui hic eregione quinque librorum decretalium isto signo 6. designantur qui vero carent signo non habentur in sexto. De summa trinitate et fide katholica - 6. De constitucionibus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... De regulis iuris. - 6. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  273va\endash 276rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Casus excommunicationis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , suspensionis et interdicti \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum apostolica doctrina cunctos fideles ammoneat, ad Ephes. V\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Videte quomodo caute ambuletis et ubi maius periculum imminet, ibi est cautela diligencior adhibenda. Idcirco sicut perniciosum est dampnabile consciencie proprie imminencia ignorare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (in Korr.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   discrimina, eo quod incognita non vitantur, ita utile est spiritualium periculorum haberi noticiam, ut possint cognita precaveri. Horum gracia ... casus illos ... colligere studui, in quibus ex iure canonico et veteri vel extravagantibus constitucionibus Romanorum pontificum excommunicacionis suspensionis vel interdicti sentenciam incurrat (!) ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nach Nennung der einschl\u228 \'e4gigen Gesetzestexte folgen 274ra die Casus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Isti sunt casus propter quos secundum iura canonica incidit quis ipso (!) sentenciam excommunicacionis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  274vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Infrascripti casus respiciunt Romanum pontificem et Romanam ecclesiam. In primis quicumque dicit Romanam ecclesiam non esse capud ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  275va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Infrascripti casus respiciunt alias ecclesias ... Excommunicatus est quicumque aliquem episcopum percusserit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... alioquin mittendus est si est sanus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer. \emdash  Thematisch \u228 \'e4hnlich Hildesheim, DomB, Hs 638, f.187vb (vgl. 'GI').}

