\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  278vb\endash 280va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gratianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Concordia discordantium canonum (excerpta e dist. I\endash VIII)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit discordancium canonum concordia ac primum de iure nature et constitucionibus< Duobus regitur natura videlicet iure et moribus. Ius naturale est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... consuetudinem sequi aut circa fratres invidus et malignus, quibus veritas revelatur, aut circa deum ingratus est. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 187, c.29A\endash 46C. }

