\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  280vb\endash 283va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speculum peccatoris}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit speculum peccatorum< Quoniam in via huius seculi fugientis sumus et dies nostri sicut umbra pretereunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut per hoc eternam damnacionem evadas et cum domino nostro Ihesu Christo vitam aeternam possideas, quod tibi concedat qui ... Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: PL 40, c.983\endash 992. Bloomfield, Nr.4918. \emdash  Auch in W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.q. 97, f.187\endash 194, Herzogenburg, 73, f.94r, und Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 147, f.165r\endash 167r.}

