\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  288vb\endash 290ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qualiter homo se debeat praeparare ad missam}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Qualiter homo se debeat preparare ad missam celebrandam vel ad communionem< Ad missam celebrandam sex considero attendenda. Primum est racionis discrecio respectu veritatis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... non propria virtute sicut cogitat sic opere impleat. Quod concedere dignetur qui in secula est benedictus. Amen. >Explicit< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventurae scripta ..., Rom 1975, S.146. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire des Maitres en Th\u233 \'e9ologie de Paris au XIII si\u232 \'e8cle, I\endash II, Paris 1933, Nr.305cw. Zahlreiche Zeugen, vgl. 'In principio'. \emdash  Auch in der Schwesterhandschrift Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 147, f.172r\endash 173r. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  290ra\endash 290va Stimulus conscientiae \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad stimulum autem consciencie hoc modo homo debet exercere se ipsum. Primo se ipsum exasperet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in predicta tamen exercitacione inchoari potest a quodam predictorum nostra meditacio. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Auch in Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 147, f.173rv. \u196 \'c4hnlich Clm 4634, f.106v: Bonaventura, De triplici via, \u167 \'a71 in freier Bearbeitung}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  290vb\endash 291va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De cognitione sublimium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scriptum est enim, fratres karissimi, quod non debemus loqui sublimia tanquam sapientes mundi gloriantes. Ait enim propheta ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... qua expulsa per graciam efficimini templum dei et habitaculum spiritus sancti. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und f.292\endash 298 leer. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Genicot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L. et P.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tombeur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (edd.), Index Scriptorum Operumque Latino-Belgicorum Medii Aevi, III 1\endash 2, Bruxelles 1977\endash 1979. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Fratres carissimi non debemus loqui sublimia ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   in Stuttgart, WLB, HB VII 22a, f.40v}

