\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Olim deum legimus in Levitico veteris testamenti mandavisse sacerdotibus, ut leprarum corporalium multimodas scire studerent differencias ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut supra late dictum est. Et sic de lepra morali ac anime dixisse sufficiat. etc. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , SOP, Nr.2538 (mit dieser Hs.). }

