\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Innenspiegel hinten: Iohannes Wideman: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notariatsakte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (wohl 1455) Die ersten Zeilen sind abgeschnitten; Zeile 4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .... super toto negocio principali contra prefatum Iohannem Schmidholcz maritum eius legitimum agendum literas citatorias et inhibitorias aut quascumque alias peticiones constituenti necessitas (?) impetrandum ipsamque constituentem et eius iura defendendum libellum et libellos aut quascumque alias peticiones summarias ob dandum et recipiendum darique et recipi videndum litem et lites contestandum et contestari videndum de calumpnia vitanda et veritate dicenda ... ... promisitque prefata Elizabeth ... ... Super quibus omnibus et similibus premissis memorata Elizabeth constituens me notarium publicum subscriptum requisivit, ut sibi unum vel plura publicum seu publica conficerem instrumentum sive instrumenta tociens quociens opus foret. Acta sunt hec anno indiccione pontificatu mense die hora et loco quibus supra, presentibus ibidem venerabilibus et circumspectis viris dominis magistro Iohanne Gossolt licenciat(o) in decretis, decano et canonico ecclesie collegiate sancti Mauricii Augustensis, Iohannes Hertfelder vicario chori eiusdem, Iohanne cappellano Gossenbrot, Sigismundo Gossenbrot et Conrado Imhof presbiteris et laycis Augustensis et Spirensis diocesis testibus ad premissa vocatis pariter et rogatis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Links Signet ('Io. Wi.'), rechts \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et ego Iohannes Widemann alias Kesinger presbiter Augustensis diocesis publicus imperiali auctoritate notarius ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Streitsache zwischen Elisabeth und Johannes Schmidholz.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Innenspiegel vorne: Iohannes Pruntregel: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notariatsakte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1455, Sept. 20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini amen. Anno a nativitate eiusdem millesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo quinto indictione tercia pontificatus sanctissimi in Christo patris et domini nostri domini Calisti divina providencia pape tertii anno primo die vero Sabbati vicesima mensis Septembris hora vespertina vel quasi in domo venerabilis et circumspecti viri magistri Leonardi Gessel in decretis licenciati, canonici et scolastici ecclesie necnon vicarii et officialis curie Augustensis, in mei notarii publici testiumque subscriptorum ad hoc specialiter vocatorum et rogatorum presentia personaliter constituta discreta et honesta Elizabetha Glatzin circa procuratorum suorum revocacionem per eam hactenus constitutorum omnibus melioribus modo via iure stilo causa forma et ordine quibus melius validius ... ordinavit suum verum ... procuratorem ... dominum honorabilem ... magistrum Hainricum Imhoff Augustensis civitatis procuratorem absentem tamquam presentem ad comparendum dicte constituentis nomine coram reverendo patre domino Wilhelmo abbate monasterii in Benedicten Buren ordinis sancti Benedicti ... asserto commissario nonnullarum litterarum apostolicarum ... super absolutionis beneficio cuidam Iohanni Schmalholcz de Landsperg ... ... Acta sunt hec in civitate Augustensi anno indiccione .... quibus supra presentibus ibidem honorabili viro Hermanno Ringenschmid canonico et plebano ecclesie sancti Mauricii Augustensis et Iohanne Stromair clericis Augustensis diocesis testibus ... vocatis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Unten rechts neben Signet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ego Iohannes Pruntregel clericus Spirensis publicus sacra imperiali auctoritate notarius ... signavi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Pruntriegel?) Siehe dazu auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sch\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 dle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S.32 mit Anm.3 (zu Pruntregel ferner: "am 6. April 1461 ... erscheint Pruntrigel als Kaplan und Vikar des Stiftes zu St.Moritz"). }

