\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  16v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notae theologicae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \emdash  (1) 3 Zeilen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nullus inani spe seductus presumat frustra de misericordia dei. Multos enim tales facit diabolus differre penitenciam. Nichil est (?) certius morte, nichil incertius hora mortis; preveniamus ergo ultimam horam, ne ipsa nos preveniat. Penitencia ipsa est secunda porta ad regnum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... compunctione cordis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  (2) 4 Zeilen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Confessionis satisfactione operis reconciliatur sacramenti altaris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Syntax!). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Multi enim male vivunt, confidunt tamen per orationes et suffragia aliorum deum invenire, sed quicumque deum amisit, si vult eum invenire ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia cum eo iuxta crucem fuit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Zu (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nichil est certius ... hora mortis:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   bei verschiedenen Autoren besonders des 12.Jh.s. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 16v Sermo (Entwurf) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In principio creavit deus celum et terram: In istis verbis notatur unitas sancte trinitatis et trina potentia divinitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et lucem serenissimam obtinebit}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

