\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  22r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hymnus ('Regi regum omniscio')}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Regi regum omniscio hec gratulizet concio, mera clangens armonia. Hac in die. / Digno sudans conamine utroque psallat homine, celebria sunt gaudia. Hac in die ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hic deus dei filius, quem stella magi fluvius, quem manifestat ydria, nos iugi donet gloria. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  AH IX S.17\endash 18 Nr.11 'In Epiphania Domini' (nach dieser Hs.). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dreves/Blume\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ein Jahrtausend lat. Hymnendichtung, Bd. 2, 1909 S.42}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  22r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hymnus }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sator rerum sub dierum mundo natus clausula / Roriflua melliflua ortus ex virguncula ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ut stricto in examine eius fulti iuvamine requiei interminae perfruamur iubilo. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Text: AH IX S.235\endash 236 Nr.319 'In Conversione Pauli' (nach dieser Hs.). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dreves/Blume\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ein Jahrtausend lat. Hymnendichtung, Bd. 2, 1909, S.342. \emdash  Anz. f. K. d. Vorzeit VII 506; Bll. f. d. Gymn. Schulwesen 44, 274. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 L\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 we-Hartel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bibl. patr. hispanica, I 218}

