\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  22v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Proverbia }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Que (?) ficta fides pareat (?) que rebus amica secundis / Ad permutatas idque (!) reditque vices. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) Dar\u252 \'fcber von anderer, sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Maior exhibetur reverentia malignis honoris quam benignis amoris. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Daneben von derselben sp\u228 \'e4teren Hand (3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnis homo quacumque domo vel lege fruatur / Provideat quando taceat vel quando loquatur. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (2) Zitiert aus von Ordericus Vitalis, Hist. eccl., II 16 (PL 188, c.168C): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Malignis itaque, ut vulgo dici solet, major reverentia exhibetur timoris quam benignis amoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  (3) Aus dem 'Facetus' (ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schroeder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Der dt. Facetus, Berlin 1911, S.14\endash 28), diese Verse auch in anderen Zeugen isoliert \u252 \'fcberliefert}

