\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  28v\endash 30r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Lombardus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentarius in psalmos (excerpta) }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum omnes prophetas spiritus sancti revelatione constet esse locutos, David prophetarum eximius ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  30r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Manifestum judicium erit in ultimo, cum cuique retribuet secundum opera sua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 191, 129D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ira enim alia est iusta ... ... et fidem non servantes, quales genuit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 191, 305D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... hec est legis amaritudo que gratia evangelii dulcorata est et quod in sacramentis legalibus latebat in luce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [m]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   positum est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 191, 537B)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: PL 191, 55\endash 537B (excerpta)}

