\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  30r\endash 32v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sententiae in epistolas Pauli}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad aquas illas salubres, ad quas vocamur clamitante summi patris sapientia in hunc modum: Si euntes venientes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  32r \u252 \'fcber die Adressaten der Paulus-Briefe \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Corinthii sunt Achaici, hii ab ipso apostolo conversi sunt ... Philipenses sunt Macedones ... Thesalonicenses sunt Macedones ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  32v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecclesiis Hebreorum scribit Paulus de eminentia Christi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... si alii loqueretur genti}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  32v\endash 33r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sententiae in decreta}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In decreta< Vestivi te discoloribus, indui te subtilibus, ornavi te variis et facta es michi summi regis filia. Sponsus sponsam si copulare volens ei gratuito munere contulit, quod speciosa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korr. aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  spasa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   atque amabilis fieret ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... incipit autem a iuris divisione dicens: humanus ergo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  32v und 33r oben marginale Glossen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Als 'Tractatus de iure canonico' in Avranches, BM, 23 (s.XIII), f.187\endash 193v (CGMBP 10 p. 109).}

