\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  33r\endash 33v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sententiae in evangelium Matthaei}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In Matheum< Quoniam omnibus legitime certantibus merces eterne retribucionis promittitur et in futuro tribuitur, due nobis forme in sacra scriptura sepissime commendantur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... post dispensator fieret celestium talentorum. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Stuttgart, WLB, HB IV 32, f.3 (vgl. Boese, II 1). Als Ps. Stephanus Langton, Introitus in Marcum in Carcassonne, BM, 3 (s.XIII), f.131v\endash 132.}

