\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  33v\endash 34r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sententiae in evangelium Marci}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In Marcum< Quia per duos a dextris intelliguntur duo, qui cum domino corporaliter conversati sunt et ab ipso audiverunt, Matheus scilicet et Iohannes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... illi predicaverunt ubique d. et c. (?) }

