\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  34r\endash 34v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sententiae in evangelium Iohannis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In Iohannem< Omnia poma nova et vetera servavi tibi, dilecte mi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ct 7,13)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Hec sunt verba sponse in canticis ad sponsum. Per poma nova et vetera intelliguntur sacre scripture novi et veteris testamenti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et marginalibus coaptatur. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Stuttgart, WLB, HB IV 32, f.5v. Ps. Stephanus Langton, Introitus in Iohannem, in Carcassonne, BM, 3, f.132v-133}

