\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >In apocalipsim< Omnes qui pie voluerunt vivere in Christo, persecutionem patiuntur propter iustitiam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II Tim 3,12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sicut Salomon ait ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et statum in eterna beatitudine recolit}

