\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Super canonicas epistolas< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ostendit michi dominus quatuor fabros qui missi sunt, ut ('u' mit Strich cod. ) diruerent cornua gencium (Zach. 1,20). Quatuor isti fabri missi sunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   contra IIIIor ventos flantes super faciem terre. Isti IIIIor venti sunt IIIIor passiones de quibus scriptum est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... prologum in quo ostendit quo ordine digeste sint. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. Paris, BN, nouv. acq. lat. 217, f.106v\endash 107. Paris, BN, lat. 3535, f.4\endash 4v}

