\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  62v unten {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Memento \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  gestrichen)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quod hominem tuam ad ymaginem de limo formaveris, ut hominem perditum reformares, genito tuo non peperceris. Opus tui numinis, merces (?) Christi sanguinis, sumus, parce miseris. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Mit Neumen}

