\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  26ra\endash 31va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Seneca (Ps.)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De verborum copia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Motto \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ave Maria gracia plena dominus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u220 \'dcber dem Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit liber eiusdem Lucii Annei Senece de verborum copia< Quisquis prudenciam sequi desideras \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korr. aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  desiderat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , tunc per racionem recte vives (!), si omnia prius estimes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  31rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Quidquid etatis retro est, mors tenet. Dum differtur vita transcurrit. Turpissima iactura que per negligentiam fit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  31va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit liber primus de verborum copia.< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Ed. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fohlen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Un apocryphe de S\u233 \'e9n\u232 \'e8que mal connu: Le 'De verborum copia', MS 40 (1980) 139\endash 209. Vgl. IMU 16, 1973, 43\endash 125, hier 93.}

