\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  31va\endash 40vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Seneca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De clementia (epitome)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit Annei Senece ad Neronem de clemencia liber primus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scribere de clemencia, Nero cesar, constitui ut quodam modo spuluce \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (! in Korrektur)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   fungerer et te tibi ostenderem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  39ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ac ruine potentia est. >Explicit liber primus de clementia. Incipit secundus< Ut de clemencia scriberem, Nero cesar, una me vox tua maxime compulit .. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Videbit, quod ingenium qua ratione tractandum sit, quo modo in rectum prava flectantur. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Siehe Giancarlo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mazzoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Richerche sulla tradizione medievale del De Beneficiis e del De Clementia di Seneca, III. Storia della tradizione manoscritta, in: Bolletino dei classici 3 (1982) 165\endash 223, hier 182, 201. [Hbh Pg 8130]}

