\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  40vb\endash 43vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Seneca (Ps.)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Proverbia Senece}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipiunt proverbia Senece per ordinem alphabeti disposita< Alienum est omne. Quidquid optendo (!) evenit ab alio expectes alteri quod feceris ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (so interpungiert)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Zelum de deo tantum habe, non contra homines. Zelari autem hominibus viciosum est. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Durch Lombarden in Abschnitte geteilt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Prov. 789 ('Alienum est...': Publilius Syrus A.1); 120 ('Ab alio...': Publ. Syr. A.2; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schaller/K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 nsgen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia carminum, 39). \u196 \'c4hnlich in Forl\u237 \'ed, BC, 7 (454), f.5\endash 15.}

