\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  44ra\endash 53rb{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Seneca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De beneficiis (excerpta)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Liber primus Senece de beneficio< Inter multos ac varios errores temere inconsulteque vivencium nichil prope modum vir optime Liberalis dixeris (!) quod beneficia nec dare scimus nec accipere. Sequitur enim ut male collocata male debeantur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  45vb II \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Liber secundus< Inspiciamus Liberalis virorum optime id quod ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  47va III \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit IIus. Incipit III. Non referre graciam beneficiis est turpe. ideo de ingratis etiam ingrati queruntur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (W\u246 \'f6rter ausgelassen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  48rb IV \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit IIIus. Incipit IIIIus. Nichil sine racione faciendum est. Non est beneficium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  48vb V \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit IIIIus. Incipit Vus. Sunt quidam extra omnem subducti cupiditatem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sen. ben. V 4, 3, 4)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  49vb VI \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit V. Incipit VI. An beneficium eripi possit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sen. ben. VI 2, 1, 1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  51va VII \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit VIus. Incipit VIIus. Non hic te Liberalis carmine longo atque per ambages et longa extorsa tenebo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sen. ben. VII 1, 1, 1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... hoc est magni animi perdere et dare. Annei Seneche (!) de beneficiis liber septimus explicit feliciter. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ('Seneche' Lesung unsicher, wenn zutreffend Romanismus.) \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Exzerpte dieses Umfangs auch in Augsburg, UB, Oettingen-Wallerstein II Lat. 1 4\u176 \'b0 33, f.215v\endash 222r (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sottili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). }

