\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  58ra\endash 62vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Ambianensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De arte fidei catholicae (libri V)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Auf oberem Rand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De arte fidei catholice. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Prologus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Clemens papa, cuius rem nominis et vite subiecti sentiant, et tu a domino consequaris, zelum scribentis hoc opus tuo benignus (?) attende devotum nomini ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  58va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et efficacius visa animos movent. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Buch I \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Quidquid est causa cause est causa causati.< Sicut enim causatum A, cuius causa B, causa autem B sit, causa A habet esse per B secundum descripcionem cause ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 62vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  (Liber quintus) ... sicut ex quarto secundi libri et XIII declaratur; si autem sacramentis non est adiutus, nihilominus resurget, id ad quod // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 210, 616D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. Comment., Nr.551, I S.271. Unter dem Namen des Alanus ab Insulis gedruckt: PL 210, 595\endash 618.}

