\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Facit caritas quia dicitur ca(ri)tas paciencie est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Einige Abs\u228 \'e4tze anderen Inhalts folgen, z.B. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fratres in adiutorium in tempore tribulacionis et super eos misericordia liberabit, Eccl. 40 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (24)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In istis verbis primo dicitur quis sit sancte dilectionis affectus ...}

