\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De Effraim et aliis< Hec est possessio Effraim ad orientem Astarot, Adar usque ad Betaron (!) superiorem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ios 16,5)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... audebat (!) insidiatorem regni dicere, sed cum inimicitie in tantum proce- // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Reklamant:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   derent \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II Mach. 4, 2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Abbruch. 
