\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Licet modo in fine temporum plures constat habere codices, qui de arte calculatoria videantur posse sufficere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et in se revertent ad modum circuli. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Darunter der Anfang eines Kommentars: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iste tractatus dividitur in prohemium et tractatum, tractatus autem in partes quatuor ... 
