\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  168r\endash 174v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sententiae theologicae et versus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tres sunt status, status ante peccatum, status in peccato, status post peccatum. Primus dicitur status gracie, secundus dicitur status ruine sive lapsus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Einzelne Paragraphen, z.B. 169v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Crux dominica IIIIor habet dimensiones, altitudinem que est spes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet 174v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Quidam psallunt et non cantant ut infideles ... Triplex est vesperum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in quo ad plenum liberati erimus. Amen (?) Finito libro sint laus et gracia Christo. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  170v unten 4 Verse \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Imparibus meritis pendent tria corpora ramis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (dazu z.B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Werner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Beitr\u228 \'e4ge, S.136\endash 137 Nr. 350; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia 8774). 
\line 174v unten 4 Verse \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cui carus est catulus vitulus bos parvus (?) pulus (?)}

