\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Oben klein: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit historia actuum apostolorum. Sancti spiritus assit nobis gratia. \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno nono decimo imperii Tyberii cesaris, adhuc procuratore Iudee Pilato, preside Sirie Vitellio ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Gladio perimebantur nobiles et in loco magis honorabili, scilicet in catacumbis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  PL 198, c.1645\endash 1722}

