\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  214rb\endash 219ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Comestor}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Historia scholastica}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fuit autem in diebus Herodis regis Iudee annis regnis eius unde (!) triginta sacerdos nomine Zacharias ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  219ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... aquam, quousque in terram convalescant (!). Die autem ascensionis venit ad eos in Ierusalem, et ait: Sedete in civitate etc.: Require in primo folio supra. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  PL 198, c.1537B\endash 1644A}

