\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  209r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  // ... Sed actumnali collectioni preparantur arbores incisis corticibus. / Flagrantissimo estatis fervore ac sic prosiliente spuma pingui concretaque densantur, ubi loci natura poscit tegete (!) palmea excipiente ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  209v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Crocus autem fertur ignitas febres refrigerare. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  210r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus dabit verbum evangelizantibus virtutem multam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 67,12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sequitur. 'Venter tuus ...' \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et iter quod ingredi debeat (!) ostendunt. hi oculi ecclesie comparantur // 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  209r\endash v: Cassiodor PL 70, c.1077\endash 1079A, Ps. Haymo PL 117, c.321\endash 323BC. Der Anfang des Textst\u252 \'fcckes auch bei Beda, PL 91, c.1143, und Hraban, PL 109, c.934. \emdash  210rv: PL 70, 1094B\endash 1095B, PL 117, 342\endash 344.}

