\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pater noster: Hec obsecratio oracio dominica vocatur, quia dominus eam docuit. Discipuli rogaverunt dominum ut doceret eos ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... a diaboli temptacione et huius seculi tribulacione; in futuro nec diabolus nocebit nec ulla adversitas erit. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auszug aus Ps. Alcuinus (Remigius), De divinis officiis: PL 101, c.1265B\endash 1266B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   8366. Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glauche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   zu Clm 4652, f.116v. }

