\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  272ra\endash 273rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Regula de vita clericorum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ante omnia fratres karissimi diligatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [deus]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   deinde proximus, quia ista precepta sunt principaliter nobis data, hec igitur sunt que que ut observetis precipimus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et in temptationem non inducatur. Tu autem. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  PL 32, c.1377\endash 1384}

