\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  144r\endash 150v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Capistrano et al}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 .: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Orationes coram Friderico Romanorum rege in Nova Civitate}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  144r\endash 146r Iohannes de Capistrano (?): Sermo \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Plurima autem turba etc., Io. XII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 21,8)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In verbis propositis instruimur ad duo, scilicet ut salvatori nostro veniamus obviam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et ramos arborum habeamus in manibus ... Sciendum quod tria sunt genera arborum, ex quibus tria genera ramorum idest tria genera exemplorum mandere (!) debemus si Christo digne obviam venire volumus. Prima est arbor fidei katholice de qua potest intelligi illud Luce XIII: Simile est regnum celorum grano sinapis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... proximi nostri credendi sunt omne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   homines nature nostre participes. Rogemus}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  146r\endash 149v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Iacobus de Iuterbog (?)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo contra magistrum Henricum Tocke}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fontem et originem salutis et redempcionis humane et indulgencie a solo deo merito passionis Christi profluxisse et continue fluere katholice credendum est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Caveat igitur ab hiis morbis nobilitas Saxonum ab heresi usquequaque immaculata ne iuxta prenosticata magist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ri]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Heinrici Tacken gravibus erroribus involvatur, presertim in eius civitate metropolitana de qua dicitur sic coram veridicis predicasse; quam deus misericordem (!) ab huiusmodi malo preservare dignetur, ut et ipse Tacken falsus et mendax propheta inveniatur. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Fontem et originem salutis: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Iacobus de Iuterbog, Contra indulgencias per cystam et contra magistrum Henricum Loke (d.i. Tocke): siehe S.A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Porebski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Jakub z Paradyza, Warszawa 1978, S.36. L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Werke des ... Jakob von J\u252 \'fcterborg 1955 S.83 (unter den Dubia). Auch in Hannover, StB, Ms. Mag. 17, f.5v (vgl. Udo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 hne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Handschriften in Hannover: Stadtbibliothek, Stadtarchiv ..., Wiesbaden 1991 (Mittelalterliche Handschriften in Niedersachsen: Kurzkatalog, H. 1). \emdash  Heinrich Tocke, Domherr in Magdeburg und entschiedener Gegner des Wunderglaubens, Kritiker Kapistrans (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hofer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   II, Register s.v. Tocke). Zu ihm siehe auch D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mertens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iacobus Carthusiensis, G\u246 \'f6ttingen 1976, S.111\endash 112 u. Reg. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  149v\endash 150v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes de Capistrano}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio coram Friderico Romanorum rege in Nova Civitate}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tulerunt illum in Iherusalem ut sisterent eum domino, Luc. II\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (22)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Processit hodie virgo gloriosa cum prole sua triplici cum consolabili largitate, cum admirabili (!) laudabili spiritualitate, cum admirabili caritate}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nec racione legis, vide ibidem Levit. XII. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ista sunt presentata serenissimo domino nostro Friderico Romanorum rege (!) per venerabilem patrem fratrem Iohannem de Capestrano vicarium generalem citra montana protunc in Nova Civitate coruscantem multis miraculis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hofer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iohannes Kapistran, I 433f.: "f.149v\endash 151r enth\u228 \'e4lt einen Auszug einer Predigt, die nach der Notiz am Schlusse des Textes von Kapistran in Wiener Neustadt in Gegenwart Friedrichs III. gehalten worden w\u228 \'e4re. Nach den Eingangsworten der Predigt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Tulerunt illum Iherusalem ... cum prole sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   kann sie aber nur an einem Lichtme\u223 \'dffeste gehalten worden sein. An diesem Tag ist Kapistran weder 1451 noch 1455 in Wiener Neustadt gewesen. Friederich wird ausdr\u252 \'fccklich \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   genannt; die Predigt f\u228 \'e4llt also noch in die Zeit vor seiner Kaiserkr\u246 \'f6nung (19. M\u228 \'e4rz 1452). Irrt\u252 \'fcmlich ist auch die Angabe Komorovos, Tractatus 334, Kapistran habe am Feste Mari\u228 \'e4 Heimsuchung in Wiener Neustadt \u252 \'fcber die drei St\u228 \'e4nde der Auserw\u228 \'e4hlten gepredigt; den 2. Juli hat er weder 1451 noch 1455 in Wiener Neustadt zugebracht." \emdash  Anscheinend irrt hier \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hofer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , da er (vgl. Itinerar I 524) selbst Wien Juni/Juli 1451 als Aufenthaltsort ansetzt}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  151r\endash 153r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Differentiae inter quattuor ordines mendicantium et Leonhardum magistrum chori S. Stephani Viennae (a.1450\endash 1451) mit einer Best\u228 \'e4tigung durch Iohannes de Capistrano}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  151r\endash 152v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Declaracio in causa differenciarum inter quatuor ordines mendicancium Wienne et magistri (!) chori sancti Stephani exortu (!)< De sacramento penitencie. Primo declaramus (et nos professores sacre theologie ac doctores iuris) et dicimus, quod non quilibet frater predictorum ordinum auctoritatem habet audiendi confessiones ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Item ut videatis et intelligatis, quod solum querimus pacem ..., remittimus vos ... ad venerabiles doctores sacre theologie ac iuris alme universitatis studii Wiennensis, ad quos talia et consilia devolvimus decernenda quemadmodum littere prenominatorum (!) facultatum sonant. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  152v\endash 153r Gutachten der Theologischen Fakult\u228 \'e4t der Universit\u228 \'e4t Wien und Best\u228 \'e4tigung durch Iohannes de Capistrano \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur nunc bulla facultatis sacre theologie Wiennensis inter frates mendicancium et magistrum chori sancti Stephani ...< Nos facultas sacre theologie alme universitatis studii Wiennensis, quia de anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 Lmo in festo palmarum octonarius (!) quidam nomine Leonhardus tunc magister chori venerabilis ecclesie sancti Stephani opidi gloriosi privilegiati a curia Romana Pataviensis diocesis et immedietate (!) sedi apostolice subiecte inter alias doctrinas dogmatisavit publice in ambone coram populi multitudine, quod omnes et singuli laqueum excommunicacionis incidissent, qui pro quadragesima nunc currente beneficium absolucionis sacramentalis alibi quam in parochia, ut circa fratres mendicantes, requisissent ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Actum in nostra generali congregacione ... anno domini etc. superius et eciam prius anno XLI\u176 \'b0 quinta die mensis Aprilis nostro sub sigillo alme universitatis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Best\u228 \'e4tigung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nunc vero devotus pater doctor utriusque iuris ac professor veritatis (!) frater Iohannes de Capestrano hoc idem cum doctoribus determinavit ... anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 LImo in die Petri et Pauli apostolorum. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Gutachten in derselben Sache der Universit\u228 \'e4t Erfurt vom 5. Juni 1462 in Frankfurt, StuUB, Ms. Praed. 124, f.95v\endash 96r.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  153v\endash 155v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Arenga in susceptione magistri generalis Iohannis Soreth}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reverendissime in Christo pater magisterque prestantissime, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ut tenore nostrarum constitucionum elicitur rubrica XIXa cunctarum provinciarum scibus (!) precipitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ut honeste sine contradiccione superiores adsenientes (!) recipiant ... Hiis sic perpensis venerabiles vestri (!) reverendissimi (!) paternitatis ioremque (!) superioris Allamanie provincie subiectissimi patres pretactam reverendam vestram paternitatem per quendam (!) arengam suscipiendam michi licet inscio inperito et ignaro iniunxerunt, ne et ego videar ab obediencia declinare, hoc opusculum breve meam facultatem ... excedentem (!) assumpsi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  
\line 154r z\u228 \'e4hlt ber\u252 \'fchmte Karmeliten auf: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et quia pater reverendissime ac magister egregie inter excellentes nostri sacratissimi ordinis tam antiquorum quam patrum modernorum patris Bertholdi religiosissimi, Burghardi preclarissimi, Cirilli sanctissimi, Alani Symonisque Stock beatissimi, Nicolai heremite, Rudolfi veridici, Petri atque Raymundi Eneidoni (?) ve de Casa Petri, Petri Raymundi, Iohannis Balistarii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Iohannes Balistarius, G.C.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Burckhardi et Michahelis, Iohannis de Kayde de Bononia, Mathei Raymundi Baquirii Iohannis Grossi magistrique Bartholomei de post resignacionem atque ad episcopatus reverendissimi domini magistri Iohannis Faci \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Iohannes Faci, G.C.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  facundissimi suscepcionem tamquam vinea pollulans et florida refulgentis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  155v ist Iohannes Soreth genannt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Soreth dilecta vinea interpretatur et Soreth genus vitis optime ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  
\line Endet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut sic secundum illud Deutronomii XXII\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   que nascuntur ex vinea pariter sanctificentur in presenti graciam, in futuro vero per eternam gloriam. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Iohannes Soreth auch im Inhaltsverzeichnis vorn genannt. Soreth war Ordensgeneral der Karmeliten und Pr\u228 \'e4ses des Provinzkapitels 1458 in Augsburg; siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Deckert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Karmeliten, Register. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  156r\endash 168r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatulus de oratione dominica}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Leerraum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mt. VI et Luc. XI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (11)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Dixit unus ex discipulis eius ad eum: Domine doce nos orare et, ait illis: Cum oraveritis dicite Pater noster etc. Oratio dicitur quandoque mentis devocio. Unde Augustinus de sancto Victore (!): Oracio est devocio quedam ex compunccione ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Alcherus Claraevallensis [Ps. Augustinus], De spiritu et anima, Cap.50, PL 40 c.816) \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... proximis mutuam dileccionem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis bezeichnet als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatulus de oratione dominica 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   9006 (Paris, BN, lat. 3529 A, f.126\endash 127)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  168r\endash 174r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de iustitia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Diligite iusticiam vos qui iudicatis terram. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Videmus enim quod illud quod est preciosum carum vel amativum a principio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et per clausas ianuas intrare. Hoc ille. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich London, BL, Royal 2 D.IV, f.160 (Robert Holkot, Comm. in sapientiam). }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  227v\endash 243v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Franciscus de Mayronis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de corpore Christi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Memoriam fecit mirabiliter (!) suorum misericors et miserator dominus escam dedit timentibus se, Ps. X\u176 \'b0 C\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 110, 4)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tria sunt preconia, ex quibus solent principes specialiter commendari; primum est potencia que principatus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... efficiat crucifixus qui cum patre et spiritu sancto regnat in eternum. Amen etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium vgl. Th. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hohmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initienregister der Werke Heinrichs von Langenstein, in: Traditio 32 (1976) 399\endash 426, hier 411 Nr.124. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr. 298, 881. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S.329}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  244r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cottidie eucharistie communionem percipere nec laudo nec vitupero, omnibus tamen dominicis diebus ... etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. K. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneider\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Die Hss. der Stadtbibl. N\u252 \'fcrnberg 2, 1, 1967 S.402. 
\line 244v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ysiderus (!) de summo bono dicit: Qui scelerate vivunt ... Remigius in glosa: Ve tradentibus Christum ad crucifigendum }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  244v\endash 246v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exempla naturalia moralisata}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Hic nota naturalia quedam bona et utilia< Plinius in speculo naturali dicit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ista est condicio balsami et natura, quod si in ipso corpora putrida condiantur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Sic nimirum per omnem modum ipsa caro et sagwis (!) Christi visum mentis clarificat et illustrat ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  246r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Plinius in speculo naturali: Aves quidem ille que cadaveribus putridisque carnibus vescuntur velut volucres et corvi ... Aves quidem ille que cadaveribus putridisque carnibus vescuntur velut volucres et corvi ... Sic nimirum per omnem modum ipsi homines alitudinem presentis seculi transvolantes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... indigentem vero sanat eternaliter et conservat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zitiert aus dem 'Speculum naturale' des Vincentius Bellovacensis}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  247r\endash 248r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notae de sacramento corporis Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quod circa sacramentum corporis Christi non aliud invenitur vocabulum, quo digne tantum sacramentum valeat appellari nisi quod grece melius dicitur eucharistia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... de quodam genere frumenti quod far seu ador dicitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Isidor. etym. XVII 3,5). 
\line \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quod hostia frangitur in memoriam panis Christi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. Berlin, SB, Ms. theol. lat. fol. 732, f.151v. 
\line 247v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rabanus dicit in virtute eius ... Nota quinque miracula in altaris sacramento ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... manet totus in se tamen indivisus etc. }

