\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  286r\endash 292v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excerpta ex auctoribus antiquis, patribus et aliis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   
\line 286r Excerpta ex Solino, Valerio. \emdash  286r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ave gracia plena, dicit sanctus Thomas in IIIa parte questione XXVII art. V in solucione IIi argumenti, quod in rebus corporalibus triplex est perfeccio; primo quidem prefeccio disposicionis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  286v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Refert Ovidius li. IIII\u176 \'b0 Methamorphoseon in fabula: Cresus sive Acrisus rex cum Dane filiam pulcherrimam haberet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (und Iuppiter) \emdash  287r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Esopus ponit talem fabulam: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iove nupcias suas celebrante omnes bestias offerebant ei munera, inter quas serpens veniens offerebat vernantem rosam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Ferner werden zitiert \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ovidius poeta de arte dictandi, Ovidius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u252 \'fcber Pygmalion, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctus Thomas contra gentiles, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  288r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cassiodorus in hystoria tripartita, Philosophus II\u176 \'b0 Polliticorum, Sydonius in epistolari, Seneca in libro de clemencia, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  288v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ieronimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  usw., 289v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vincencius in speculo hystoriali in prima parte de miraculis beate virginis ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  290v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cassiodorus super illud psalmi ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  291r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Esopus ponit talem fabulam: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Leo wlpis ursus venantes ceperunt arietem ovem et agnum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (mit Moralisation), 291v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hugo, Tulius, Rabimoyses, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  292r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fulgentius in quodam libello de gestis Romanorum ..., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  292v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quare Christus temptari voluit patet secundum Augustinum ... }

