\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  298r\endash 302r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notae de conceptione beatae Mariae virginis ad sermones utiles}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  298r\endash 301r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota de concepcione beate virginis potest assumi thema de dominica secunda adventus, quia ut frequenter tunc concurrit. Et hoc illud: Erunt signa in sole et luna et in stellis, Luc. 21\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (25)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , vel illud: Videte ficulneam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 21,29)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . De primo potest procedi de signis in sole idest in Christo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  298v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... vide in Holkot quod Christus dicitur sol ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et honorificavi faciem tuam. Amen. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  301r\endash 302r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quod sumi potest thema de beata virgine: Sicut lilium inter spinas, sic amica mea inter filias, Cant. 2\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ubi spiritus sanctus tria commendabilia insinuat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash ... (Lc 22,27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dispono vobis regnum; et hoc est quod debent verba predicta (?), etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  302r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Premissis igitur de applicacionibus thematis si placuerit de misterio incarnacionis Christi qui scilicet omnia nostra suscepit infirmia et naturalia humanitatis preter peccatum et ignoranciam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dic singula}

