\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  22v\endash 28r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo auf der Visitation der benediktinischen Kl\u246 \'f6ster der Salzburger Provinz (1452)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo in visitacione monasteriorum ordinis sancti Benedicti in provincia Salczpurgensi constitutorum anno 1452< Fratres tuos visitabis si recte agant, scribitur primi Regum 17 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Reg 17,18)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , et sunt verba Isai ad David filium suum. Et licet verba ista dicta sint ad visitandum eos qui constituti fuerunt in bello corporali ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... qui visitavit nos oriens ex alto, qui cum patre etc. etc. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  23r marginal \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de communitate primitive ecclesie}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  28r\endash 35v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collatio in monasterio sanctae Dorotheae Wiennae 1450}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Collacio in cena domini facta in monasterio sancte Dorothee Wienne 1450< Recordare paupertatis et transgressionis mee absinthii et fellis, Threnorum 3\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (19)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Venerabiles in Christo patres, domini ac fratres merito diligendi. Sicut ex dictis sanctorum doctorum accipi potest, nichil ita displicet deo in fidelibus suis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... requiem animabus nostris inveniemus. Quam nobis concedat qui est promittere dignatus Ihesus Christus dominus noster cui cum eterno patri (!) et spiritu sancto est honor et gloria in secula seculorum amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Marginal z.B. 28r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Contra superbiam et ingratitudinem; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  35r zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in tractatu quodam de abiecto priore nuncupato sic dicitur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  am Rande \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in Mellico habetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Traktat bekannt? In Wien, Schotten, 314, f.1\endash 120, ein 'Remediarius abiecti prioris')}

