\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  35v\endash 41r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collatio in monasterio sanctae Dorotheae Wiennae 1441}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Collacio in cena domini facta in monasterio sancte Dorothee Wienne 1441< Gustans gustavi paululum mellis et ecce morior, I Reg. 14 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (43)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   redip. (?) etc. Cum constet et ex ipsa experientia manifestum sit ad modicam terreni huius mellis degustacionem nequaquam subsequi mortem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... per infinita et indefessa et immortalia secula seculorum. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (38r) Versus (3) im Text zitiert \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ut purius ores fili care fuge rumores Quidquid agant alii sis memor ipse tui Vive deo gratus mundo tumulatus}

