\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  46r\endash 50v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collatio de modo se bene habendi ad deum et proximum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Collacio bona in cena domini de modo se bene habendi ad deum et proximum< Exemplum dedi vobis, ita et vos faciatis, Ioh. 13 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Secundum doctores in tercio sentenciarum dicendum. Benignissimus redemptor noster Christus dominus qui nos in tantum dilexit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ipse benignus amator hominum Christus Ihesus dominus noster. Qui cum deo patre et ss. vivit etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  46r marginal \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cur deus per passionem suam nos redemit et non alio modo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  49v Zitat aus Cicero, De officiis I 144, 2\endash 3; 145,5\endash 146.1 (mit Varianten gegen\u252 \'fcber dem Original): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tulius libro primo de officiis: In vita omnia apta sint inter et conveniencia. Et que parva videntur esse delicta ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... accionum quam sonorum accentus (!). }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

