\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  71v\endash 75r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo ad synodum sacerdotum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo ad synodum sacerdotum< Compelle intrare. Verba proposita habentur Luc. 14 capitulo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (23)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   originaliter, transsumptive autem in contentis (?) dominice litteraliter. Reverendissimi patres et domini mei, doctores dignissimi ceterique prelati, curati, religiosi ... Nunc in presenti fateor singulis vobis quod ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia posuit animam meam ad vitam, Ps. 65 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Quam nobis prestare dignetur Ihesus Christus qui est in secula benedictus. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Berlin, SB, Theol. lat. quart 286, f.146v (Initium nur im Register)}

