\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo bonus de noviciis spiritualibus sive de septem requisitis ad ingressum religionis spiritualis perutilis< Hic peccatores recipit etc., Luc. 5 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dominus in principio mundi duos ordines instituit, unum hominum in paradiso, alterum angelorum in celo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ego autem in ea natus sum. Ad quam nos perducat etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in K\u246 \'f6ln, StA, GB quart 74, f.113r; L\u252 \'fcneburg, RatsB, Ms. Theol. quart 18, *f.16va}

