\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo bonus de dei quadruplicibus visitacionibus spiritualibus< Deus visitavit plebem suam, Luc. 7 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quoniam mutua visitacio solet esse signum caritatis et dileccionis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... cuius heredes nos faciat Ihesus Christus dominus noster qui cum patre etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  82r am Rande \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota Carmelita. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Clm 28602 (s.XV/1), f.126va}

