\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Collacio ad religiosos facta Herczeburga per magistrum Petrum eiusdem ordinis \emdash  1433< Estote perfecti, scribitur Mt. 5 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (48)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Venerabilis in Christo pater, domini ac fratres sinceriter dilecti. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Priusquam a vestris karitatibus abscedam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sive bonum irremuneratum permittit Ihesu Christi domini ... per eterna secula seculorum. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zu Petrus de Pulka (gest.1423) siehe F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Firnhaber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Petrus de Pulka, A\u214 \'d6G 15, 1856, 1\endash 70. Datierung (1433) spricht gegen diesen Autor}

