\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rubrik \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Collacio in exequiis reverendissimi patris et domini domini Petri de Schawenburg tunc sancti Vitalis presbiteri cardinalis et ecclesie Augustane episcopi facta per Iohannem Gossolt canonicum Augustanum ad clerum anno domini M CCCC LX VIIII feria 6 post Iubilate in ecclesia Augustana. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Leonem et ursum interfeci, Regum XVII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Reg. 17,36)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Reverendi patres. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Non ignoramus quod opus placere debeat deo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... graciam et gloriam dabit dominus; quas nobis donare dignetur Ihesus Christus qui est ... benedictus. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Clm 4149, f.294. Zu Schaumburg siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Joachimsohn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sigismund Meisterlin, 20ff. (Ges. Abh. II 148ff.)}

