\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  126v\endash 129r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Martinus de Walthausen}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collatio in susceptione visitatorum (Wien 1469)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rubrik \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Collatio egregii viri et doctoris sacri iuriscanonici domini Martini de Walthausen in suscipiendo visitatores inibi per dominum episcopum Pat(is) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Petrum?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   directos ad \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  suam parochiam visitandum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  gestrichen)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   monasterium ibidem visitandum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exsplicaturus (!) venerabiles patres et domini pauca, que ad suscepcionem placitam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   atque gratam vestrarum paternitatum que visitacionis gracia hic supervenerunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... audire mereamur, nobis concedat dominus noster Ihesus Christus. Amen. >Anno 1469 Wienne< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Im Anschlu\u223 \'df zwei Bemerkungen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quare obitus sanctorum non mors, sed natale vocatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota interpretacionem huius nominis clericus}

