\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  129v\endash 134r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collatio pro religiosis tempore quadragesimali (Wien)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Collacio multum utilis pro religiosis tempore quadragesimali et in visitacione per suos superiores apta, facta in monasterio canonicorum regularium sancte Dorothee Wienne< Ecce nunc tempus acceptabile, ecce nunc dies salutis, 2a Cor. 6 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Reverendi in Christo patres etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut dicit magister sentenciarum li. 2\u176 \'b0 d. I: Omnipotens et summe bonus deus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et nemo in eis, subaudi: peribit. Quod nobis concedat Ihesus Christus ... benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  132v am Rande \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota carmelita nota. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Fulda, LB, Aa 114, f.18ra.}

