\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  134r\endash 137r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collatio in visitatione vel reformatione monasterii}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Collacio in visitacione vel reformacione alicuius monasterii< Melior est unus timens deum quam mille filii impii, et utile est mori sine filiis quam relinquere filios impios, Ecci. 16 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Eccl 16, 3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Reverendi patres et domini etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Visitacio monasteriorum et reformacio eorum, quamvis malis religiosis sit plurimum odiosa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Endet (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... inter quos unus et precipuus videtur fuisse ... Hugo de Sancto Victore}

