\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  143v\endash 145v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo ad religiosos tempore visitationis (1471)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo ad religiosos sive collacio, tempore visitacionis< Intrate per angustam portam ... et pauci inveniunt eam, Mt. 7\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (13)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Venerabilis etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Christus dominus in evangelio (Leerraum) dicit: Ubi sunt duo vel tres congregati in nomine meo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... que hominem perducere possit ad vitam eternam. Hic potest addi correccio ad subditos et prelatos etc. iuxta placitum. 1471. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 146r Nota de claustralibus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De claustralibus nota< Has quatuor facies debet habere quilibet claustralis, per quas sancta animalia describuntur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Folgen Zitate aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ieronimus contra Iovinianum, Crisostomus, Bernhardus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius}

