\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  147r\endash 156v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Henricus de Haselbach}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collationes ad religiosos tempore visitationis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  147r\endash 151r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Collacio bona ad religiosos tempore visitacionis< Confirma hoc deus, quod operatus es in nobis, Ps. 67\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (29)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Honorabiles domini fratresque in Christo sinceriter dilecti ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vestras caritates brevi exhortacione alloqui cogitavi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... per graciam et in futuro per gloriam prestante domino nostro ... Amen. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  151r\endash 156v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Collacio alia ad religiosos tempore visitacionis< Dictum fuit in priori collacione de operibus malis que sunt fugienda, dicendum nunc de bonis que in nobis fiunt deo auctore ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et beati Colomanni huius terre patronorum concedere dignetur idem redemptor ... Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rubrum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Collacio explicit facta tempore visitacionis in quodam conventu Canonicorum regularium sacre theologie per doctorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Wortstellung!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Henricum de Hasselpach sacre theologie prepositum (!), post monasterii sacre Dorothee virginis Wienne. Orate pro eo etc. Laus deo meo. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Klosterneuburg, StiftsB, 856, Nr.13\endash 14, f.73. }

