\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Spiritus veritatis docebit vos omnem veritatem, Ioh. 16 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (13).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Reverendi patres ac fratres ... In unum nobis congregatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  eingef\u252 \'fcgt?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   considerandum tractandum ... disponendum, quomodo secundum ordinis nostri determinaciones ... non deficiat, sed ... proficiet in nobis religio sancta et immaculata ... Quid ad audiendum iocundius ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in libro Prosperi de vita contemplativa ca. 12\u176 \'b0, et in pluribus aliis locis que pronunc brevitatis amore dimitto. etc. >Explicit collacio bona ad religiosos< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Mit Textkorrekturen}

