\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo bonus de modo vivendi, utilis< O (!) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quisquis es, qui per fidem spem et caritatem vis ad salutem pertingere, necesse te habes studio triplici mancipare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... donec videatur deus per gloriam. Ad quam nos perducat qui ... Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Anonym \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   4855 (Praga, NK, Nr.984, f.190\endash 192) und Bern, Burgerbibl., 531, f.61\endash 64r. In Cambridge, Corp. Chr., 335, f.121v, Bonaventura beigelegt}

