\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo de obediencia, castitate et paupertate< Si quis wlt post me venire abneget semetipsum ... et sequatur me, Mt. 16 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (24)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Reverendi ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si verba et exempla precedencium patrum et sanctorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... De secundo dicitur in Psalmo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (67,7)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Qui habitare facit unius moris (!) in domo scilicet eterne beatitudinis. Ad quam nos etc}

