\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  253v\endash 264v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus de Pulka}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo pro visitacione monasteriorum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo pro visitacione monasteriorum ordinis sancti Benedicti et Augustini canonicorum regularium in ducatu Austrie, et loquitur principaliter contra vitium proprietatis religiosorum magistri Petri de Pulka doctoris eximii< Ecce nos reliquimus omnia, Mt. 19no \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (27)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec sunt verba appostolici cetus per os beati Petri principis apostolorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Schlu\u223 \'dfabschnitt 264r\endash v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Pro Benedictinis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  endet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... mereantur ad celestem gloriam pervenire prestante hoc eis domino nostro Ihesu Christo, qui ... vivit ... benedictus. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Melk, 793, f.244r. Unter dem Namen des Iohannes de Spira in Wien, Schottenstift, 152 (227) (52.d.3), f.154\endash 162}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

