\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1ra\endash 7vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Comestor (Ps.)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber de sacramentis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorrede \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hoc libro sicut in ceteris tria precipue consideranda sunt, scilicet materia modus agendi et utilitas. materia huius libri sacramentorum sunt remedia que ad curationem animarum divina instituit gratia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum multa sint sacramenta nove legis, VII tamen principalia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ista \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Dittographie korrigiert) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  omnia significant clericos debere mundari ab omnibus superfluitatibus antequam accedant ad sacros ordines. Expliciunt sacramenta. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis f.232r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De septem sacramentis in primo quaterno. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Landgraf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Einf\u252 \'fchrung, S.104 (\u220 \'dcberlieferung); (ders.), Dogmengeschichte, III 2, S.294 (mit Lit.). }

