\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  31r\endash 71r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gerhardus de Vliederhoven (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cordiale quattuor novissimorum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Oben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus assit vobis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Beginnt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Memorare novissima tua et in eternum non peccabis, Ecclesiastici septimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Eccli. 7,40)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicud dicit Augustinus in libro suarum meditacionum: Plus vitanda est sola peccati feditas quam }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  39v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Secundum novissimorum de iudicio extremo< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  53v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tercium novisssimorum cuius salubris recordacio a peccatis prohibet est infernus seu gehenna ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  64v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De summa pulchritudine sive claritate regni celestis< Quartum novissimorum quos valde et precipue debet homines a peccatis retrahere est gloria celestis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Vere vere gens absque consilio est et sine prudencia. Ach utinam saperent et intelligerent ac novissima providerent. etc. etc. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis f.232r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quattuor novissima 31. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   3057. VL\u178 \'b2 2, 1217\endash 1221. Clm 14127, f.263va\endash 265va (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wunderle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Clm 27499, f.242r\endash 299v (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hauke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). }

