\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  72r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Forma absolutionis ab excommunicatione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Forma absolucionis ab excommunicacione hoc modo habet processum< Spoliabitur excommunicatus vestibus et flexis genibus prostratus ponat se coram illo qui ipsum absolvere debet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... In fine debet absolvens dicere: Auctoritate dei omnipotentis ... et spiritus sancti amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis f.232r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Forma absolucionis ab excommunicaione 71.}

