\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  72r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De auctoritate prioris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Auctoritas prioris hec est etc. Magister ordinis provincialis prior ac eorum vices gerentes in provinciis et conventibus ac locis sibi commissis ... absolucionis et dispensacionis beneficium valeant impertiri nisi adeo gravis et enormis fuerit excessus quod sint ad eandem sedem apostolicam merito destinandi etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (11 Zeilen)}

