\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  72v\endash 73r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de assumptione beatae Mariae virginis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De assumptione beate Mariae virginis etc.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tenuisti manum dexteram meam et in voluntate tua deduxisti me et cum gloria assumpsisti me, Ps. (Ps 72,24). Dominus noster Ihesus Christus assumpsit homo matrem suam karissimam electissimam de hoc mundo et hoc propter tria}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Tercio assumpsit Christus beatam virginem ut sit regina celi in eternum et hoc vidit David in spiritu multis annis antequam Christus nasceretur et dicit: Astitit regina a dexteris tuis. Laudo te ... nunc et in eternum. Rogamus etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis f.232r}

