\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  182r\endash 184r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De diebus festivis hebdomadae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quare dies dominicus et dies sabbati et dies sexte ferie plus venerandi et honorandi sunt quam alii dies}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   per ebdomadam. De hoc habentur multe raciones. etc.< Dies dominicalis est celebris propter multa. Nam eodem die omnes angeli sunt creati ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  182v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De sabbato die< Sabbatum est celebrandum quia eodem die sancta caro Christi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  183r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De sexta feria< Sexta feria est valde venerande (!) et reveranda quia eodem die deus ostendit nobis maxima signa caritatis ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  183v werden zitiert \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Versus: Salve festa dies que wlnera nostra coherces ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (h\u228 \'e4ufig, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia 17100. Siehe auch.zu M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, oct. Cod. ms. 65, f.114r). 
\line 184r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De festis sanctorum in generali et speciali< Nota quod quicumque devote celebrat festum beati Petri ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... deum in sanctis suis abicit atque spernit. Et cetera. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. \emdash  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis f.232r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De die dominicali 180 / De sabbato et sexta feria. 181 / De festis sanctorum in generali 182.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  194v\endash 195v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Auctoritates}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (32) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus: Plus offendit de peccatis gloriando quam peccatum perpetrando. Hic temporaliter delectari est eternaliter ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ferner \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hugo: Sciendum quod nec iustus nec impius puer nec senex... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  195r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bernhardus: Penitencia est inicium convertendi ad deum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Fructus operis in intencione consistit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest von 195r leer. \emdash  195v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ieronimus: Inter centum milia hominum quorum vita fuerit mala in hora mortis vix unus merebitur indulgenciam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quando peccator peccatorem laudat se invicem occidunt.}

