\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  196r{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Sermo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O vos omnes qui transitis per viam etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Thren. 1,12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verba illa dicta sunt in parabola (?) Christi sue passionis dolorem explicantis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Et notantur hic duo circa passionem suam, scilicet exaggregacionem doloris et causam finalem passionis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et ibi mortem sustinuit ut nos ab eterna morte liberaret. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. \emdash  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis f.231v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In die palmarum 193 (!). }

