\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  204r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aufnahme des Lektors Johannes Franck in den Augsburger Dominikanerkonvent 1481}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 LXXXI in vigilia sancti Gregorii pape, que protunc fuit dies dominica ... Et illa die frater Iohannes Franck lector fuit receptus ... in filium nativum conventus Augustensis in presencia reverendi patris magistri Hainrici de Wesmalia vicarii generalis provincie Theutonie ... Existentibus in conventu predicto ac capitulariter congregatis in dicta receptione supradicti fratris Iohannis Franck reverendis patribus et fratribus videlicet patre Dominico Mayr priore domus, reverendo magistro Luca Crun (Brun?) vicario nacionis Suevie, p. ap. Georio Prenner lectore et priore tunc conventus Herpipolensis, patre Andrea Reuthlin supriore et lectore, Iohanne Neggis lectore domus, fratre Georio Hichlinger, Iohanne Wichman, Ulrico Nagel, Iohanne Schnizer, Ulrico Buchelm\u252 \'fcller, Andrea Filsegger, Iohanne Ber et fratre Simone \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Castner, Kastner) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sacerdotibus. Et professis existentibus fratre Sebastiano, Bernhardo, Nicolauo (!) et fratre Vito. Hi omnes ... presentes fuerunt, de extraneis vero presentes in dicta recepcione fuerunt frater Michael Karel \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Caroli)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   conventus Eistetensis, Iohannes Beckschlager conventus Landhutensis et frater Iohannes Schench conventus Friburgensis et frater Iohannes Bavari diaconus conventus Thuricensis et frater Iohannes diaconus conventus Confluentini. 
\line Absentes fuerunt vero reverendus pater Ulricus Mair sacre theologie bacallarius tunc confessor sororum in Fraw\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [en]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aurach, pater Iohannes Goed (?) lector, frater Iohannes Ziegler, Ulricus Hockel (?), Michael Fisierer (?), Leonhardus de Ulma, Leonhardus Sartoris, Ulricus B\u252 \'fcchler, Nicolaus Aichter (?), Michahell et frater Ambrosius. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nach dieser Handschrift ediert in: Quellen und Forschungen zur Geschichte des Dominikanerordens 7 (1911) 94\endash 95, vgl. auch S.VIII. Zu Iohannes Franck ebd. S.4. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  204va\endash 218va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vocabularium latino-germanicum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aa. a. interiectio dolentis vel nomen littere. Abdicare vercziehen vel afkeruen. Abdere afdoin vel berghen. Abies dannunboim. Abigere enwechdoin ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Zelotes mynner. Zerum grece siccum latine. Zerophagiua sicca comestio. Zodiacus circulus celi continens duodecim signa. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Z.T. mit nur lateinischem Interpretament. Niederdeutsch z.B. 216vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Theatrum spilhus. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  218vb Differentia inter amorem, caritatem et dilectionem \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Differentia est inter amorem dileccionem et caritatem, quia amor proprie est nature et dicitur amor quasi animorum unio ... Dileccio est amor proximi et dicitur dileccio quas duo ligans ... Caritas est amor in deum ... dicitur caritas quasi cara unitas vel carum deo faciens. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 219r leer}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  219v\endash 220r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paulus Flandronus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Consultatio sacerdotum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quindecim presbiteri nuper considere (!) in quodam capitulo conventu et dixere: Nostras wlt ancillas presul removere. Quid debemus filii super hoc respondere? Primus: O magnum consilium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dixit quintus decimus: Quando bibo vina et me sompnus capiat hora matutina ne michi deficiat carnis medicina volo quod dormiat mecum concubina. Racio probacionis: Dedit enim dominus malediccionem viro qui non fecerat generacionem. Ergo tibi consulo per hanc racionem generes ut habeas benediccionem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quod sic implebitis leges divinas. etc 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 16011; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Streitgedicht, Stuttgart 1963 (2. Auflage), 116. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wattenbach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Anf\u228 \'e4nge latein. profaner Rythmen des M.A., ZfdA 15 (1872) 498. Clm 215, f.59, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sottili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , IMU 12 (1969) 371. Dort folgt f. 60 ein Carmen de capitulo 15 mulierum. Inc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Alias dum synodum clerus celebraret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  Carmina des Paulus Flandronus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kristeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  s Iter Italicum zufolge auch in Vat. Pal. lat. 1900. }

