\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  220v\endash 222r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis (Ps.)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dolus mundi}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eya (!) fratres servi dei non vos conturbant verba oris mei Sed audite ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ergo laus semper sit deo qui miseretur converso reo. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 20575 (mit dieser Hs.), 2727. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   6469 (var.), 666. Siehe auch 'In principio' (Dolus mundi): Beginnt normal \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Viri fratres servi dei...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  222v\endash 223v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De letaniis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Letanie bis sunt in anno et una vocatur maior, altera vero minor. Maior fit in die beati Marci ewangeliste, minor in diebus rogationibus ... De prima letania scilicet de maiori scribit quidam monachus de montibus Caspini nomine Paulus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (de Monte Cassino?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicens quod tempore Pelagii ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Omnes confessores et virgines cum omnibus electis dei etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 224r leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Letanie in anno bis fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   u.\u228 \'e4. in 'In principio'}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  224v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exemplum de nova historia sancti Nicolai cantanda (Erscheinung des Hl. Nikolaus, der den Prior z\u252 \'fcchtigt)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Legitur quod cum in quadam ecclesia que dicitur crux subiecta monasterio sancte Marie de caritate nondum hystoria beati Nicolai cantaretur, fratres eiusdem loci priorem suum ut eam sibi cantare liceret instanter rogaverunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dixit: Ite et hystoriam novam sancti Nicolai ammodo decantate. Tempore Heinrici quarti imperatoris ossa beati Nicolai apud urbem Barensem translata sunt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. BHL 6209. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  225r\endash 226r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancto Iohanne Baptista}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aquila grandis magnarum alarum etc. Ezech. 17 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctus propheta Ezechiel vidit aquilam grandem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... que volavit super unum montem altem (!) scilicet Libanum ... Per aquilam istam intelligere debemus sanctum Iohannem Ewangelistam qui fuit aquila propter sublimitatem vite ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Sed in tantum cor eius ascendit in quantum ipse non erat homo sed angelus esse inceperat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest von 226r leer. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  226v\endash 228v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de nativitate beati Iohannis Baptistae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De nativitate beati Iohannis Baptiste< Quis putas puer iste erit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 1,66)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verba sunt ammirantium in beati Iohannis nativitate. In predictis verbis duo sunt consideranda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , primo quid eos movit ad querendum, secundo qualiter ad predictam interrogacionem sit respondendum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Mors preciosa quia triplicem aureolem (!) meruit qua in celo coronatus est scilicet virginum martirum et predicatorum sive doctorum. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Seite und 229r leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Anfang \u228 \'e4hnlich in Augsburg, SuStB, cod. fol. 300, f.64va. \emdash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   2, 491. }

