\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Weylheimer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Inhaltsverzeichnis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tabula in libro contentorum Tractatus moralizatus super ludo scacorum magistri Iacobi ordinis predicatorum. Questiones bone de cultu latrie. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (sehr ausf\u252 \'fchrlich und genau). }

