\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  37rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Auctoritates morales}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Auctoritates morales< Enoch philosophus dixit filio suo: Timor domini sit negociacio tua et veniet tibi lucrum sine labore. Dixit alius philosophus: Qui timet deum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... omnia erunt prospera quocumque ieris. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Aus der 'Discplina clericalis' des Petrus Alphonsi? }

