\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  37va\endash 42vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Richardus de Mediavilla}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones ex libro III super Sententias}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Utrum humanitati Christi sit cultus latrie exhibendus. Videtur quod non. Minori minor debetur reverentia, sed Christus inquantum homo minor est patre ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Folgen neun Quaestionen, am Rand gez\u228 \'e4hlt. Die letzte endet 41ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in quantum representat personam Christi. etc. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  41ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De incarnacione divine persone< Queritur utrum fuerit possibile aliqua divina personam incarnari. Et videtur quod non. Quando quelibet persona est purus actus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed aliquid absolutum. >Iste questiones prescripte sunt Rychardi de Media Villa ordinis minorum in suo tercio libro sentenciarum< 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RS, Nr.722 (mit dieser Hs.). }

