\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  44ra\endash 48rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speculum anime }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anima mea novi quod curiosa sis rimando que foris sunt et assidue de fenestris habitaculi tui cuncta que circa te sunt conspicis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... intelligas rerum originem et te media (!) mirificam earum in finem ultimum. Gloria sit deo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield 418\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . }

