\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  54ra\endash 60vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expositio missae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quam brevis fuerit missa et in verbis et in cerimoniis quam Christus celebrando sacramentum eukaristie instituerit, patet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  59va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... agnus paschalis qui figurabat Christum commederetur festinanter. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zusatz \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quamvis omnia de quibus dictum est utpote gestus et verba accidentalia sint consecracioni ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... de aliis accidentalibus officii misse satis patet in primo tractatu, ideo sufficiant que dicta sunt de missa. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. Clm 27340, f.8ra\endash 17ra. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Messe, S.517\endash 519. Siehe auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hohmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initienregister der Werke Heinrichs von Langenstein, in: Traditio 32 (1976) 399\endash 426, hier 414}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  60vb\endash 62rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Determinatio anno 1385 facta de propositionibus Iohannis M\u252 \'fcnzinger}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini amen. Anno nativitatis eiusdem M\u176 \'b0 (!) LXXXV indiccione VIIIa die 12 mensis Septembris hora vesperorum vel circa in conventu ordinis predicatorum opidi Ulmensis et sic civibus Ulmensibus pro testibus ad- (!) pro missa vocatis spiritualiter et rogatis. Quod quidem instrumentum continere cernimus quasdam proposiciones cum earum probacionibus et deduccionibus in dubium a quibusdam revocatas, et ob hec eciam universitati Wyennensi, ut veritas evidencius cognoscatur, sub manu publica per magistrum Iohannes Muntzinger, qui eas posuisse perhibetur, exhibendas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... huiusmodi auctoritate determinanda reservantes. Deo gracias amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. Frankfurt, StuUB, Praed. 88, Nr.5 f.81vb. }

