\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  62va\endash 67vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de ascensione domini}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo de ascensione domini< magistri Henrici de Hassia. Sic veniet quemadmodum vidisti eum euntem in celum, scribitur Actuum primo capitulo (11). Sicut novistis domini et patres sacro docente eloquio deus in celesti regione ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia ab inicio mundi // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Anscheinend unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hohmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initienregister der Werke Heinrichs von Langenstein, in: Traditio 32 (1976) 399-426, hier 418. Frankfurt, StuUB, Ms. lat. quart 77, f.109rb. Kassel, SBuLB, fol. Ms. theol. 109, f.110rb. }

