\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  68ra\endash 71r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de officio prelati}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In precedentibus fuit dictum, quod officium prelati debet consistere in duobus, videlicet in disciplina correccionis et sermone predicacionis, et illa duo fideliter exercuit apostolus, ut patet in presenti capitulo quasi per totum; et de primo fuerunt plura dicta scilicet de modo corrigendi prelatorum et de ordine fraterne correccionis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  68vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et per consequens de tota leccione presenti. // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Blattwechsel 69r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  // ipsi sunt infideles, igitur correctorium verum. Correctorium fideliter vel infideliter non attenditur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Folgt eine Aufreihung von 'Correctoria', von der fraglich ist, ob sie Teil eines anderen Textes ist. \emdash  Endet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed eciam pagani aliqua super naturam de deo credunt}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

