\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  90vb\endash 96rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Baco}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de potestate papae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dictum est de dignitate capitis ecclesie et legislatoris Christi. Nunc quero de dignitate vicarii sui in terris, et utrum possit leges condere super statu ecclesie ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  94ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et in familia earum. >De temporali dignitate pape< Queritur de ordine seu dignitate pape temporali. Hic primo ostendo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Ab 95r von anderer Hand; m\u246 \'f6glicherweise anderer Text. Endet 96rb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... que fuerit edita contra heriticos (!) Marsilium de Padua et Iohannem de Ganduno. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Drei Zitate angeschlossen, zwei aus Gregor d. Gr., eines aus der \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Glossa super verbo Sermonis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in Vat. lat. 4039, f.266v\endash 271v (siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Miethke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u220 \'dcberlieferung der Schriften des I. Gonzales, in: Quellen und Forschungen aus italienischen Archiven und Bibliotheken 60, 1980, 318; expl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  quia dominus regnavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ); Rom, Bibl. Casanatense, 1406, f.229rb\endash 235va; ferner Paris, BN, lat. 9000, f.179}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  96va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota de adoratione et honore (excerptum)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De adoracione et honore< Item notandum secundum Henricum de Gandavo quodlibeto X\u176 \'b0 questione VIa, quod ista 5 se habent per ordinem scilicet revereri, honorare, laudare, glorificare, adorare ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et dicuntur hic mel silvestre. Hoc Rabanus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Crisostomus dicit super Matheum: Locuste sunt volatilia quedam ... que manducabat Iohannes constitutus in deserto etc}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

