\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  166vb\endash 167vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo in exequiis cuiusdam armigeri Georgii Mausamner}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen. Reverendissimi patres in deo dilectissimi dominique in caritate Ihesu Cristi prestantissimi. Cum simus in amore dei fraternalique caritate congregati et signanter in exequiis Georgii Mawsamner (?) quondam armigeri validi nunc manu dei mancipati, ignorantes an in odio vel amore dignus deo sit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nec missa pro defunctis celebrare}

