\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  168va\endash 169va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo in dominica XI}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Duo homines ascenderunt in templum ut orarent, Luc. XVIII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (10)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Docet nos in presenti ewangelio humiliter orare et de bonis non presumere vel nos iactare ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... de duricia cordis lapidei, Iohel. II \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (13)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Scindite corda vestra. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Titel im Inhaltsverzeichnis vorn angef\u252 \'fchrt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr.1979 (Hugo de Prato, Sermones dominicales per annum, "f.168va\endash 170vb: De Trinit.", jedoch auf den Sermo Hugos unten f.175vb\endash 177vb zu beziehen). }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  170ra\endash 170vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vado mori}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vado mori papa summus. Nos omnes capiat humus, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In pulverem quis redactus, vix est de hoc sermo factus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non vaccemus nos torpori, sed anime, vado mori. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... hiis premissis sic dolori moriuntur, vado mori. 
\line In nomine domini Amen. Anno domini milesimo CCCC\u176 \'b0 XVLIto feria secunda infra octavam sancti Iohannis Baptiste rescripta sunt prenotata per me fratrem Gregorium Flogil ordinis fratrum beate Marie virginis de Carmelo in civitate et conventu Strawbingensi protunc existens ibidem predicator, cuius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (verbessert aus 'qui')\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   exemplar habui a venerabili domino Conrado Cholsmid (?) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ('Choltsmid' Rosenfeld S.190 Anm.2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  capellani ac rectoris (!) monasterii Alte superioris. Et hoc anno nativitatis mee XXXVIto, professionis decimi octavi, sacerdocii XVIti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Genitiv der Jahresangaben!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Hg. (nach dieser Handschrift) von Hellmut \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rosenfeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Das Oberaltaicher Vadomori-Gedicht und Peter von Rosenheim, in: Mittellateinisches Jahrbuch 2, 1965, 190\endash 204, Text 195\endash 198. Vgl. H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rosenfeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Vadomori, in: ZfdA 124 (1995) 257\endash 264. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia 19965}

