\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  179ra\endash 181rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Flogel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancto Laurentio (N\u252 \'fcrnberg 1451)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Igne me examinasti et non est inventa in me iniquitas, ita scribitur Psalmo XVI\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   originaliter; que tamen ad laudem martiris sancti Laurencii assumi possunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ideo ab igne eterne dampnacionis sequestratus, ideo dicit: Igne me examinasti. Nunc (?) membra repete et conclude. Collatus per fratrem Gregorium Flogel anno LI\u176 \'b0 Nurberge. Cum defecerunt ligna, extingwetur ignis, Proverbiorum XXVI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (20)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . }

