\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  226va\endash 227vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de assumptione beatae Mariae virginis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De assumpcione< Mulier ecce filius tuus, Ioh. XIX \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (26)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Augustinus: Qui socii sunt contumelie, debent esse participes et glorie. Ex quo igitur verbo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... filius karissimus qui est amor ... et omnibus amabilis. etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  227va\endash vb Nota de voce mulieris in sacra scriptura \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum quod hoc nomen mulier in sacra scriptua multipliciter accipitur; nam aliquando sonat naturam vel sexum nature ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Nam ut refert Eberhardus alte nubes non pluunt ... ut dicat ei filius mulier etc. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  232ra\endash 243ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de beata Maria virgine ('Amavit')}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amavit eam rex super omnes mulieres, Hester II\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (17)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quamvis verbum istud ad litteram dictum sit de Hester regina, quam rex Aswerus dilexit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia natus est nobis hodie salvator mundi. Ad quem nos perducat mater eius pia semper virgo Maria. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rot: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit quidam tractatulus super Hester compositus per quendam lectorem de ordine minorum, conscriptus per fratrem Gregorium Flogel de ordine fratrum Carmelitarum Babemberge (!) protunc ibidem predicator \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (statt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  predicatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   feria quarta finitus ante festum Katherine anno XLVII\u176 \'b0. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Mit Randbemerkungen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, Nr.9889. Auch in Clm 3591, f.162r\endash 204r; N\u252 \'fcrnberg, StB, Cent. IV, 12, f.3ra. \emdash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rosenfeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Mlat. Jb. 2, 1965, 190: Flogel "1449 in Bamberg". 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  243ra\endash va Notae theologicae \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Nota de incarnacione< Damascenus libro III\u176 \'b0 capitulo 2\u176 \'b0 quod simul caro, simul dei verbum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Weitere Exzerpte, aus der Glossa ordinaria, Cassiodor, 'Petrus de Tharusio sive Tharenthasio' 243rb angeschlossen. Dann \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Dileccio inimicorum< Ieronimus super illud psalmi ... Queritur utrum tenemur inimicos diligere affectu; et arguitur primo quod non diligere inimicos est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  243va \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Questio de inimicis< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quod excludit casum scilicet necessitatem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Notizen (5 Zeilen) von einer anderen Hand auf dem Rest der Spalte. \emdash  243vb leer. }

