\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  248v, 251r\endash 252r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Declaratio doctorum studii Coloniensis de confessionibus audiendis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Declaracio docorum studii Coloniensis de confessioni[bu]s audiendis et missis diebus festivis in ecclesiis IIIIor ordinum mendancium< In nomine domini. Amen. Per hoc presens publicum instrumentum cunctis pateat evidenter, quod sub anno a nativitate domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 XLIII\u176 \'b0 indicione (!) sexta die vero Veneris vicesimo quarta mensis Maii ... venerabiles et religiosi patres et domini Iohannes de Bechta sacre theologie professor et Heinricus Tengnagel lector necnon Iacobus de Inferno sacre theologie baccalarius formatus universitatis studii Coloniensis ac Iacobus de Gladbach reverendissimi ... Theodorici archiepiscopi Coloniensis etc. penitenciarius ordinis fratrum predicatorum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  248v/251v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... seu censuris artare / populum suum ad non confitendum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  251v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... scriptura proprie manus et sigillo signavi. Et ego Wilhelmus Rockolois de Brugella clericus Cameracensis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  252r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in testimonium omnium et singulorum premissorum. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in N\u252 \'fcrnberg, StB, Cent. VII,3 f.143v\endash 149v (andere Personen genannt). }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  252r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Declaratio facultatis Theologicae universitatis Viennensis (excerptum)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Declaracio inclite facultatis theologice alme universitatis Wiennensis pro privilegiis ordinum mendicancium ab ecclesia dei et sede aposolice (!) confirmatis< Nos facultas sacre theologie ... sub anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 XLmo in festo palmarum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... specialiter celebrata Anno domini 1441\u176 \'b0 quinta die Aprilis nostro sub sigillo. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in N\u252 \'fcrnberg, StB, Cent. VII,3 f.141v\endash 143r (Erkl\u228 \'e4rung gegen den Chormeister Leonhard). Vgl. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Uiblein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Akten der theologischen Fakult\u228 \'e4t der Universit\u228 \'e4t Wien (1386-1508), I\endash II, Wien 1978, hier I 86, II 674 A.561. }

