\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  252r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iulianus Cesarini}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Declaratio (Basel 1431)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Declaracio domini Iuliani cardinalis legati in Germania< Iulianus miseracione divina sacrosancte Romane ecclesie sancti Angeli dyaconus cardinalis in Germania apostolice sedis legatus universis et singulis ecclesiarum parochialium Bambergensis dyocesis curatis et aliis clericis ... salutem ... Inter cetera legacionis nobis iniuncte officia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Streitigkeiten in N\u252 \'fcrnberg wegen des Beichtens bei Mendikanten \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... non carebit. Datum Basilee die vicesima quarta Septembris anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCCC\u176 \'b0 XXX primo indicione (!) nona pontificatus ... Eugenii ... pape quarti anno primo. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Auch in N\u252 \'fcrnberg, StB, Cent. VII,3 f.138r\endash 139r. }

