\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  253v\endash 254r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de dominica secunda post pasca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ego sum pastor bonus, Ioh. X \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (11)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sciendum circa litteram, quod triplex est pastor bonus, videlicet essencialis, accidencialis et ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et hii exemplo Cristi se debent habere modo predicto. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachschrift \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Solliciti enim debent esse pastores in verbo dei ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... vicarium habebit in premii accepcione. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich in W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.ch.q.16/2, f.200v\endash 201}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  254v\endash 255v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notabilia de satisfactione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota secundum Augustinum satisfaccio est causas excidere, per que (!) sic preservatur a futuris, et notat causas intrinsecas radices ex peccato relictas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Marginale Lemmata \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tria sunt bona, hominis, ludus alle taxilli, meretrices, hystriones, [de] tormentis, bellum, ementes furtum vel rapinam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  usw., bis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Penitencia falsa. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et ideo penitenti semper debet. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis vorn \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De satisfaccione notabilia bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  Rest der Seite leer. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  256r\endash 257v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones duo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Occurrerunt ei decem viri leprosi, Luc. XVII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , idest decem abusiones sive transgressiones, que heu (!) maximam multitudinem iam inficiunt per lepram ... ... a quibus lepris nos mundare dignetur Ihesus ... qui ... est benedictus. Amen. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primum querite regnum dei, Mt. VI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (33)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Quidam non solum non querunt, sed fugiunt ut ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... secundo dileccio gloriosa, fruicio deliciosa etc. Applica ut scis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vorn im Inhaltsverzeichnis als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de dominica XV.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

