\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  258ra\endash 267rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circa inicium sermonum de tempore venerabilis magistri Nicolai de Dingelsphuel (!) ewangelium, quod in prima dominica egitur quasi di. (?) etc. habetur in dominica palmarum; et ideo usque ad diem presens reservabo dicturus iam solum de illo verbo thematis, quod in fine eius ponitur, scilicet Benedictus qui venit in nomine domini. Ubi notandum quod in omni anno semel non sine magna causa adventus dominicum (!) non sollempni memoria ab universa ecclesia celebratur, quod tam devote sollempniter[que] non fieret, nisi in eo lateret magnum aliquid sacritatis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ut dicitur ibidem et ita intelligitur in proposito in textu Ysaie. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis vorn: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Sermo de dominica prima adventus domini magistri Nicolai de Dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  267rb\endash 268vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de die iudicii (Entwurf)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De die iudicii< Erunt signa in sole. Diceret aliquis: Precedentne aliqua signa immediate diem iudicii et adventum Christi secundarium? Respondetur secundum sanctum Thomam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  268vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... propalari, huius tamen contrarium communiter tenetur; vide alibi ut scis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Folgt eine Note bis zum Ende der Spalte \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum de adventu domini in mentem, que communiter vocatur a doctoribus vivo sanctificativa (!). Pro quo est notandum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quod in illo occulto est invisibili}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

