\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  269ra\endash rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo (Entwurf)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Dominica XXV< In diebus illis salvabitur Iuda et Israel habitabit confidenter, Iere. XXIII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (6; auch 33,16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Per Iudam qui semper fuit primus in bello ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  269ra \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... unde dominus statim subiunxit Luc. VII: Remittuntur ei peccata multa. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  269ra\endash rb Nachtrag \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad hoc ostendendum nomen (?) accesserat Ioab, II reg. XX \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui tenuit manu dextera mentum Amase ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... non attingens tercium nisi per secundum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Spalte leer. }

