\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  317ra\endash 328vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Contra impugnantes dei cultum et religionem}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit liber magistri Thome de Aquino de ordine fratrum predicatorum contra magistrum Wilhelmum hereticum de Sancto Amore< Prima pars huius unum capitulum habet scilicet de natura religionis et in quo perfeccio religionis consistat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  317vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit prologus magistri Thome de Aquino< Ecce inimici tui sonuerunt et qui oderunt te extulerunt caput super populum tuum ... ultra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps.82,3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnipotens deus hominum amator}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  328va\endash b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Sicut alterius uxor nec adulterari ab aliquo nec iudicari nec disponi nec a proprio viro recedere // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I 8 [AG29]). Unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. \emdash  Rest der Spalte 328vb leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grabmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Werke des hl. Thomas von Aquin. M\u252 \'fcnster 1949, S.330. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire (1933), Nr.14m. H.F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dondaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , H.V. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Shooner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Codices manuscripti Thomae de Aquino, Nr.1730. \emdash  Auch in N\u252 \'fcrnberg, StB, Cent. I, 80, 101rb\endash 146vb. }

