\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  341ra\endash 343ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de superstitionibus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam lumbi mei etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps. 37,8)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Constat fidem rectam (!) caritatem (!) informatam lumen existere animarum humanarum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  342vb \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et tantum pro tercio et per consequens de toto articulo primo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quantum ad secundum articulum que (!) est utrum aliquis posset uti ministeriis demonum utpote ad prenuncciandum futura, ad revelandum occulta ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et faciliter cognoscere possunt occulta quam presencia quam preterita presertim ea que ad extra (?) in effectum sunt vel fuerunt hominibus huiusmodi (?) ignota. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  Im Inhaltsverzeichnis vorn: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Utrum dyabolus illudendo possit immittere in animam hominis bona vel mala. Utrum aliquis possit licite uti ministeriis demonum. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zahlreich \u252 \'fcberliefert, z.B. Augsburg, UB, Oettingen-Wallerstein Cod. II.1.2\u176 \'b0 74, f.330ra\endash 364vb (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 gele\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   I 299). Vgl. 'Gesamtindex' und 'In principio'.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  344ra\endash 345ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de sancta Katharina}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  344ra\endash va (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De sancta Katherina< Requievit archa mense septimo super montes, Gen. VIII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (4)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Naturaliter unumquodque quiescit in loco suo, extra quem non potest quiescere vel esse in pace ... 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  344va\endash 345r (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur alius sermo< Sicut lilium inter spinas ... inter filias, Cant. 1\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ct 2,2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Similitudo enim est causa dileccionis, Eccl. XIII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (19)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Omne animal diligit simile sibi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Exodi XXV, ubi dicitur quod dominus precepit Moysi // \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Abbruch (die letzten Zeilen auf dem unterem Blattrand) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , III 113. \emdash  Iacobus de Lausanna, Sermo in festo sancta Katherinae: Paris, BN, lat. 3552, f.126v u.a. (siehe 'In principio'). \emdash  (2) ohne Nachweis}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  345ra\endash 346ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verteidigung des Karmeliterordens vor dem Papst gegen Vorw\u252 \'fcrfe (Auszug?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad informandum vestram reverendam paternitatem super tribus articulis primo videlicet super successionem et imitacionem fratrum ordinis beate Marie ab Helia et Heliseo sanctis dei prophetis, secundo super intitulacionem eiusdem ordinis in iure communi et posicione quorundam articulorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [et de]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   declaracione cum prohibicione contrarie assercionis. Humilis prior generalis ordinis predicti domino nostro pape humiliter et devote supplicavit pro eo, quod religiosi .... Tercio quod ordo predictus in iure quasi minime sit confirmatus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... verba congruenter debent intelligi}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  346va-b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota de humilitate Motto}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Humiliamini sub potenti manu dei, 1 Petr. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (5,6).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Notandum quod humilitas est necessaria quia sine ea nullatenus ad regnum celorum pervenitur, Mathei XVII: Nisi quis se humiliaverit etc. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zitiert Autorit\u228 \'e4ten. Am Schlu\u223 \'df verschiedene Exzerpte, darunter eine Zeile \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad conficiendum ceram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  Rest von 346vb leer. }

