\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  347ra\endash 349vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Flogel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de visitatione Mariae (1447 Bambergae collatus)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sermo de visitacione Marie< Ostende michi faciem tuam sonet vox in auribus meis, vox enim ... decora, Cant. II\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (14)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Karissimi, refert Marbodus de natura lapidum capitulo XXV, quod est una gemma que vocatur ethices habens infra se naturaliter more pregnantis unam aliam gemmam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Cant. II: Nigra sum sed formosa etc. Rogemus dominum etc. Hic sermo collatus est per fratrem Gregorium Flogel anno XLVII in Bamberga. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. Marbod, Liber lapidum, I 25: 'ethites' (PL 171, c.1775). Im Inhaltsverzeichnis vorn als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Sermo de nativitate domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   bezeichnet. }

