\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  349vb\endash 350va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Flogel (?)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de dominica quinta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hoc vocati estis ut benediccione hereditatem possideatis, 1. Petr. III \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Loquitur clangor celi ad modum patris familias discernens liberos a servis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hec omnia et quam plura vides et reperies in summa confessorum libro primo parte VII titulo VIII. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zum Explicit: wohl die 'Summa confessorum' des Iohannes de Friburgo (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr. 2344). \emdash  Rest der Spalte leer}

