\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  367r\endash v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones duo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \emdash  (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sic deus dilexit mundum, ut unigenitum suum daret, Iohannis III\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Nota circa dileccionem dei novem sunt consideranda, primo que sunt que nos ad dileccionem invitant ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  endet am unteren Seitenrand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... simplicitas 1 Paralippomenon XXIX. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) 367v \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Homo quidam fecit cenam magnam, Luc. XIII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (14)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Homo iste Ihesus Christus est, (1) Thi. II (5), mediator dei et hominum, ffecit cenam magnam, quia sacietatem eterne glorie preparavit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... cum Psalmista \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (17,20)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Eduxit me in latitudinem d... idest de matris mei ventre in mundum, salvum me fecit, quoniam voluit me. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , IX 434. }

