\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  392rb\endash 393va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo dominica 15}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Dominica 15a< Nemo potest duobus dominis servire, Math. VI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (24)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Salvator noster ut sollicitudinem nostram, cor nostrum et cogitaciones cordis ad celestia erigat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quasi adiectivo modo et non substantivo. etc}

