\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  400ra\endash 402vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abeuntes Pharisei, Mathei XX \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Marci XII, Luce XV. In hoc ewangelio ostenditur nobis perfecta sapiencia dei ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  (400va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et diverterunt in vias pravas. 
\line \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  400va\endash vb Sermo in morte puellae \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Loquente Ihesu ad turbas, Mathei IX \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (18)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Luc. VIII, Marci V. Sicut pro filia mortua orat, ita apostolus pro devoto populo in epistola dicens ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (400vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Filia mea modo defuncta est. Occasione huius puelle defuncte hodie de morte est dicendum. Nota quod tres iudices triplex exercent iudicium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... cum tamen sicut vita corporis est anima, ita vita anime est deus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite leer.}

